{
 "format": "damap",
 "version": 1,
 "id": "30",
 "name": "Riverhaven",
 "file": "Map30_Riverhaven.xml",
 "includes": [
  "Map30a_Dunshade_Manor.xml",
  "Map30b_Riverhaven_Thief.xml"
 ],
 "rooms": [
  {"id":1,"x":60,"y":700,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, River Road West","descriptions":["The wooden palisade of the town wall runs down into the river, ending in the West Tower.  A narrow gate allows exit from the town into the countryside.  South of the road, a narrow strip of muddy ground surrounds numerous shanties where the local fishermen draw up their boats and work on their nets.  Small but well-kept houses line the northern side of the road where some of the more prosperous fisherfolk dwell."],"exits":[{"to":33,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":2,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":174,"exit":"go","move":"go narrow gate"},{"to":219,"exit":"go","move":"go tower"},{"to":470,"exit":"go","move":"go society hall"}],"color":"#FFBF00"},
  {"id":2,"x":100,"y":700,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, River Road West","descriptions":["Along the river, small warehouses brood on the muddy bank.  Soft lights glimmer from behind the curtained windows of a row of genteel houses nearby.  Laughter and a snatch of song drifts on the night air from a nearby group fishermen enjoying their off hours.  The sound of the night watch, pacing along the roadway reminds you that this town never completely sleeps.","Small warehouses belonging to minor Traders dot the southern side of the road fronting on the river itself.  Heavy wagons pulled by enormous draft animals crawl by, raising a cloud of dust and salt.  Several children dart in and out among the carts, unheeding of the danger of hoof and wheel as they play tag or hop onto the carts' rigging for a ride."],"exits":[{"to":3,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":1,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":3,"x":140,"y":700,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, River Road West","descriptions":["Warm light spills out from a nearby tavern.  The river gurgling quietly nearby and the cool night air makes the scents of cooking and good ale seem even more tempting.  A burst of laughter from the open doorway tells you that many have found a refuge from the night and loneliness.","The smell of good food wars with the eternal odor of salt fish in the air and finally wins out.  A half-timbered tavern on the north side of the road seems to be the source of the pleasant aromas.  A group of people are gathered on benches beneath the overhanging second story, enjoying the spectacle of the busy street while quaffing enormous mugs of the local brew and downing large portions of edibles."],"exits":[{"to":4,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":2,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":175,"exit":"climb","move":"climb dockside ladder"},{"to":199,"exit":"go","move":"go half-timbered tavern"}]},
  {"id":4,"x":200,"y":700,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, River Road West","descriptions":["Despite the late hour, the traffic is surprisingly heavy cargoes being hauled along, groups of sailors seeking refreshment and diversion, prosperous merchants hurrying home and so on.  The clank of a squad of armed city guards echoes as they dash past, lamplight gleaming from their polished helmets and pikes as they hasten to their posts.","Midway between the western watch tower and the center of town, the road bustles with traffic of all sorts.  Horse-drawn wagons vie with overstuffed handcarts, while porters elbow their way between fishermen hauling baskets of fish.  Underfoot, urchins scoot and skitter in endless complex games beyond the grasp of the heedless adults around them."],"exits":[{"to":50,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":5,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":3,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":200,"exit":"go","move":"go store"},{"to":621,"exit":"go","move":"go storage crates"}],"aliases":["DGS"]},
  {"id":5,"x":280,"y":700,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, River Road West","descriptions":["The gentle scent of baking bread rides the night air and vanquishes both rivermud and salt fish completely for a time.  The open door and windows of a cheerful bakery beckon warmly to those passing by to come in and sample the wares.","A small cluster of shops forms a wider spot on the river road.  Displacing the drab warehouses, the brightly-painted stores beckon the passerby to turn aside from mundane cares and enjoy life.  A line of children stand, noses pressed against the mullioned windows, outside what can only be a bakery, judging by the heavy scent of cinnamon and other sweet spices that floats on the air.  You feel rather tempted to join the eager row of hungry faces and see what treats reside within."],"exits":[{"to":6,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":4,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":221,"exit":"go","move":"go cheerful bakery"}]},
  {"id":6,"x":320,"y":700,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, River Road West","descriptions":["Several shops of the better class line the road, open late into the night.  Lamps on tall posts cast a warm yellow light on the roadway, and a watchman leans on his halberd, relaxed but alert.","A cluster of fine shops entices the well-to-do townsfolk to come in and browse.  Several shopgirls stand together outside one store decorated with ribbons and bows, apparently on their break.  They chatter amongst themselves and pass judgement on the fitness of various males passing by with whistles of approbation or giggles of amusement at some pot-bellied merchant wearing something that would be fashionable on anyone but him."],"exits":[{"to":7,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":5,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":222,"exit":"go","move":"go small shop"},{"to":223,"exit":"go","move":"go sandstone building"}]},
  {"id":7,"x":340,"y":700,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Town Hall Road","descriptions":["The road skirts both the Town Square and the Trader's Guild as it passes through the center of town.  The tall signal tower of City Hall rises like the spire of some Temple.  The nearby Municipal Pier is a hotbed of activity with ships coming and going and knots of Traders huddled deep in conclave over the latest prices.  The elegant facade of the Guildhall beams down on these activities with a proprietary air."],"exits":[{"to":51,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":8,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":6,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":40,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":95,"exit":"go","move":"go municipal pier"},{"to":136,"exit":"go","move":"go double doors"},{"to":137,"exit":"go","move":"go wide alley"},{"to":224,"exit":"go","move":"go trader's guild"}]},
  {"id":8,"x":460,"y":700,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Town Square","descriptions":["This square sits in the space between the Town Hall and the municipal pier.  It is a large park with the graceful gardens of the Temple set within well-tended lawns.  Here and there, benches for the public's use are set out under shady trees, and you can often find an old retired merchant or river captain taking his ease and watching the passing tide of people."],"exits":[{"to":51,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":9,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":7,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":125,"exit":"go","move":"go temple"},{"to":234,"exit":"go","move":"go town hall"},{"to":0,"exit":"none","move":"go portal","hidden":true},{"to":445,"exit":"go","move":"go meeting portal"}],"color":"#FF00FF","aliases":["Town Square","Premium Portal","portal","Kraelyst start point","travel start point","First Land Herald","Herald","newspaper","news stand"]},
  {"id":9,"x":580,"y":700,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Town Hall Road","descriptions":["The finest Inn of the region dwells here, near the center of town.  The Pierless Inn as locals know it, rises some three stories in stone and timberwork.  Perhaps as much business is done here as in the Guildhall nearby and certainly in much more cordial circumstances.  Both public and private dining can be had as well as a huge common room.  Sleeping accommodations range from the simple but clean to several elegant suites worthy of a Master Trader."],"exits":[{"to":65,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":10,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":8,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":51,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":95,"exit":"go","move":"go municipal pier"},{"to":239,"exit":"go","move":"go pierless inn"}]},
  {"id":10,"x":640,"y":700,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, River Road East","descriptions":["The river road passes among a jumble of small private warehouses and wharfage east of the town's center.  Numerous small offices and even a few well-kept homes line the northern side of the road.  Watchmen abound here, each in the livery of some trading house or shipping company.  They keep a cool eye on loiterers and those who seem to have no noticeable business."],"exits":[{"to":11,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":9,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":358,"exit":"go","move":"go oak-gabled shop"},{"to":360,"exit":"go","move":"go carousel square"},{"to":360,"exit":"go","move":"go oval doorway"}]},
  {"id":11,"x":660,"y":700,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, River Road East","descriptions":["The reek of fish hangs heavy in the air as you pass among several small fish-processing plants.  Racks of salted fillets lie in neat rows, waiting their turn in the smokehouses.  The area is a magnet for half the cats in the Province it seems, and you can barely move without treading on a tail or tripping over some speeding tabby making off with a mullet as prize."],"exits":[{"to":12,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":10,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":517,"exit":"go","move":"go meeting hall"}]},
  {"id":12,"x":680,"y":700,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, River Road East","descriptions":["Night workmen wash down and tidy up the entire area as they prepare for business in the morning.  The scent of rotting fish lingers in the air even though there's not a scale or tail to be seen.","Flies buzz about you, thick and annoying, as they swarm over the piles of fish guts and scales that are heaped along the gutter.  Fish processing of all kinds dominates the east end of town, and despite valiant civic efforts to keep the place clean, the stench is appalling."],"exits":[{"to":13,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":11,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":13,"x":700,"y":700,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, River Road East","descriptions":["Set smack amidst the smokehouses and drying racks of the fishing industry is the Saltfisher Inn, run by a local family, it is the one bright spot in this drear commercial area.  The center of social life for the workingfolk of the area, the tavern makes a noble effort to have good food and drink on call at all hours."],"exits":[{"to":72,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":14,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":12,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":93,"exit":"climb","move":"climb rickety steps"}]},
  {"id":14,"x":780,"y":700,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, River Road East","descriptions":["The store-yards of Natron, the local Salt-seller, rise along the north side of the road.  Huge piles of sea salt, brought up the weary miles by barge, lie protected under canvas covers to keep off the rain. The riverbank has been despoiled by the briny run-off and little survives there.  Even the pier is eaten away by the salt. The wood looks ready to crumble at a touch."],"exits":[{"to":74,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":15,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":13,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":77,"exit":"go","move":"go gate"}]},
  {"id":15,"x":880,"y":700,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, River Road East","descriptions":["The town wall curves down to the river and extends out into it with the heavily-fortified Eastern Tower rising above to keep watch and to control the river traffic.  A small path passes beneath the tower's shadow and through a narrow gate, wandering along the barren riverbank and out of town.  A few boats are pulled up along the shore or bob gently in the current, tied to the many poles used to control river traffic."],"exits":[{"to":16,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":14,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":203,"exit":"go","move":"go eastern gate"},{"to":263,"exit":"go","move":"go tower"}],"color":"#FFBF00"},
  {"id":16,"x":880,"y":680,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Ring Road East","descriptions":["The ring road meets the bitter end of the river road here at the point where the town wall runs out into the river to the brooding Eastern Tower.  A commercial salt vendor dominates the area, white mounds of glittering crystals piled high like a miniature mountain range."],"exits":[{"to":17,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":15,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":17,"x":880,"y":640,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Ring Road East","descriptions":["Several fish-drying sheds assault your nose with the intensity of their efforts.  One, worse even than the others, appears to specialize in some form of pickled fish mixed with some pungent herb or spice that settles into your nose as if it intended to dwell there.  You wonder how the guards in the Eastern Tower, set in the river at the end of the town wall to the south, survive it.  It does seem to have the minor virtue of driving off the blood flies that infest the river's edge."],"exits":[{"to":18,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":16,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":18,"x":880,"y":600,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Ring Road East","descriptions":["The unmistakable smell of salt mingled with drying fish warns you of the proximity of the main product of the town.  To the south, the smell increases as you approach the river.  A few rooming houses and seedy cottages straggle along the road, their paint long worn off, exposing the bare wood to the ruinous effects of the salt-laden wind."],"exits":[{"to":19,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":17,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":19,"x":880,"y":560,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Ring Road East","descriptions":["A gang of sweating and cursing Dwarves is working on repairs to the town wall.  Several timbers, even though formed of solid iron-wood, have been infested with dry rot and are being replaced.  Several Gor'Togs wait to set another heavy beam upright in the stone socket being prepared for it.  Many of the laborers appear to have come from the nearby jail, to judge by their leg-irons and bored expressions.  You notice the oaken door leading into the jail."],"exits":[{"to":20,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":18,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":76,"exit":"go","move":"go oaken door"}]},
  {"id":20,"x":880,"y":520,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Ring Road East","descriptions":["Something has snarled traffic as carts and pedestrians jumble together in a confusing tangle.  A harried watchman tries to keep everything moving, but the clog seems an inseparable part of the roadway.  Several street urchins take the opportunity to lift some fruit from a passing cart, while the driver argues the right of way with a pair of liveried servants carrying a curtained sedan chair on poles."],"exits":[{"to":19,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":21,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":75,"exit":"go","move":"go glass-doored shop"}]},
  {"id":21,"x":766,"y":446,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Ring Road East","descriptions":["A row of small cottages, set close together, huddle in the deep shadows of the outer wall.  A few lights show through shuttered windows, but most folk here seem to have gone to bed.  The roadway passes close by the simple dwellings and you can hear a pair of snorers, one a deep bass and the other, a softer, higher note that somehow form an amusing harmony in the night air.  A small, unassuming shop sits to one side of the houses.","Small houses huddle together in the shadow of the town wall.  Humble of build, they retain an air of dignity by their clean facades and tiny gardens.  Clothes hang out to dry on lines hung between the porches, and two women of indeterminate age chatter as they hang out the days' washing. One home seems to have been converted into a small shop.  A small sign hangs over the door."],"exits":[{"to":20,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":22,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":149,"exit":"go","move":"go small shop"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":22,"x":730,"y":410,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Ring Road East","descriptions":["A small open field lies vacant under the night sky.  The dim glow from a watchman's lantern high on the outer wall shows a straggle of weeds and a few flowers, recently trampled, growing among piles of brick and stone left from a ruined building.","Dusty weeds straggle over a small open space where some old building was torn down but no new one has yet risen.  Several children are engaged in a spirited game of tag amongst the few remaining piles of brick and stone.  Here and there, a lonely flower pokes its head above ground and tries to remain out of the way of the hurtling bodies."],"exits":[{"to":21,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":23,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":23,"x":700,"y":380,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Ring Road East","descriptions":["Several itinerant fishmongers cluster together under a blue and yellow-striped awning to the side of the roadway.  Each one seems to be trying to outdo the others in proclaiming the virtues, flavors and variety of his selection.  Numerous cats wander about, offering their own opinions on the assorted wares.  Many scavenger crows perch along the high outer wall, their harsh voices adding their own suggestions to the din."],"exits":[{"to":22,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":24,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":24,"x":680,"y":360,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Ring Road East","descriptions":["Even the late hour does little to diminish the commerce along this road.  A carter's yard is still open, workmen toiling under the uncertain flicker of reed torches and oil-lamps.  The pacing of the night guard, walking his lonely post along the outer side of the wall, echoes from the cobbled street.  A ladder leads up to the guard's post above you.","Busy with commercial traffic and harried pedestrians, the road follows the curve of the great wall southeastward towards the river.  A cartwright's yard stands open to the road and you glance in to see several workers hammering an iron rim onto a large wooden wheel under repairs.  A ladder leads up the guard's post above you."],"exits":[{"to":23,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":57,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":25,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":272,"exit":"climb","move":"climb narrow ladder"}]},
  {"id":25,"x":532,"y":212,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Ring Road East","descriptions":["This broad thoroughfare sweeps southeastward from the Gate of Nobles to the less lavish commercial districts of the town.  The high outer wall is solidly built of stone, topped with close-set iron-wood logs.  Heavy draft animals labor to pull carts of goods up and down the roadway while foot traffic clings to the edges to avoid being trampled."],"exits":[{"to":24,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":26,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":114,"exit":"go","move":"go large gate"},{"to":461,"exit":"go","move":"go society hall"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["naphtha cart"]},
  {"id":26,"x":460,"y":140,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Theren Way","descriptions":["The Gate of Nobles, the northern passage in and out of town, marks the end of Theren Way.  The town wall curves away to the south both east and west, providing a semi-circle defense guarded by the river.  Flanking the road are the Cleric Guild and the Noble Inn.  Providing relief for both spirit and body, the two places though disparate in style, form a curiously harmonious duo."],"exits":[{"to":25,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":58,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":27,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":204,"exit":"go","move":"go gate of nobles"},{"to":273,"exit":"go","move":"go inn"},{"to":217,"exit":"go","move":"go clerics' guild"}],"color":"#FFBF00"},
  {"id":27,"x":340,"y":140,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Ring Road West","descriptions":["To the east, the great Gate of Nobles provides the northern exodus from town.  In the quiet of the evening, this area is lit by the occasional candle glowing in the windows of the neat homes belonging to some of the more affluent in Riverhaven.  The only activity on the street is that of a young boy moving from house to house as he delivers milk and bread to each residence for the morning's breakfast.","To the east, the great Gate of Nobles provides the northern exodus from town.  This area is a quiet one of neat homes, each set in its own plot of tidy gardens and well-kept vegetable patches.  Well-dressed folk saunter along the road, chatting and passing the time of day with each other.  The clip-clop of hooves echoes brightly from the high town wall as a horse-drawn carriage makes its way southwest."],"exits":[{"to":26,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":28,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":274,"exit":"go","move":"go well-built stable"},{"to":282,"exit":"go","move":"go brick path"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":28,"x":240,"y":240,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Ring Road West","descriptions":["A stone wall blocks the view of what appears to be a small estate, as the curving road works its way southward.  The gables of a stately manor poke above the wall, giving hint to the luxury within the protected grounds.  A high wrought-iron gate permits a glimpse of extensive greensward and a fountain dancing in the air."],"exits":[{"to":27,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":73,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":29,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":105,"exit":"go","move":"go wrought gate"}]},
  {"id":29,"x":140,"y":340,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Ring Road West","descriptions":["Here stands the Academy of Learning for Riverhaven.  Small in size, it still meets the needs of those who yearn for knowledge.  The usually crowded frontage is empty and lonesome in the still of the night.  Only the faint glow of a candle through the window of the library dispels the sense of complete abandonment.","Here stands the Academy of Learning for Riverhaven.  Small in size, it still meets the needs of those who yearn for knowledge.  Students lounge about in small groups studying and preparing for their next class.  In one of the gatherings, a student raises his voice in an effort to convince the others he is correct."],"exits":[{"to":28,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":30,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":212,"exit":"go","move":"go academy"}]},
  {"id":30,"x":60,"y":420,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Ring Road West","descriptions":["Ring Road meets Silvermoon Road in a quiet intersection.  A nearby tavern attracts the local students and the occasional householder from the residential areas all about.  A tall guard tower surmounts the outer wall of the town, and you can spot the helmed head of a guardsman walking his post on the parapet.  There is a narrow ladder leading up to the northwest lookout."],"exits":[{"to":29,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":34,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":31,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":296,"exit":"go","move":"go tavern"}]},
  {"id":31,"x":60,"y":520,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Ring Road West","descriptions":["Houses here are elegant and large.  Set into gemlike lawns, these almost-mansions belong to the elite of the local Traders.  Servants work incessantly, pruning the green lawns and keeping the gardens and pathways free of weeds.  Frequent patrols of guards assure the serenity and safety of the residents."],"exits":[{"to":30,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":32,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":170,"exit":"go","move":"go tiny shop"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":32,"x":60,"y":580,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Ring Road West","descriptions":["A small series of very elegant shops line the inner curve of the roadway.  A jeweler and furrier seem to be the major attraction here.  Several well-dressed ladies gaze wistfully at the expensive displays in the windows.  Two prosperous-looking Dwarves talk in low guttural voices while examining a shipment of furs packed onto a small mule."],"exits":[{"to":31,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":33,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":171,"exit":"go","move":"go gem shop"},{"to":172,"exit":"go","move":"go furrier's salon"},{"to":621,"exit":"go","move":"go shed"}]},
  {"id":33,"x":60,"y":640,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Ring Road West","descriptions":["South of here, the road runs down to River Road and the river itself.  A few houses are scattered about, looking a bit shabby and mildly unkempt.  The damp river smell mingles with the odor of fish in a slightly noisome mix.  The one outstanding feature here is the store front of Ioun's pawnshop.  Resembling the aftermath of an explosion in a dry goods warehouse, you see everything from the newest in wares, to items only your grandfather would use."],"exits":[{"to":32,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":1,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":173,"exit":"go","move":"go noel's arms"},{"to":297,"exit":"go","move":"go pawnshop"},{"to":389,"exit":"none","move":"room sear;-3knock concealed door;-whisp door $haven.pw"},{"to":389,"exit":"climb","move":"climb wooden stairs"}],"aliases":["Convenient Spot","Stolen Goods"]},
  {"id":34,"x":80,"y":440,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Silvermoon Road","descriptions":["Silvermoon Road seems an almost derelict path of dust and rutted cobbles where it joins the outer ring road.  A small tavern and a few nondescript residences seem oriented more towards the main road than this nearly deserted byway.  An old dog sleeps, undisturbed, in the middle of the road."],"exits":[{"to":35,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":30,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":35,"x":100,"y":460,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Silvermoon Road","descriptions":["A few people hasten by you, studiously minding their own affairs.  The back walls of heavy stone buildings offer little in the way of distractions or life, and this part of town seems drab and bleak.  The cobblestone roadway is poorly maintained, with many pavers missing.  Stinking puddles of mud linger in low spots in the road."],"exits":[{"to":36,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":34,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":441,"exit":"go","move":"go society building"}]},
  {"id":36,"x":140,"y":500,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Silvermoon Road","descriptions":["A curiously ordinary shop somehow catches your eye.  It tries so hard to look normal that your senses prick with curiosity.  You cannot quite decide just what is wrong with the place.  Perhaps it is the furtive look of the few people emerging from the shop, or the way the local guards seem to ignore the building pointedly."],"exits":[{"to":37,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":35,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":169,"exit":"go","move":"go ordinary shop"},{"to":298,"exit":"go","move":"go artificer shop"},{"to":386,"exit":"none","move":"room sear;-3knock concealed door;-whisp door $haven.pw"},{"to":386,"exit":"go","move":"go shadowed corner"}],"aliases":["Silvermoon Road"]},
  {"id":37,"x":180,"y":540,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Crossroads","descriptions":["Silvermoon Road meets Crescent Way in a small crossroads.  A tangle of back alleys and side roads wanders off behind the houses and shops of town.  The traffic here is fainter, almost nonexistent and the sounds of life seem oddly muted.  Passers-by seem more hurried and keep a warier eye out than you have seen along the main roads of town."],"exits":[{"to":38,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":36,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":299,"exit":"go","move":"go brick alleyway"},{"to":566,"exit":"go","move":"go iron gate"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":38,"x":200,"y":560,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Silvermoon Road","descriptions":["The small shops and buildings of the local clans of the Halflings give way gradually to larger establishments of the northwest.  A vendor of fish sauces haggles with a housewife over her back fence, while a small passel of children play at her feet.  A nearby crossroads lead at an angle off into the back alleys and byways of town."],"exits":[{"to":66,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":46,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":39,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":47,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":37,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":39,"x":240,"y":600,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Silvermoon Road","descriptions":["A marked difference in architecture from the rest of town, indicates the Halfling Quarter.  Many low, rounded homes and single-story warehouses with sloping roofs attest to the success and mercantile skill of the local Halflings.  Even the cobbles of the road are smaller in deference to unshod feet.  One prosperous elder lounges before the round windows of his elegant home, smoking a pipe nearly the height and width of the owner, sending pungent clouds of smoke into the air."],"exits":[{"to":41,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":40,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":38,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":165,"exit":"go","move":"go brick shop"}]},
  {"id":40,"x":300,"y":660,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Silvermoon Road","descriptions":["Radiating from the center of town like the spoke of a wheel, Silvermoon Road provides a conduit from town hall to the outer wall.  Heavy traffic of all sorts winds its way along the thoroughfare.  Loaded wains and trudging porters mingle with fashionably dressed shoppers and salt-smudged workingmen.  A scant few beggars work the fringes of the road, begging bowls extended from palsied hands and gnarled fingers.  A freshly painted building watches over it all like a casual observer."],"exits":[{"to":7,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":39,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":164,"exit":"go","move":"go stacked-stone shop"},{"to":210,"exit":"go","move":"go painted building"}]},
  {"id":41,"x":280,"y":600,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Halfling Quarter","descriptions":["The cobbled stone street of the Halfling Quarter is virtually silent here.  This means that either the quarter's populace is resting, or more likely, enjoying yet another well-prepared meal.","A group of animated Halfling children dart in wild, random directions engrossed in a game of taffelberry tag.  The very rotund boy whose hair, face, and clothes are covered with the thick fruit must be It."],"exits":[{"to":42,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":39,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":387,"exit":"none","move":"room sear;-3knock trap door;-whisp door $haven.pw"}],"color":"#00FFFF","aliases":["chicken coop"]},
  {"id":42,"x":320,"y":600,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Halfling Quarter","descriptions":["Resembling a smoldering campfire, one of the small domed homes puffs out intermittent balls of smoke.  This observation and the large CLOSED sign propped in a window lead to the conclusion that this must be the local tobacco shop.","Guessing from the large volume of smoke, it looks as if one of the domed homes is afire.  It appears to be the local tobacco shop.","Neat hedges trim the path, leading up to a nondescript home heavy with the scent of fresh tobacco.  A large CLOSED sign marks the shop's front door, although a cheery light still shines from the window and smoke puffs from the chimney.","Neat hedges trim the path, leading up to a nondescript home heavy with the scent of fresh cigars.  Smoke merrily rises from its chimney, and a large sign marks it as the local tobacco shop.  A small round door leads inside, just large enough to let a tall Halfling through."],"exits":[{"to":43,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":41,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":301,"exit":"go","move":"go small shop"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":43,"x":320,"y":560,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Halfling Quarter","descriptions":["A low ring of mortar and stone watch over a rope and bucket used to retrieve water from this well.  Occasionally, the smell of sweet perfume glides in from the north, and with the shifting of the breeze, that sweetness turns to a malodorous mixture of burning weed.","A low ring of mortar and stone watch over a rope and bucket used to retrieve water from this well.  Occasionally, the smell of sweet perfume glides in from the north, and with the shifting of the breeze, that sweetness turns to the rich smoky smell of fresh tobacco."],"exits":[{"to":44,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":42,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"aliases":["Well","Water"]},
  {"id":44,"x":320,"y":540,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Halfling Quarter","descriptions":["A strong fragrance, perhaps that of blooming orchids, dances forth from a deobar door, drawing your attention to a curiously built structure.  Placed atop a familiar rounded Halfling dwelling sits a makeshift second story."],"exits":[{"to":43,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":45,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":166,"exit":"go","move":"go deobar door"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":45,"x":280,"y":540,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Halfling Quarter","descriptions":["A tall, shed roof building stands out among the low, rounded homes which comprise most of the quarter.  Flanked by Lamb's Ear shrub, this well-maintained structure proudly displays a hanging sign above a sturdy square door."],"exits":[{"to":44,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":46,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":168,"exit":"go","move":"go sturdy door"},{"to":302,"exit":"go","move":"go footpath"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":46,"x":260,"y":560,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Halfling Quarter","descriptions":["Vibrant, though minute, garden plots run alongside the tiny round homes here.  Even in this bustling town the will, and the constant hunger, of the gardening Halfling cannot be suppressed."],"exits":[{"to":45,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":38,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":47,"x":200,"y":600,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Crescent Way","descriptions":["The mud-caked lane crosses the far more prosperous and busy Silvermoon Road.  A few beggars sit or hobble around, alms bowls extended.  High wooden fences protect a few houses along the larger road from the denizens of this trade."],"exits":[{"to":38,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":48,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":209,"exit":"go","move":"go shop"},{"to":391,"exit":"none","move":"room sear;-3 knock hidden doorway;-whisp doorway $haven.pw"}],"color":"#00FFFF","aliases":["Crescent Way"]},
  {"id":48,"x":200,"y":620,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Crescent Way","descriptions":["The road, almost a lane, is narrow and choked with heaps of garbage and broken bits of debris.  The defeated and the poor, forgotten by the town, huddle in dirt and misery.  Even the most prosperous city has its misfits and failures.  Few here even look up as you pass by."],"exits":[{"to":47,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":49,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":49,"x":200,"y":640,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Crescent Way","descriptions":["The narrow lane has widened here into a small open lot, forgotten behind the windowless backs of buildings facing out onto the main roads.  A few shanties and patched tents have been set up by squatters.  The smell of garbage and worse flows out from fly-ridden piles of refuse.  A bony dog snarls at a grossly fat pig as they argue over some squalid bit of food."],"exits":[{"to":48,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":50,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":50,"x":200,"y":660,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Crescent Way","descriptions":["A chill fog creeps along the muddy cobbles of this narrow lane.  The nearby River Road's constant stream of traffic seems far away and distant.  The dim hulks of stone warehouses loom, lumpy shadows against the night sky.","The nearby hustle and bustle of River Road is muted and seems curiously distant for its only being a few steps away.  The stout backsides of stone warehouses bulk large against the sky and make this narrow lane feel even smaller than it seems."],"exits":[{"to":49,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":4,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":208,"exit":"go","move":"go small shop"}]},
  {"id":51,"x":460,"y":580,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Town Hall Road","descriptions":["This short arc of roadway connects the eastern and western halves of town.  The smooth style of the Town hall is echoed in the curving roadway, paved with granite stones flecked with brighter bits of crystal.  Heavy traffic of all sorts converges here at the mercantile and social center of Riverhaven."],"exits":[{"to":64,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":52,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":9,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":8,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":7,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":159,"exit":"go","move":"go trader building"},{"to":429,"exit":"go","move":"go market plaza"}]},
  {"id":52,"x":480,"y":560,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Blackmoon Road","descriptions":["Blackmoon Road runs at an angle to the curved main streets.  From the center of town to the Northeast Tower, as straight as an arrow.  Busy travelers of all sorts throng the cobbled way, and you edge past a clump of Elothean scholars, huddled in some arcane and deep discussion.  A brightly colored tent sets off to one side, a sign hanging crookedly from one flap."],"exits":[{"to":53,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":51,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":138,"exit":"go","move":"go colored tent"}]},
  {"id":53,"x":524,"y":516,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Blackmoon Road","descriptions":["Tall lunat trees cast deep shadows across the road.  Perhaps a pleasant place by day, there is a sinister air that raises your alertness in the cold chill of night.  The lack of even a strolling couple adds to your feelings of unease.","A few tall lunat trees spread their shade across the roadway, making green-dappled shadows that dance and sway in a soft breeze.  Many people are taking advantage of the greenery.  Several couples can be seen, taking their ease under the trees or strolling beneath the leafy canopies.  Frequent bird-song livens the air with cadences and trills and single, pure notes.  A few of the quieter birds hop from cobble to cobble, pecking at insects in the cracks."],"exits":[{"to":54,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":52,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":139,"exit":"go","move":"go bards' guild"}]},
  {"id":54,"x":590,"y":450,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Blackmoon Road","descriptions":["Neat row houses nestle together along both sides of the road.  White-washed and simple, they each have a yard, many strewn with the toys and other play-things of the children who prowl these streets by day.  The momentary glow of a pipe catches your eye, causing you to notice a lone individual sitting in the shadow of a porch, enjoying the silence of the evening.","Neat row houses nestle together along both sides of the road.  White-washed and simple, they each have their ration of children playing in the tiny yards, bouncing up and down the steps in endless complex games which no adult can even begin to comprehend.  A scissors grinder works his way down the road, calling his trade in a sing-song tone that sounds almost musical."],"exits":[{"to":70,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":55,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":71,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":53,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":142,"exit":"go","move":"go cheerful bakery"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":55,"x":630,"y":410,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Blackmoon Road","descriptions":["Blackmoon Road crosses a dreary little alley that seems to reek of garbage and other less familiar odors.  Sweating workers trudge by, sacks of fish slung over shoulders or barrels of something rancid-smelling slung on poles.  The few buildings nearby are all drab and run-down, with a worn, utilitarian look to them. A few Traders harangue tired-looking merchants as both sides argue over endless tedious details, both parties seemingly too weary and bitter to give in."],"exits":[{"to":56,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":54,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":68,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":145,"exit":"go","move":"go alley"},{"to":371,"exit":"go","move":"go iron gate"}]},
  {"id":56,"x":646,"y":394,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Blackmoon Road","descriptions":["A dilapidated and boarded-up warehouse squats on a dirt-choked and overgrown lot.  Broken bricks and splintered wood show attempts to gain entrance for whatever reason.  This is a thoroughly depressing place with man-high weeds, tainted by the ever-present salt, which struggle to grow in the cracked stone cartyard next to it.  Everyone seems to give the place a wide berth and children scurry past it uneasily."],"exits":[{"to":57,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":55,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":57,"x":664,"y":376,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Blackmoon Road","descriptions":["A cooper and a carter share space along the road.  Hammering and sawing indicate a lively business.  The smell of fresh-cut wood and pine tar is a pleasant counter to the normal fishy smell in town.  Green wood is being unloaded where it can be stacked and dried.  Looking bored, a young Gor'Tog flicks a quirt at two garns as they walk a treadmill, powering the saws and drills of both shops by an elaborate festoonery of belts and pulleys that creak and squeal and vibrate erratically."],"exits":[{"to":24,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":56,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":148,"exit":"go","move":"go rustic shop"}]},
  {"id":58,"x":460,"y":200,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Theren Way","descriptions":["Small gardens grow on both sides of the road.  Fenced about with low stone walls and hedges, they belong to the Empath Guild and hospital to the south.  Many rare and potent herbs and plants can be found here for use in healing.  Northwards, the town wall and the Gate of Nobles rise.  Nearby, a small shop sells clerical goods."],"exits":[{"to":26,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":59,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":150,"exit":"go","move":"go small shop"}]},
  {"id":59,"x":460,"y":240,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Theren Way","descriptions":["Two buildings built of cream and pink marble face each other across the road.  One is the Empath Guild, the other the Guild hospital.  Both are built with wide porches like inviting arms to welcome the sick, the suffering, and those who heal them.  The air is fresh and clean-smelling, and the twin houses of healing gleam from frequent scrubbing of the stonework."],"exits":[{"to":58,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":67,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":60,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":152,"exit":"go","move":"go empath's guild"},{"to":317,"exit":"go","move":"go hospital"}],"aliases":["crate"]},
  {"id":60,"x":460,"y":320,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Crescent Way","descriptions":["Theren Way crosses here, a busy road leading into the heart of town.  A low stone wall, painted a gentle cream color, marks off the grounds of the Empath Guild to the north.  The soothing smell of healing herbs washes away the odors of the town, leaving your mind feeling free and at ease with itself.  The dirt and squalor of this back-road vanish into well-kept stone pavers and neatly trimmed hedges along both sides."],"exits":[{"to":59,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":67,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":61,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":66,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":154,"exit":"go","move":"go oak building"}]},
  {"id":61,"x":460,"y":420,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Theren Way","descriptions":["To the north, the high wooden palisade of the town wall looms.  Nearer, small shops and stores do a brisk business.  From one of the large storefronts with many open windows comes the sound of music, a gentle voice sings a song in a language unknown to you.  The words strike you as ones of wonder, surprise and delight.  The sounds bring a smile to your face even if you cannot actually fathom their meaning."],"exits":[{"to":60,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":62,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":158,"exit":"go","move":"go bard shop"},{"to":526,"exit":"go","move":"go hall"}]},
  {"id":62,"x":460,"y":460,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Theren Way","descriptions":["Close-set but elegant row-houses line the street along both sides.  Many of the dwellings give out a cheerful glow of warm light through curtained windows.  Someone, somewhere, is playing a haunting ballad on a dulcimer, and elsewhere you hear the muted conversation and laughter of a party.  Lamps set on high poles shed a soft light over the street as the occasional late traveler passes you.  Faint wisps of fog ghost along the ground from the direction of the riverfront.","Many houses, close-set but elegant, flank the road on both sides as it makes way across the town.  Here and there, servants can be seen washing down the front walkways or trimming the neat hedges that separate each house from its neighbor.  Tiny gardens, heavy with flowers of many kinds grace each small yard and window-boxes and climbing ivy decorate the houses themselves."],"exits":[{"to":61,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":63,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":63,"x":460,"y":480,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Theren Way","descriptions":["The sturdy, almost stolid facade of the Bank of Riverhaven faces the busy roadway along the west side of the street.  A wide portico of ultramarine-hued marble ranges along the front of this massive building.  Open at all times for the convenience of Traders and other merchants, the bank has a constant stream of patrons passing through its wide portals."],"exits":[{"to":62,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":64,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":155,"exit":"go","move":"go bank"}]},
  {"id":64,"x":460,"y":520,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Theren Way","descriptions":["Running straight as an arrow, Theren Way leads from Town Hall to the Gate of Nobles at the north end of town.  Heavy stone paving makes smooth road for the heavily-laden wagons and other traffic that throngs it all hours.  Houses of the well-to-do line both sides with large gardens.  This is the heart of a prosperous, well-ordered community and the frequent patrols of armed men prefer to keep it that way.  On the west side of the road stands the office of the Provincial Administrator of Orders."],"exits":[{"to":63,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":51,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":65,"x":600,"y":680,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Blackmoon Street","descriptions":["From the busy town center, this road sweeps northeastward towards the distant town wall.  Barrows of salt fish seem the main traffic here, each followed by its perspiring owner, carefully watching over his goods.  One wall of the Pierless Inn rises along the southern edge of the road, though the ground floor is windowless on this side."],"exits":[{"to":9,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":66,"x":440,"y":320,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Crescent Way","descriptions":["In the darkness of night, this lane is quiet and still.  A heavy dew affords a reflection of even the slightest light, off anything with a flat surface.  In the silence of night, every step you take sounds like a shouting announcement of your presence.  A loud crashing noise startles you, but the flash of a stray cat scurrying away from the sound presents you with the excuse to relax.","Backyards and wash lines mingle with a few tradesmen and servants, turning this narrow lane into a minature thoroughfare.  A few children even play, running back and forth across the road or leaping up to swing from the branches of a low tree shading the roadway. Somewhere, bread is baking and the scent vies with the other odors and ever present fishy stench and finally wins out."],"exits":[{"to":60,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":38,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":448,"exit":"go","move":"go society building"}]},
  {"id":67,"x":540,"y":320,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Crescent Way","descriptions":["The Empath Hospital gleams in the darkness of night.  Fresh herbs and flowers scent the night air and sweep the cobwebs of care and toil from your mind.  Even the fresh-scrubbed cobblestones beneath your feet seem to share in the easing of your path, as they help your feet along their way.","The side of the local hospital is of pink and cream marble that glitters in the daylight.  The gentle atmosphere of peace and healing reaches even into this side road cleanses the traveler of care and worry.  An apprentice of the Empath Guild washes down the cobbled roadway with clean water and scrubs the stones with a stiff brush.  His serene look makes even this humble task into an act of giving to others."],"exits":[{"to":68,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":60,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":59,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":68,"x":590,"y":370,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Crescent Way","descriptions":["Low walls allow a glimpse into the yards of small businesses and workshops.  The heavy odor of heated metal still lingers in the dewy air, drifting from a small shop before you.  However, the absence of hearing an anvil being pounded assures you the workmen are at home with their families for the night.  The lane is now devoid of activity as silence befalls the area.","Low walls allow a glimpse into the yards of small businesses and workshops.  The heavy odor of heated metal fills the air, the clinging of metal against metal rings in your ears.  Carts loaded with crates continue to appear from behind the small shop before you and disappear down the street."],"exits":[{"to":55,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":69,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":67,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":206,"exit":"go","move":"go shop"},{"to":322,"exit":"go","move":"go warehouse entrance"}]},
  {"id":69,"x":590,"y":390,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Crescent Way","descriptions":["The road passes amongst huge dark shapes.  A lantern flickers on a pole set amongst many vats of fish, pickling in brine and spices.  A watchman paces among them, keeping an eye on the place.  Cats skulk among the dancing shadows like tiny ghosts.","Vats of fish, pickling in brine and spices crowd out into the cramped lane.  Hurried workers in leather aprons pour barrels of small fish into one of the vats while another adds careful measures of spices.  A third ladles in salt by the shovelful to make the brine."],"exits":[{"to":68,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":70,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":70,"x":590,"y":430,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Crescent Way","descriptions":["The road wanders among banked smoky fires with iron racks of fish hung above them.  In the darkness, the soot and oil from the smoking process isn't visible, but the heat beats against your face nonetheless.  It's impossible to see just what's underfoot, but the brick road is slippery and reeks of rotting fish.","The road wanders among large smoky fires with iron racks of fish hung above them.  The air is heavy with the soot and oil from the smoking process.  The bricks of the road are slippery with fish scales and discarded innards.  Busy workmen tend the fires and haul off the racks of fish, while others place new ones above the low flames."],"exits":[{"to":69,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":54,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":71,"x":700,"y":580,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Crescent Way","descriptions":["The ground is littered with smashed fish and bits of torn netting.  A few benches and a large balance scale show where, in the daytime, a small open-air market exists.   Nearby, a large dray with heavy wooden sides raised high sits, it's horses nowhere to be seen.","The ground is littered with smashed fish and bits of torn netting.  A few benches and a large balance scale show where, in the daytime, a small open-air market exists.  Nearby, a large dray with heavy wooden sides raised high sits, its horses nowhere to be seen."],"exits":[{"to":54,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":72,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":143,"exit":"go","move":"go wooden building"}]},
  {"id":72,"x":700,"y":640,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Crescent Way","descriptions":["The busy River Road runs by to the south, but here the narrow lane is quiet and deserted.  Damp fog tickles heavily along the ground, obscuring the rough cobbles and occasional fish head.  Somewhere the iron-shod footsteps of a guard can be heard, slowly pacing some dark path.","To the south, the roads ends at River Road East and joins the larger way.  Here, it is still a narrow lane choked with refuse.  Fishmongers and fisherfolk gather and mingle to buy and sell and socialize.  A cobbler does a brisk business, as workers line up to have holes patched or a new sole nailed to their heavy work-boots."],"exits":[{"to":71,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":13,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":73,"x":260,"y":260,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Tree-shaded Lane","descriptions":["This quiet, tree-shaded lane serves an elegantly turreted mansion.  Surrounded by a high stone wall, the view in is limited to glimpses of a polished slate roof set with numerous gables and dormers and one turret, rising in the center like a miniature castle."],"exits":[{"to":28,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":328,"exit":"go","move":"go wrought-iron gate"}]},
  {"id":74,"x":780,"y":680,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Natron's Workyard","descriptions":["A mountain of salt rises beneath a tattered canvas tarp.  Natron appears to be in the business of making wholesale piles into retail piles.  Bare-chested workers stand, knee-deep or worse, using heavy shovels to ladle mounds of the heavy white crystals into large burlap sacks that are then hauled away by still more sweating laborers.  A surly foreman glares at you as if waiting to see if you plan to work or gawk."],"exits":[{"to":14,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":75,"x":890,"y":520,"z":0,"title":"City Togs, Sales Room","descriptions":["Kaldar and Gor'Tog men and women browse the mannequins on display in the small shop, each of which features an outfit designed for the larger races of the land.  Warm gold and natural hues predominate, though silver accents are also visible."],"exits":[{"to":271,"exit":"go","move":"go narrow hallway"},{"to":20,"exit":"go","move":"go glass door","hidden":true}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["City Togs"]},
  {"id":76,"x":890,"y":560,"z":0,"title":"Town Jail, Lobby","descriptions":["A long wooden counter runs the length of this lobby.  A small deobar door to the west leads to the judgement chamber.  A small desk behind the counter is covered with an array of papers, some of which you recognize as warrants.  A large iron door stands in the northeast corner behind the counter.  Both the door to the judgment chamber and oaken door to the outside have secondary closable iron bars reminding you this place not only keeps prisoners in but vigilantes and would be jail-breakers out."],"exits":[{"to":19,"exit":"out","move":"out","hidden":true},{"to":270,"exit":"go","move":"go deobar door"}],"aliases":["Guard House"]},
  {"id":77,"x":780,"y":740,"z":0,"title":"Salt Yard, Entrance","descriptions":["Within the open gate stand stacks of burlap bags filled with salt, waiting to be shipped off.  Just off to the south stands a huge sparkling white mound towering over the fenced enclosure.  A bored looking guard leans up against a gatepost, bearing a long barbed spear on his shoulder."],"exits":[{"to":78,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":80,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":14,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":339,"exit":"climb","move":"climb mound"}]},
  {"id":78,"x":800,"y":760,"z":0,"title":"Salt Yard","descriptions":["Flickering torchlight from the street outside dances off the top of the huge mound of salt to the north, standing like a glistening white mountain amid a sea of darkness.  Your eyes warily search the shadows, alert for any sign of movement as a disconcerting clacking noise echoes through the empty yard.","A party of laborers scoop shovels full of salt into waiting burlap bags from a glistening white mountain to the west.  A lounging guard armed with a wicked boar spear glances about casually for any signs of trouble.  Stacks of shovels and buckets lean against the fence to the east."],"exits":[{"to":79,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":77,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":339,"exit":"climb","move":"climb mound"}]},
  {"id":79,"x":780,"y":780,"z":0,"title":"Salt Yard, Dock Entrance","descriptions":["A dull white trail of salt marks a path between the pier to the south, and the massive mound of salt to the north.  The sound of the river lapping against the pilings might be relaxing at other times, but at night in this abandoned yard, your senses are on edge to the slightest motion.","Just to the south, a long pier juts out into the river.  A steady stream of workers files past, pushing wheelbarrows full of salt, which they add to the huge mound to the north.  A few of the off-duty workers lounge about, beneath a ragged cloth sun shade, making helpful comments to their passing friends."],"exits":[{"to":78,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":81,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":80,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":339,"exit":"climb","move":"climb mound"}]},
  {"id":80,"x":760,"y":760,"z":0,"title":"Salt Yard","descriptions":["The salt mound stands close to the fence here, spilling in crystal streams right to the yards edge."],"exits":[{"to":77,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":79,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":339,"exit":"climb","move":"climb mound"}]},
  {"id":81,"x":780,"y":800,"z":0,"title":"Salt Yard, Dock","descriptions":["The long pier is spooky in the evening, seeming abandoned and almost derelict without the steady stream of activity during the day.  A barge tied up alongside floats low in the inky silent river as a family of swans floats by, grey ghosts upon the water.","You are standing atop a long pier out into the river.  A barge alongside floats low in the water, burdened by a heavy load of salt piled high on its deck.  The air is full of the grunts of sweating laborers, methodically moving shovels full of the heavy white powder from the barge into waiting wheelbarrows."],"exits":[{"to":79,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":82,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":83,"exit":"climb","move":"climb ladder"}]},
  {"id":82,"x":780,"y":820,"z":0,"title":"Salt Yard, Barge Dock","descriptions":["The end of the dock is reinforced with heavy timbers and rusting iron plates, no doubt to compensate for the extreme weight of the high piles of salt sacks.  Strategically hidden between the stacks are crates and leather satchels, their shipping labels designating their contents as decidely non-salty in origin.  None of the items appear to be black-market goods, so why such lengths were taken to disguise their transport is not clear."],"exits":[{"to":81,"exit":"north","move":"north"}],"color":"#FF00FF","aliases":["Throne City Barge"]},
  {"id":83,"x":820,"y":780,"z":0,"title":"Salt Yard, Under the Dock","descriptions":["The old pier above you groans and creaks as the current laps against the supporting beams out in the water.  Your feet sink up to the ankle in soft sticky mud, and the whole area smells of old rot.  A disturbing clacking sound comes from the silted riverbank to the west.  Dirty white piles of salt dot the ground where they have spilled from the yards above."],"exits":[{"to":84,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":81,"exit":"climb","move":"climb ladder"},{"to":85,"exit":"go","move":"go faint path"}]},
  {"id":84,"x":800,"y":780,"z":0,"title":"Salt Yard, Under the Dock","descriptions":["You stand on the silted muddy bank of the river, beneath an old wooden pier. The broad blue-green expanse of the river itself stretches out to the west, and the ground rises slowly to the east towards the town of Riverhaven."],"exits":[{"to":83,"exit":"east","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":85,"x":880,"y":780,"z":0,"title":"Salt Yard, Sandy Path","descriptions":["The damp river silt dries considerably as the land rises to the east, covering the riverbanks with a powdery carpet of silver sands.  Years of wind and storm have piled the sand high into wide dunes, and the faint scent of salt drifts upon the breeze."],"exits":[{"to":86,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":83,"exit":"go","move":"go faint path"}],"color":"#00FFFF","aliases":["Sandcastle Cove"]},
  {"id":86,"x":900,"y":780,"z":0,"title":"Sandcastle Cove, The Castle","descriptions":["An enormous sandcastle is the focal point of this hidden stretch of beach.  A constant breeze whips a shimmering silver mist from atop the dunes, striking the castle with a faint whispering chime.  Narrow trails wander off through the dunes, leading towards the dwellings visible in the distance."],"exits":[{"to":92,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":88,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":87,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":85,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":385,"exit":"go","move":"go sandstone castle"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":87,"x":880,"y":800,"z":0,"title":"Sandcastle Cove, Faldesu Riverbank","descriptions":["Thick beds of rushes growing up along the river's edge bow and whisper in the constant soft breeze that carries the scents of the sea as it drifts along the riverbank.  Several small homes have been woven from the reeds into thatch-roof dwellings, while others, shacks made from a rag-tag assortment of boards and driftwood, stand freely in the tiny riverside jungle."],"exits":[{"to":86,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":88,"exit":"east","move":"east"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":88,"x":900,"y":800,"z":0,"title":"Sandcastle Cove, Faldesu Riverbank","descriptions":["The weathered skeleton of an old shipping barge lies on its side where it ran afoul of craggy rocks during a storm.  The Faldesu softly burbles around the lower reaches of the barge, still submerged in a watery grave."],"exits":[{"to":86,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":89,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":87,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":89,"x":920,"y":800,"z":0,"title":"Sandcastle Cove, Among The Dunes","descriptions":["Local residents have assembled a hodge-podge assortment of shipping crates and other pieces of flotsam into a collection of crude but functional homes.  The rotting hulk of a capsized shipping barge is visible above a massive sand dune to the west."],"exits":[{"to":90,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":88,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":90,"x":920,"y":780,"z":0,"title":"Sandcastle Cove, Among The Dunes","descriptions":["Several low doorways framed by crude beams of driftwood lead into the sand dunes here.  Nature has reclaimed all but the entrances of the driftwood shacks buried beneath the silvery sand during a coastal tempest."],"exits":[{"to":91,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":89,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":91,"x":920,"y":760,"z":0,"title":"Sandcastle Cove, Among The Dunes","descriptions":["A multitude of small shacks cluster about this wide trough in the dunes, each composed of a single type of scavenged driftwood.  Salt-stained limbs of oak, pine, and ash stand bound tightly by strands of kelp to form crude riverside homes."],"exits":[{"to":90,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":92,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":92,"x":900,"y":760,"z":0,"title":"Sandcastle Cove, Granite Wall","descriptions":["A wall of granite thrusts up from beneath the dunes to block further exploration.  A few natural overhangs have been enclosed with debris washed ashore to provide shelter from the elements.  Several of the homes have been decorated with various pieces of seashell."],"exits":[{"to":91,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":86,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":93,"x":720,"y":680,"z":0,"title":"Saltfisher Inn, Common Room","descriptions":["Fishing acoutrements of all types fill the walls of this humble inn.  A large trout sits stuffed and displayed over the entrance, while assorted nets and ships' pulleys cover the ceiling.  Harwell Dryfoot, the inn's owner, paces back and forth between the bar and the fire.  Thankfully, Harwell's menu does not include fish, though the smell from the nearby pier tends to permeate the food anyway."],"exits":[{"to":94,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":13,"exit":"out","move":"out","hidden":true},{"to":394,"exit":"go","move":"go small trapdoor"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Saltfisher Inn","Harwell Dryfoot"]},
  {"id":94,"x":720,"y":670,"z":0,"title":"Saltfisher Inn, Dormitory","descriptions":["The furnishings of this overnight room are sparse but clean.  A worn washbasin with several simple cotton towels folded neatly upon it sits in one corner, available for use by those long-term residents who live beyond the doors lining each wall.  Unfortunately, even here the smell of fish manages to filter through."],"exits":[{"to":93,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":95,"x":460,"y":820,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Municipal Pier","descriptions":["Moving upon the smooth, tightly fitted planks, you witness the care Riverhaven gives this pier.  Faint lamp light from the city covers the wharf in a dim glow, attracting couples for a romantic stroll.  To the south you see an archway leading out of Riverhaven.","Moving upon the smooth, tightly fitted planks, you witness the care Riverhaven gives this pier.  A small boy, attempting to lure a fish with his homemade pole, curses a seabird that has made off with his tempting bait.  To the south you see an archway leading out of Riverhaven."],"exits":[{"to":9,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":7,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":96,"exit":"go","move":"go wooden archway"}]},
  {"id":96,"x":460,"y":870,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Municipal Pier","descriptions":["This wide, sturdy wharf stands high above the Faldesu River, its timber legs firmly buried in the river bed below.  Quiet now, except for the periodic ferry passenger, hushed sounds from the water rise up to you, calming your spirit.  To the south, the docks float upon murky water, while Riverhaven beckons from the north.","This wide, sturdy wharf stands high above the Faldesu River, its timber legs firmly buried in the river bed below.  A number of people, pulling carts and carrying cargo, hurriedly journey to and from the ferry.  To the south, the docks float upon murky water, while Riverhaven beckons from the north."],"exits":[{"to":97,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":103,"exit":"go","move":"go ramp"},{"to":95,"exit":"go","move":"go wooden archway"}]},
  {"id":97,"x":450,"y":870,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, The Pier","descriptions":["The sound of your feet upon the thick wooden planks cuts through the still night air.  Dark groupings of barrels and crates in haphazard piles line the pier, defining its otherwise treacherous edges.","The sounds of the working salt yard grow distant as you travel the thick wooden planks of the pier.  You pass several stacks of barrels and crates, some tied in bundles with heavy netting.  A nadira bird, perched upon a coil of rope, turns its head to fix a beady eye on you before returning to its naturally disinterested state."],"exits":[{"to":98,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":96,"exit":"east","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":98,"x":450,"y":860,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, The Pier","descriptions":["Darkness settles in around you, providing the perfect tapestry to showcase the sky's innumerable stars.  The occasional glance backward reveals the lights of Riverhaven as dim and far, leading you to believe you are truly nearing the deepest waters of the river.","The pier becomes much broader, sitting on extremely wide pilings which support it far into the water.  The constant swirl of the river beneath you becomes a bit unsettling.  Shouts and cries of varying intensity, along with the steady rumble of heavily-laden carts, greet you as you make your way to the pier's edge. "],"exits":[{"to":97,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":99,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":100,"exit":"go","move":"go iron gate"}]},
  {"id":99,"x":440,"y":860,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Pier","descriptions":["Surrounded by surrealistic calm, this furthest edge of the pier stops almost a third of the way into the river.  Large, dark moorings stand like blackened sentinels at its edge, waiting for the arrival of the massive barges which service this port.","A great throng of bodies hovers over bundles, piles and jumbles of cargo here at the furthest end of the pier.  The sole purpose of the cacophony is the readying and removal of shipments for the massive, sluggish barges which service the lake that stretches between Riverhaven and the northernmost areas of the province.  The intruding maelstrom of sights, sounds and smells is almost nauseating in its intensity."],"exits":[{"to":98,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":483,"exit":"go","move":"go barge"},{"to":205,"exit":"go","move":"go barge"}],"color":"#FF00FF","aliases":["Langenfirth Barge","Therenborough Barge"]},
  {"id":100,"x":450,"y":850,"z":0,"title":"Gwenalion Marina, Lubasa Dock","descriptions":["Never a quiet area, the marina brims with the coming and going of sailors, traders and dockworkers.  The smell of fresh tar and new paint welcomes the ships that visit, although from time to time burly guards can be seen watching for those who would attempt to get a free ride."],"exits":[{"to":101,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":98,"exit":"go","move":"go iron gate"},{"to":368,"exit":"go","move":"go audru"}],"aliases":["Marina"]},
  {"id":101,"x":450,"y":840,"z":0,"title":"Gwenalion Marina, Hara Bonfa Dock","descriptions":["The salty sea breeze brings with it the smell of fish and tar.  Nearby, benches and overturned boxes and piles of netting make a resting place for workers to gather and take their breaks.  Occasionally, one will get too restful and take a nap within the netting causing his mates to poke him awake."],"exits":[{"to":102,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":100,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":102,"x":450,"y":830,"z":0,"title":"Gwenalion Marina, Belia Maor Dock","descriptions":["Huge cargo boxes dominate this area, tied down with rope and covered in dark netting.  Sailors take turns protecting the goods meant for their ships, often stopping to chat with each other about their various voyages.","Huge cargo boxes dominate this area, tied down with rope and covered in dark netting.  Sailors take turns patrolling, shooing off children who have taken to climbing the net-covered boxes."],"exits":[{"to":101,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":103,"x":460,"y":880,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Ferry Dock","descriptions":["A mass of muddied footprints occasionally speckled with animal droppings, gives a glimpse into the heavy traffic of the now quiet landing.  The gentle caress of water massages the resting dock, preparing it for a new day.","Haphazardly placed crates, cages, carts, and animals have turned this solid mass of planks into more of a maze than a dock.  An eclectic mixture of people nudge for space, as the overloaded landing forces an uneasy closeness to strangers.  Some stand engrossed in conversation, while others sit in silence, keeping a watchful eye on their wares."],"exits":[{"to":104,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":96,"exit":"go","move":"go ramp"},{"to":201,"exit":"go","move":"go ferry","hidden":true}],"color":"#FF00FF","aliases":["Crossing Ferry","Ferry"]},
  {"id":104,"x":480,"y":880,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, East Pier","descriptions":["The eastern end of Riverhaven's docks juts out into the river, servicing schooners heading out into the Reshal Sea.  The pier is eerily silent, few ships making the dangerous night passage up the Faldesu River with the lighthouse out of commission.","The eastern end of Riverhaven's docks juts out into the river, servicing schooners heading out into the Reshal Sea.  Burly workers unload valuable cargo from exotic and distant ports, surrounded by flushed merchants screaming for care to be taken with their precious shipments."],"exits":[{"to":103,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":444,"exit":"go","move":"go kree'la"},{"to":218,"exit":"go","move":"go lybadel"}],"color":"#FF00FF","aliases":["Boats","Dock","First Land Herald","Herald","newspaper","news stand"]},
  {"id":105,"x":230,"y":230,"z":0,"title":"Aldamus House, The Sanctuary","descriptions":["Sounds outside the tall vine-covered walls are muffled and distant, giving the Sanctuary a sense of privacy and peace.  A fountain burbles into a shallow pool, visible through the surrounding grass only because of the reflections cast by the glass-enclosed candles that hang on either side of the door to the House.","Sounds outside the tall vine-covered walls are muffled and distant, giving the Sanctuary a sense of privacy and peace.  A fountain burbles into a shallow pool.  Darting flashes of gold brighten the dark green water, which is surrounded by cushions of grass that seem to beckon to bare feet.  Nearby, a more formal seating arrangement of wooden chairs shelters under several gracefully overhanging trees.  A tall, heavily carved door offers entry into the House."],"exits":[{"to":106,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":28,"exit":"go","move":"go wrought gate"},{"to":111,"exit":"go","move":"go carved door"}]},
  {"id":106,"x":230,"y":220,"z":0,"title":"Aldamus House, Lorethew Close","descriptions":["Two smoking torches supply enough light for any who wish to use the rough wooden bench resting next to one of the pillars that support a network of exposed beams.  The smudge from the torches moderates cold weather and chases insects from the small garden at warmer times of the year.","Obviously a kitchen garden, tidy rows of herbs and vegetables line the areas beween stone walkways.  A rough wooden bench rests next to one of the pillars that support a network of exposed beams.  The beams provide a home for climbing roses, vining beans, and a couple of bird nests in warmer weather, and can be covered with canvas against cold winter winds.","Obviously a kitchen garden, tidy rows of herbs and vegetables line the areas between stone walkways.  A rough wooden bench rests next to one of the pillars that support a network of exposed beams.  The beams provide a home for climbing roses, vining beans, and a couple of bird nests in warmer weather, and can be covered with canvas against cold winter winds."],"exits":[{"to":105,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":107,"exit":"go","move":"go thatched-roof guesthouse"}]},
  {"id":107,"x":220,"y":220,"z":0,"title":"Aldamus Guesthouse, Foyer","descriptions":["Green plants sway between gauzy muslin drapes that frame a partially open window.  A low bench beneath a row of pegs provides a convenient place for guests to sit while removing coats and boots before entering the guesthouse proper.  The entrance is always slightly ajar, allowing the fragrance of the garden to scent the foyer as the staff welcomes travelers to Riverhaven."],"exits":[{"to":106,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":108,"exit":"go","move":"go pointed arch"},{"to":367,"exit":"go","move":"go door"}]},
  {"id":108,"x":210,"y":220,"z":0,"title":"Aldamus Guesthouse, Dining Room","descriptions":["The kitchens at Aldamus Manor have a well-deserved reputation for excellence, as evinced by the tantalizing aromas that waft by each time the swinging doors open to allow a waiter to pass through.  Guests seated at low linen-covered tables laugh and chatter to each other as they enjoy their meal in the soft glow of candles burning in silver and crystal chandeliers.","The kitchens at Aldamus Manor have a well-deserved reputation for excellence, as evinced by the tantalizing aromas that waft by each time the swinging doors open to allow a waiter to pass through.  Guests seated at low linen-covered tables laugh and chatter to each other as they enjoy their meal.  Sunlight filters through the sheer curtains over the windows to bathe the room in a soft radiance, sparkling off the silver and crystal chandeliers."],"exits":[{"to":109,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":110,"exit":"go","move":"go swinging doors"},{"to":107,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Aldamus Dining Room"]},
  {"id":109,"x":200,"y":220,"z":0,"title":"Aldamus Guesthouse, Musician's Gallery","descriptions":["No music floats out into the dining room, just the rattle of dice cups and the low murmur of voices.  A group of men gather around a bare wooden table placing bets as one of their number rolls the dice."],"exits":[{"to":108,"exit":"east","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":110,"x":210,"y":210,"z":0,"title":"","descriptions":[],"exits":[]},
  {"id":111,"x":220,"y":230,"z":0,"title":"Aldamus House, Anteroom","descriptions":["The faint odor of furniture polish wafts on the air, and the well-polished surfaces of the small library table and its two adjoining chairs betray the source.  Tall wooden shelves stand nearby, holding a few books and some bric-a-brac, flanked by ironwood and deobar doors.  Half-hidden behind a screen in one corner, a chute stands ready for donated goods, and a small cart discreetly holds some refreshments for the weary.  A curious serpentine arch leads deeper into the House."],"exits":[{"to":113,"exit":"go","move":"go deobar door"},{"to":105,"exit":"go","move":"go carved door"},{"to":112,"exit":"go","move":"go ironwood door"},{"to":0,"exit":"go","move":"go serpentine arch"}]},
  {"id":112,"x":210,"y":230,"z":0,"title":"Aldamus House, Sitting Room","descriptions":["Heavy jacquard drapes cover the wide window, providing privacy and lending a cozy air to the room.  Several upholstered chairs are scattered in conversational groupings under the watchful gaze of past Mentors immortalized by various artists.  The room's flickering candles make the eyes on the paintings seem to wink and flirt.  A tall gilded harp stands silent in one corner next to the narrow marble mantle topping a dark stone fireplace.","A wide window, framed by hanging ferns and covered with a gauzy drape, looks out over the Sanctuary.  Several upholstered chairs are scattered in conversational groupings under the watchful gaze of past Mentors immortalized by various artists.  A tall gilded harp stands silent in one corner next to the narrow marble mantle topping a dark stone fireplace."],"exits":[{"to":111,"exit":"go","move":"go ironwood door"}]},
  {"id":113,"x":220,"y":240,"z":0,"title":"Aldamus House, Conservatory","descriptions":["Tall candles are carefully interspersed with the potted plants that push the wicker sofas and chairs to the center of the carpeted floor.  Two of the walls are taken up by huge jalousied windows overlooking the Sanctuary and the Close, covered against the night air by graceful silken drapes that stir in the slightest breeze.  Occasionally a red-faced housemaid slips silently into the room to freshen the hors d'oeuvres left on a sideboard.","Potted plants, arrangements of flowers, and small decorative trees line the walls of the large room, pushing the cushioned wicker sofas and chairs into the center of the carpeted floor.  Two of the walls are taken up by huge jalousied windows overlooking the Sanctuary and the Close, lending an airy effect while providing shelter from the elements.  Occasionally a red-faced housemaid slips silently into the room to freshen the hors d'oeuvres left on a sideboard."],"exits":[{"to":111,"exit":"go","move":"go deobar door"}]},
  {"id":114,"x":587,"y":212,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, A Garden Path","descriptions":["Walled with high, neatly trimmed hedges, this gravel path leads southwest to a large marble building and northeast to a gate.  Entrance to the structure is through an intricately carved arch, inlaid with gold leaf.  Large torch lamps placed every few paces, battle back the darkness of night.","Walled with high, neatly trimmed hedges, this gravel path leads southwest to a large marble building and northeast to a gate.  Entrance to the structure is through an intricately carved arch, inlaid with gold leaf.  Large torch lamps placed every few paces, await their duty of providing light during the hours of darkness."],"exits":[{"to":115,"exit":"go","move":"go carved arch"},{"to":25,"exit":"go","move":"go large gate","hidden":true}],"aliases":["War Mage Guild"]},
  {"id":115,"x":597,"y":212,"z":0,"title":"Warrior Mage Guild, Entrance Hall","descriptions":["The polished elegance of this grand chamber is muted in the pale light of several glowing spheres set about the room.  A grand staircase of white marble rises to a large balcony above.  The Guildmistress lounges in a plush, blood-red leather chair in the center of the dimly-lit hall, idly stroking a flame-shrouded wand in one hand."],"exits":[{"to":116,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":114,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":121,"exit":"climb","move":"climb grand staircase"},{"to":341,"exit":"climb","move":"climb grand staircase;climb grand staircase;climb grand staircase"}],"color":"#FF8000","aliases":["GL Warrior Mage","GL WM","Karazhil"]},
  {"id":116,"x":597,"y":202,"z":0,"title":"Warrior Mage Guild, Residential Halls","descriptions":["A dark mahogany paneling, polished to a mirror finish, covers the walls of this narrow hallway.  Soft carpeting hushes footsteps that might disturb the residents enjoying their privacy."],"exits":[{"to":117,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":115,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":117,"x":597,"y":192,"z":0,"title":"War Mage Tower, Air Floor","descriptions":["A dark grey carpet decorated with a pattern of crossing black lightning bolts covers the floor, matching the decoration on the grey-painted walls.  A constant, low thrum hangs just inside the range of hearing, its source nearby not readily apparent.  Doors spaced in an even circle around the perimeter lead to initiates' cells."],"exits":[{"to":116,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":118,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":340,"exit":"climb","move":"climb brass staircase"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":118,"x":587,"y":192,"z":0,"title":"War Mage Tower, Water Floor","descriptions":["Deep blue carpeting covers the floor, its surface cut in a manner that suggests the rippling of waves upon the surface of a lake.  Bright blue spirals, representing the element of water, fill the walls between a series of doors leading to initiates' private cells.  The air here is moist and cool upon the skin."],"exits":[{"to":119,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":117,"exit":"down","move":"down"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":119,"x":587,"y":182,"z":0,"title":"War Mage Tower, Fire Floor","descriptions":["Lush, red carpeting covers the floor, muffling any ambient noise into oblivion.  Images of bloated red suns, representing the element of fire, fill the walls between a series of doors leading to initiates' private cells.  The air here is significantly warmer than on the tower's other floors, although the reason is not readily apparent."],"exits":[{"to":120,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":118,"exit":"down","move":"down"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":120,"x":587,"y":172,"z":0,"title":"War Mage Tower, Aether Floor","descriptions":["Carpeting the color of a death shroud covers the floor, devouring the light as hungrily as Aldauth consumes souls.  The walls are devoid of decoration, instead painted a uniform black to match the floor.  Only the doors leading to initiates' cells betray any hint of color in this otherwise cold, bleak room."],"exits":[{"to":119,"exit":"down","move":"down"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":121,"x":617,"y":212,"z":0,"title":"Warrior Mage Guild, Balcony","descriptions":["Polished white marble tiles and an engraved ivory balustrade lend the Guildhall a sense of understated elegance.  Brightly glowing gaethzen spheres provide a stark contrast to the subdued lighting of the Entrance Hall.  Curving away to the north, the balcony leads deeper into the heart of the Guild."],"exits":[{"to":122,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":124,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":115,"exit":"down","move":"down"}]},
  {"id":122,"x":627,"y":202,"z":0,"title":"Warrior Mage Guild, Lounge","descriptions":["Several groups of chairs, each thickly padded with goose down, fill this otherwise-empty room.  A place for discourse and teaching, the lounge provides Warrior Mages with relaxation from the trying battles of the day."],"exits":[{"to":121,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":123,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":123,"x":617,"y":202,"z":0,"title":"Warrior Mage Guild, Hall of Warriors","descriptions":["The focus of this oversized room is a circle of sand in the center of a ring of benches.  Used for friendly sparring or to illustrate lessons in strategy and tactics, the pit is a gathering place for those who follow the Path of the Warrior.  Several jars of multi-colored sand rest against the wall, beside crates storing miniatures of troops and buildings.  A small weapons rack rests to the south."],"exits":[{"to":122,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":124,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":124,"x":607,"y":202,"z":0,"title":"Warrior Mage Guild, Study","descriptions":["Statues of the Guild's most famous mages line the walls of this study, their silent eyes weighing all who enter.  Several shelves, crafted from gleaming ebonwood, fill the walls of the room, holding rare scrolls and books filled with lore of combat, tactics and magic.  A great tapestry rests upon the northern wall, its threads gleaming brightly despite its age."],"exits":[{"to":123,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":121,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}]},
  {"id":125,"x":490,"y":680,"z":0,"title":"Temple, Garden","descriptions":["Within the white plastered walls of the temple lies a peaceful oasis, away from the noise and distraction of the streets outside.  A narrow brick path meanders through a miniature landscape of shrubs, flowers and small trees.  Velvet smooth grass covers the low rolling hillocks, and just up the path a ways, you see a small flowing stream winding its way northward."],"exits":[{"to":126,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":130,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":8,"exit":"go","move":"go temple gate","hidden":true}],"aliases":["Temple","almsbox","Sirese"]},
  {"id":126,"x":500,"y":680,"z":0,"title":"Temple, Garden","descriptions":["Following the meandering path through the garden, you come upon a dark still pool lined with mossy grey stones.  An alabaster statue of a woman stands at one end, her arms outstretched as if to embrace someone standing in the shallow water.  A thin stream pours from her cupped palms into the pool below, and a small rivulet flows off into the garden from a channel cut in the opposite side."],"exits":[{"to":127,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":125,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"aliases":["Pool of water"]},
  {"id":127,"x":500,"y":670,"z":0,"title":"Temple, Garden","descriptions":["A simple wooden bridge spans a miniature crystal stream.  The water dances over smooth round stones carefully placed in the stream bed and rings in the air like tiny muted bells.  The path wanders through low hillocks garbed with brilliant green grass and crowned with mossy upright stones which rest atop the mounds as if grown there.  Silent robed figures drift through the gardens like gentle ghosts, engrossed in their private meditations."],"exits":[{"to":126,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":128,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":130,"exit":"go","move":"go bridge"}]},
  {"id":128,"x":490,"y":660,"z":0,"title":"Temple, Garden","descriptions":["Surrounding the path on all sides is a sea of flowering vines, spilling in green waves over the smooth edge of an oval depression filled with sand.  Raked ridges in the sand move in smooth harmonious spirals towards a strangely shaped lump of red flaked quartz resting in the center.  Matching lines of polished tile mark the borders of a pathway leading away towards a marble columned shrine.  You hesitate to even move for fear of disturbing the perfect peace in this tranquil garden."],"exits":[{"to":127,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":129,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":133,"exit":"go","move":"go pathway"}]},
  {"id":129,"x":480,"y":660,"z":0,"title":"Temple, Garden","descriptions":["The red brick pathway skirts the edges of a clear still pool lined with moss covered chunks of limestone and granite.  The small stream which runs through the garden empties here, sending intricate patterns of ripples dancing off the pool's edge.  A few fragrant blossoms float serenely atop its glassy surface. Delicate chimes hung from the branches of a miniature oak sing a sparkling melody in the breeze."],"exits":[{"to":128,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":130,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":130,"x":480,"y":670,"z":0,"title":"Temple, Garden","descriptions":["Although you catch occasional glimpses of the outer wall through the trees, this still silent garden seems miles removed from the mundane world.  An ancient cherry tree stands alongside the trail, its downy blossomed boughs arching overhead like a pink dusky sky, raining down sweet perfume on the breeze.  A branch in the path leads towards a simple wooden bridge stretching across a crystal stream."],"exits":[{"to":129,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":125,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":127,"exit":"go","move":"go bridge"},{"to":131,"exit":"go","move":"go sand trail"}]},
  {"id":131,"x":480,"y":690,"z":0,"title":"Temple, Shrine","descriptions":["Twin lines of towering ash form living columns supporting a vast green canopy over your head, which rustles faintly as the wind moves through it.  The ground beneath your feet is covered in a soft carpet of grass and clover spotted with sweet yellow flowers.  The living arch leads to a raised dais upon which sit two lifelike figures carved from gleaming pink marble, set before a thick curtain of old vines."],"exits":[{"to":130,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":132,"exit":"go","move":"go vine curtain"}]},
  {"id":132,"x":490,"y":690,"z":0,"title":"Temple, Dark Shrine","descriptions":["A faint whiff of corruption rises from piles of old rotting leaves covering the ground you stand on.  The spreading foliage overhead casts deep shadows over the area, and you glance warily into the darkened recesses trying to find some source for the unease you feel.  Towering thorn hedges all about you seem to creep closer as you watch."],"exits":[{"to":131,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":211,"exit":"go","move":"go dark opening"}],"color":"#A6A3D9","aliases":["Shrine2-02","Harawep"]},
  {"id":133,"x":500,"y":660,"z":0,"title":"Temple, Shrine","descriptions":["Strong marble columns stand at the four corners of the shrine supporting an intricate latticework roof covered in flowering vines.  A simple marble altar stands at the far end of the shrine before a brilliant tapestry in black and gold.  The ground is strewn with fresh rose petals which give off a sweet perfume as you walk."],"exits":[{"to":128,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":134,"exit":"go","move":"go plaster gazebo"}],"color":"#A6A3D9","aliases":["Shrine2-01","Divyaush"]},
  {"id":134,"x":510,"y":660,"z":0,"title":"Temple, Ash and Plaster Gazebo","descriptions":["Sanded white ash planks have been laid out as the floor for the gazebo, and sturdy arches of white plaster rise gracefully overhead, trailing streamers of silverleaf vine hanging from them.  A small enclosed area rises up toward the back, its doors hanging silently open, and rippling stairs flow down on the opposite side, heading out to the Temple's lush gardens."],"exits":[{"to":135,"exit":"go","move":"go enclosed area"},{"to":133,"exit":"climb","move":"climb rippling stairs"}]},
  {"id":135,"x":521,"y":660,"z":0,"title":"Temple Gazebo, Candle Alcove","descriptions":["Light plays in subtle and shifting hues off the pale ash floors of this tiny alcove.  Candles line the walls, stored neatly away in hundreds of tiny niches.  A high window in the north-most wall lets in a scrap of sunlight that touches gently on the scrubbed alabaster altar sitting in the center of the room."],"exits":[{"to":134,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":136,"x":370,"y":660,"z":0,"title":"Traders' Guild, Caravan Stable","descriptions":["Light filters through the windows on the double doors, illuminating the clean, whitewashed expanse of the guild's stable walls and dozens of spacious stalls line the interior, each thickly carpeted with fresh straw.  Stable boys bustle about filling water troughs and currying road dust from newly-arrived pack animals under the watchful supervision of the stable master."],"exits":[{"to":7,"exit":"out","move":"out","hidden":true},{"to":137,"exit":"go","move":"go double doors"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Caravan Stable"]},
  {"id":137,"x":360,"y":660,"z":0,"title":"Traders' Guild, Shipping Dock","descriptions":["The only place busier than this loading area is the nearby Trading Pit.  Guild workmen unload and empty crates from arriving caravans.  These same workers then fill and load the crates upon other caravans for shipment to other guilds.  The shipping clerk, standing in the center of this tempest of activity, is perhaps the only force which keeps total chaos at bay.  Beyond the rise of some steep steps you hear frenzied cries of business from the Pit."],"exits":[{"to":7,"exit":"out","move":"out","hidden":true},{"to":357,"exit":"go","move":"go steep steps"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Shipment Clerk"]},
  {"id":138,"x":490,"y":560,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Brebokt's Tent","descriptions":["Small in size, this tent appears to not only offer a place to train, but from the furnishings it is Brebokt's home as well.  A small round table sets in the center with large fluffy pillows placed around it.  Brebokt himself sits studying an old yellow parchment.  Several clay jars sit on a small table behind him."],"exits":[{"to":52,"exit":"out","move":"out","hidden":true}],"color":"#FFFF00","aliases":["Reflex Training"]},
  {"id":139,"x":561,"y":545,"z":0,"title":"Bards' Guild, Foyer","descriptions":["The large antechamber with its vaulted ceiling and cream walls is warm and welcoming, giving bards and their visitors a place to shake off the weather.  Cloak hooks of polished brass dot the walls at various heights and reed mats protect the grey-blue of the slate floor from muddy boots.  A scarlet banner moves softly in the air above the tall archway at the far end of the foyer."],"exits":[{"to":141,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":140,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":53,"exit":"out","move":"out","hidden":true},{"to":347,"exit":"go","move":"go tall archway"}],"aliases":["Bard Guild"]},
  {"id":140,"x":551,"y":545,"z":0,"title":"Bards' Guild, Performance Hall","descriptions":["A grand black and white marbled arch stands at one end of this immense room.  The walls are covered in rich purple tapestries to reduce echo but not so much as to remove the open ambiance of the area.  An orchestra pit with room for a dozen musicians sits in front of the deobar wood stage that caters to bards from every corner of the land.  To the side you see the door to the rehearsal room."],"exits":[{"to":139,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":303,"exit":"go","move":"go marbled arch"},{"to":304,"exit":"go","move":"go door"}]},
  {"id":141,"x":571,"y":545,"z":0,"title":"Bards' Guild, Guildmaster's Office","descriptions":["This niche off the Great Hall still shows signs of its original purpose as a storage area.  Warm hooked rugs scattered on the floor and bright woven hangings on the wall can only soften the ragged scars in the stone where casks and crates were once stacked.  Tucked rather awkwardly in the corner, a heavy desk vies for room with an iron pot-bellied stove."],"exits":[{"to":139,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#FF8000","aliases":["GL Bard","Tasdrean","RS Bard"]},
  {"id":142,"x":600,"y":450,"z":0,"title":"Elamir's Bakery","descriptions":["Massive stone ovens burn along the back wall, keeping the bakery cozy in the winter but stifling hot in summer.  Apprentices bustle about, kneading bread dough or rolling out pastry crusts, as the master baker supervises from his position behind the counter."],"exits":[{"to":54,"exit":"out","move":"out","hidden":true}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Elamir's Bakery","Bakery"]},
  {"id":143,"x":720,"y":580,"z":0,"title":"Glazed Expressions, Display Area","descriptions":["Darting between tall racks of glass samples and windowframe styles, Foramin the glazing salesman follows his customers around the shop with an avaricious glint in his eye.  Endeavoring to secure a sale before potential clients have a chance to change their minds or take their business elsewhere, his endless sales patter and fawning manner make his company somewhat wearing during even the speediest transaction."],"exits":[{"to":144,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":71,"exit":"out","move":"out","hidden":true}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Glazed Expressions","window shop"]},
  {"id":144,"x":730,"y":580,"z":0,"title":"Glazed Expressions, Work Room","descriptions":["This gloomy room would be windowless were it not for the items in the work box.  A foul-faced Dwarven man hunches over a low table, his grubby fingers fiddling with bits of putty and splintered wooden slats in a reluctant effort to patch up the forlorn objects entrusted to his care.  Given appropriate encouragement, the idle glazer has been known to sell the elderly windows rather than expend his energies mending them."],"exits":[{"to":143,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":145,"x":650,"y":430,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Blind Alley","descriptions":["The benighted alley is barely visible to the passers-by hurrying along Blackmoon Road, their eyes fixed straight ahead and their thoughts set on the comforts of home.  At this hour, the ordinary townsfolk know better than to glance over here and risk witnessing something the locals would much rather keep to themselves.","A short step away from the bustle of Blackmoon Road, this sunless alley slips into the shadows like an asp.  A thick silence hangs heavily in the hot breath of the buildings it serves, muffling footsteps and muting the busy hum of the outside world.  The ever-present stench of salt and drying fish crowds in, clinging to clothing and chiding remembrance of the industrious warehouses which dominate this part of town."],"exits":[{"to":146,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":55,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":146,"x":650,"y":440,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Blind Alley","descriptions":["Thick blackness shrouds every feature of the alley even on a night of three moons, making it impossible to discern whether the figures skulking in the shadows are imaginary monsters or entirely real ones.  Unidentifiable items clatter and disperse under any stumbled footstep, awakening echoes fit to shatter windows in comparison with the fraught silence.","Enclosed almost completely by the backs of tall structures, the alley is shrouded in long shadows even during the day.  Underfoot, indiscernible discarded items make the footing treacherous and slippery, forcing passers-by to thrust their arms outward, as if sightless, in hopes of grabbing some handhold to keep from stumbling to the filthy floor."],"exits":[{"to":145,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":147,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":147,"x":650,"y":450,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Blind Alley","descriptions":["Oppressive silence reigns despite an impression of swift, efficient activity in the shifting shadows.  Somewhere within a recess between two storehouses, sharp eyes memorize every feature of your face and clothing, but the intermittent glint of moonlight on cold metal cautions against looking too closely in return.","A towering stack of tea chests and wooden pallets sprawls outward from a recess between two storehouses, creaking quietly with every slight settling of one box against another.  Innumerable sets of footprints and wheelmarks criss-cross the alley, etching the signs of frequent business into the dead end's flint and grit surface.  Overhead, a faded wooden sign screeches a protest at every scrap of breeze which sets it swinging on its rusty iron chains."],"exits":[{"to":146,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":305,"exit":"go","move":"go recess"}],"aliases":["Blind Alley","recess"]},
  {"id":148,"x":664,"y":386,"z":0,"title":"MAMAS Company, Riverhaven Branch","descriptions":["Raw wood and sawdust litter the floor of the Assay Office, and scaffolding, loose timbers, planks, and tools lie everywhere.  Amidst the noise of hammers and saws, an assay clerk stands impassively behind a tin-topped counter."],"exits":[{"to":57,"exit":"go","move":"go log door","hidden":true}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["MAMAS Company"]},
  {"id":149,"x":756,"y":446,"z":0,"title":"Crin's Herbal Shop, Salesroom","descriptions":["The smell of green, living things fill your nostrils as you stare around Crin's humble shop.  Plants and herbs grow in splendid array along the walls and even along the sides of the counter.  Moss hangs from the ceiling and Elephant's Ear plants grow from large clay pots located by the door.  Crin, a young human, busily spends most of his time pruning and watering the greenery."],"exits":[{"to":21,"exit":"out","move":"out","hidden":true}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Crin's Herbal Shop","herbs"]},
  {"id":150,"x":446,"y":200,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Cleric Shop","descriptions":["Although only a small window exists in this shop, it does not suffer from a lack of lighting.  Just about everywhere a lit candle could safely sit, you see one.  Thick fabrics line the walls behind the shelves of goods, quieting the room and protecting the ears from the sounds outside.  Behind a small simple table sits the owner, Friar Othorp."],"exits":[{"to":58,"exit":"out","move":"out","hidden":true},{"to":151,"exit":"go","move":"go fabric curtain"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Cleric Shop"]},
  {"id":151,"x":435,"y":200,"z":0,"title":"Cleric Shop, Storage Room and Supplies","descriptions":["A small opening in the thick fabric leads out to the main room of the cleric shop.  Tucked neatly on shelves are boxes filled with various clerical supplies.  Tables are layered with wares for sale, imported by Friar Othorp from the finest merchants around.  A robed attendant tends to the merchandise, stocking the tables as needed."],"exits":[{"to":150,"exit":"go","move":"go small opening"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":152,"x":450,"y":240,"z":0,"title":"Empaths' Guild, Entrance","descriptions":["The Empath Guild vestibule is bare of ornamentation and creature comforts, opting instead for a cleanliness and simplicity displayed in its unadorned wooden furniture and bare floors and walls.  A single desk, heavily laden with a tangled mess of notices and records, sits in the corner, the last vestige of the guild offices which have been emptied for hospital space.  A half-dozen chairs along the wall serve to accomodate guild members, patients, and their family and friends.","The Empath Guild vestibule is bare of ornamentation and creature comforts, opting instead for a cleanliness and simplicity displayed in its unadorned wooden furniture and bare floors and walls.  A single desk, heavily laden with a tangled mess of notices and records, sits in the corner, the last vestige of the guild offices which have been emptied for hospital space.  A half-dozen chairs along the wall serve to accommodate guild members, patients, and their family and friends"],"exits":[{"to":153,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":59,"exit":"out","move":"out","hidden":true}],"color":"#FF8000","aliases":["GL Empath","Nebela Mentrade","RS Empath"]},
  {"id":153,"x":440,"y":240,"z":0,"title":"Empaths' Guild, Library","descriptions":["Little more than a closet, the empath library is windowless and cramped.  The absence of light, with the minor exception of a single burning candle, and the lack of fresh air may at first add to an appearance of inhospitality.  A small collection of volumes organized on a large wooden crate validates the room's title of library.  However, the true purpose of the room is easily discerned by the exhausted snores of two overworked empaths drawn to the room's silence for some well-deserved rest."],"exits":[{"to":152,"exit":"east","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":154,"x":480,"y":340,"z":0,"title":"And So To Bed","descriptions":["Elegant chandeliers laden with tall beeswax candles illuminate this spacious salesroom, showing off the inventory of finely-crafted beds to excellent advantage.  An impressive variety of designs and materials are on show, arranged in tasteful mock bedchambers that invite customers to browse at leisure amongst the stylish displays."],"exits":[{"to":60,"exit":"out","move":"out","hidden":true}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["And So To Bed","bed shop"]},
  {"id":155,"x":500,"y":480,"z":0,"title":"Bank of Riverhaven, Main Lobby","descriptions":["The sound of clinking coins fills your ears as you take in the solid granite architecture about you.  A pair of well-to-do Elotheans pass you by as they make their way to a darkly-stained deobar arch.  A thin looking teller awaits beyond it for the next transaction to be asked of her.  A lone dwarf leans against one of the walls observing the people coming and going with a watchful eye.  Though small, the dwarf seems capable and ready to stop any would-be robbers."],"exits":[{"to":63,"exit":"out","move":"out","hidden":true},{"to":156,"exit":"go","move":"go arch"}],"aliases":["Bank"]},
  {"id":156,"x":510,"y":480,"z":0,"title":"Bank of Riverhaven, Teller","descriptions":["A very thin-looking Elothean sits behind iron bars that separate her from the customers that come in, save for one small slot that looks large enough to pass money through.  In a small silver cage just behind the teller is a brown and white finch to help keep her company when business gets slow.  To the west you see the door to the exchange room."],"exits":[{"to":155,"exit":"go","move":"go dark-stained arch"},{"to":157,"exit":"go","move":"go deobar door"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Teller"]},
  {"id":157,"x":510,"y":470,"z":0,"title":"Bank of Riverhaven, Foreign Exchange","descriptions":["The room you are in is bare of any furnishings except for a table and a surly dwarf.  Solid white granite walls give the small room a more open feeling than there really is.  The dwarf appears weighted down with numerous bags which you feel may carry different denominations of coinage.  He motions you over as if your presence in the room is a bothersome thing."],"exits":[{"to":156,"exit":"go","move":"go deobar door"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Money-changer","Exchanger"]},
  {"id":158,"x":470,"y":420,"z":0,"title":"House of Bardic Blues, Wayfarer's Den","descriptions":["Sweeping folds of deep blue broadcloth drape every wall from ceiling to floor, making the shop appear more like a tent than a building in the middle of town.  Candles of all shapes and sizes are arranged throughout the room, adding to the nomadic feel while providing some meager light.  Exotic odors linger to tantalize the senses, while the faint sounds of castanets clap rhythmically in the background.  Plump pillows in various shades of blue lie sprawled about if one feels the need to relax."],"exits":[{"to":61,"exit":"out","move":"out","hidden":true},{"to":320,"exit":"go","move":"go flowing curtain"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["House of Bardic Blues","Wayfarer's Den","Bard shop"]},
  {"id":159,"x":424,"y":666,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven Trader Market, Reception Hall","descriptions":["A stately oak staircase ascends to an airy second floor gallery, proving an overlook to the milling crowd below.  Through the railings that prevent people on the upper story falling to the Reception hall, traders and shoppers can be seen haggling and handling merchandise.  Above the noisy mob rises the vaulted wooden ceiling, its crystal chandeliers lighting the entire building."],"exits":[{"to":160,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":51,"exit":"out","move":"out","hidden":true}],"aliases":["Tables"]},
  {"id":160,"x":424,"y":656,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven Trader Market, Bronze Room","descriptions":["Clothing, toys, and baubles of all sorts hang on the bronze-paneled walls, representing some of the goods that might be found here.  Oak railing separates the area from a precarious drop to the room below where the receptionist waits to announce tables opening to the incoming customers."],"exits":[{"to":163,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":161,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":159,"exit":"down","move":"down"}]},
  {"id":161,"x":414,"y":646,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven Trader Market, Gold Room","descriptions":["Decorative armor and shields line the gold-papered walls, representing some of the goods that might be found here.  Oak railing separates the area from a precarious drop to the room below where the receptionist waits to announce tables opening to the incoming customers."],"exits":[{"to":162,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":160,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}]},
  {"id":162,"x":424,"y":636,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven Trader Market, Copper Room","descriptions":["Ceremonial swords line the copper-painted walls, representing some of the goods that might be found here.  Oak railing separates the area from a precarious drop to the room below where the receptionist waits to announce tables opening to the incoming customers."],"exits":[{"to":163,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":161,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":163,"x":434,"y":646,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven Trader Market, Silver Room","descriptions":["Rolled scrolls and trinkets painted to look like cambrinth stones hang on the silver-textured walls, representing some of the goods that might be found here.  Oak railing separates the area from a precarious drop to the room below where the receptionist waits to announce tables opening to the incoming customers."],"exits":[{"to":160,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":162,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":164,"x":310,"y":660,"z":0,"title":"Thringol's Weapon Shop, Salesroom","descriptions":["A magnificent display of crushing and smashing weapons is arrayed behind the counter.  Each is engraved with the name of its original owner, however time and use has rendered the engraving too faint to read.  A single shield sits proudly on the west wall with a small sign attached to it.  Thringol himself gruffly cleans some dirt off the other instruments of death that he has offered up for sale.  He shuffles about in his dirty socks while his boots rest in the corner of the shop."],"exits":[{"to":40,"exit":"out","move":"out","hidden":true}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Thringol's Weapon Shop","weapons"]},
  {"id":165,"x":240,"y":590,"z":0,"title":"Mirglyn Sisters, Goldsmiths","descriptions":["Brightly burning lamps hang above the low felt-topped tables used by the Mirglyn sisters in their work.  Small glass-front drawers holding assorted metal clasps and other findings used in the jewelers' creations line the back of each bench."],"exits":[{"to":39,"exit":"out","move":"out","hidden":true}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Mirglyn Sisters","jewelry"]},
  {"id":166,"x":320,"y":530,"z":0,"title":"Smaragdaus' Joy, Front Room","descriptions":["This shop is filled with perfume scents and the underlying aroma of chocolate.  Despite the humble surroundings, this business offers quality gifts for the romantic.  A square box sits above the large hole cut into the ceiling, obviously an attempt to reach a taller market."],"exits":[{"to":44,"exit":"out","move":"out","hidden":true},{"to":167,"exit":"go","move":"go door"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Smaragdaus' Joy"]},
  {"id":167,"x":320,"y":520,"z":0,"title":"Smaragdaus' Joy, Scrivener's","descriptions":["Fragrant bundles of drying tobacco in white cheesecloth bags hang from the rafters, perfuming the dusty air.  Assorted overturned boxes surround a rickety table topped by cards and a stack of painted wooden chips, evidently the site of a regular game.  In the far corner, beneath a window, sits a slant-topped desk holding an array of pens and paper."],"exits":[{"to":166,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":168,"x":270,"y":540,"z":0,"title":"Noot's Teahouse, Main Room","descriptions":["Patrons of the teahouse enjoy peaceful conversation while sipping and munching on the establishment's splendid edibles.  A wavering stream of cinnamon smoke wanders carelessly through the room.  Carmellia Noot can be found either helping customers or talking to two young elven gentlemen who are sitting at the counter."],"exits":[{"to":45,"exit":"out","move":"out","hidden":true}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Noot's Teahouse"]},
  {"id":169,"x":150,"y":490,"z":0,"title":"Ss'Thran's Locks, Workroom","descriptions":["This room is a place of shadows and darkness.  The few windows are heavily-curtained so that little light filters in.  A shaded lantern on a shelf throws dancing pools of light that illuminate little.  There is a glitter of scales, a flash of ivory fangs as Ss'Thran turns his chill gray eyes on you.  A faint hiss escapes him as he inquires your business."],"exits":[{"to":36,"exit":"out","move":"out","hidden":true}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Ss'Thran's Locks","locksmith"]},
  {"id":170,"x":50,"y":520,"z":0,"title":"Cecelia's Blossoms, Showroom","descriptions":["The fragrances of sweet roses and spicy lavender intermingle, creating a heady perfume that fills this small shop.  Twisted vines, potted plants and brilliant floral arrangements completely hide the walls, creating a tropical jungle-like atmosphere.  The air feels heavy with humidity from the multitude of moisture-laden plants.  Cecelia, a willowy Elven woman, smiles at you from her side of an elaborately carved acanth wood counter."],"exits":[{"to":31,"exit":"out","move":"out","hidden":true}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Cecelia's Blossoms"]},
  {"id":171,"x":70,"y":580,"z":0,"title":"Anthelorm's Gems and Curios, Purchasing Office","descriptions":["Your first glance at this elegant shop is confusing.  Instead of the expected cases and shelves of gleaming gemstones and expensive items, the room seems almost bare.  Only one table can be seen and that is small and simple.  On one wall is one small display case with only three items. The lady of the shop bustles up to you in a rustle of crisp silks and a whiff of something exotic and smiles delicately."],"exits":[{"to":32,"exit":"out","move":"out","hidden":true}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Anthelorm's Gems and Curios","Gems"]},
  {"id":172,"x":50,"y":580,"z":0,"title":"Fara's Furs, Showroom","descriptions":["Furs of all types and styles are arranged meticulously in display cases in front of you as you peruse the room.  Caps, backpacks, vests and other items that once were the furs of some of the finest creatures that live are shown.  Fara herself stands behind the counter wearing a striped fur coat and carrying an air of superiority, knowing that traders from all over the province come to her first before they would even think of looking at another's furs."],"exits":[{"to":32,"exit":"out","move":"out","hidden":true}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Fara's Furs","Bundles"]},
  {"id":173,"x":50,"y":640,"z":0,"title":"Noel's Arms, Showroom","descriptions":["The weapon shop is a clean well-lit room with a green tiled floor and whitewashed walls.  A long wooden counter runs all along the back wall, blocking access to the open doorway leading into the workshop.  Peering through the door, you can see apprentice swordsmiths engaged in a variety of tasks.  Some clean and polish weapons, another sits before a spinning stone wheel, carefully grinding a fine edge onto a rapier blade."],"exits":[{"to":33,"exit":"out","move":"out","hidden":true}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Noel's Arms"]},
  {"id":174,"x":20,"y":700,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven Exterior, Southwest Gate","descriptions":["A narrow gate leads through the fortified wall here, providing travelers with access to the town.  Too small for wagons, this area's peacefulness is shattered only by the occasional hoof-beat.  Through the gate can be viewed a mixed selection of dwellings.  To the south a guard stands in a tower carefully watching the horizon, ready to sound the alarm if needed.  A wide, well traveled path heads off to the northwest."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":0,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":1,"exit":"go","move":"go gate"}],"aliases":["W Gate","wgate"],"linksTo":"Map33_Riverhaven_West_Gate.xml"},
  {"id":175,"x":160,"y":720,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Floating Platform","descriptions":["This small floating platform, tied to a dockside ladder, gently rocks with the motion of the Faldesu.  Emerging from the river beneath the wharf are great heaps of refuse, consisting mostly of splintered lumber:  perhaps the wreckage of boats lost in some recent storm or battle.  A dark gap between two such piles leads deep under the wharf."],"exits":[{"to":176,"exit":"go","move":"go gap"},{"to":3,"exit":"climb","move":"climb dockside ladder"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":176,"x":120,"y":820,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Under Wharfs","descriptions":["The river lies blind in the vast shadow cast by the wharf overhead.  However, soft moonlight is visible through a gap between the heaps of broken, barnacled timbers, dancing across the river's surface.","The river lies blind in the vast shadow cast by the wharf overhead.  However, sunlight pierces the gloom and reaches its fingers through a gap between heaps of broken, barnacled timbers to set the Faldesu ablaze with sparkling brilliance."],"exits":[{"to":177,"exit":"north","move":"swim north"},{"to":175,"exit":"go","move":"go gap"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":177,"x":120,"y":800,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Under Wharfs","descriptions":["The planking overhead is in especially good repair, sealing out light almost entirely.  Though the remains of the former section of wharf and the building that fell through it lie heaped all about, a sort of path has been cleared through the rubble, curving from the south to the northwest."],"exits":[{"to":176,"exit":"south","move":"swim south"},{"to":178,"exit":"northwest","move":"swim northwest"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":178,"x":80,"y":760,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Under Wharfs","descriptions":["A wooden fishing bobber floats serenely by on its way downriver to the open sea.  Bits of leaves and moss collect around a piling, rising and falling with the water as a few fish try to stay under the cover of the moss.  A rectangular gap in the planking overhead suggests someone might fish this spot regularly."],"exits":[{"to":179,"exit":"north","move":"swim north"},{"to":180,"exit":"northeast","move":"swim northeast"},{"to":181,"exit":"east","move":"swim east"},{"to":177,"exit":"southeast","move":"swim southeast"},{"to":196,"exit":"south","move":"swim south"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":179,"x":80,"y":740,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Under Wharfs","descriptions":["Unnerved by the silence, you lightly slap the water just to hear some noise.  Reflecting oddly off the wharf above and carrying through the water, the ominous sound makes you regret breaking the silence of this cold, dark world.","Unnerved by the silence, you lightly slap the water just to hear some noise, making sure that your hearing has not been affected by the water.  A snail clinging to the bottom of the wharf above your head seems to nearly match your pace through the murky water.  You peer through the slats of the wharf but only occasionally see a citizen passing overhead."],"exits":[{"to":180,"exit":"east","move":"swim east"},{"to":195,"exit":"southeast","move":"swim southeast"},{"to":178,"exit":"south","move":"swim south"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":180,"x":100,"y":740,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Under Wharfs","descriptions":["Little odious bits of floating garbage occasionally bump into you as they slowly ride the river eastward.  The stench assails your lungs, but total darkness mercifully spares your eyes the sight.","The delicious aroma of baking bread wafting from above tempts you to inhale deeply, but when you do the stench of decaying garbage fills your lungs instead.  Apparently some of Riverhaven's citizens do not give the river its due respect.  Mercifully, very little light slips through the cracks to illuminate the river and whatever else is in it."],"exits":[{"to":181,"exit":"southeast","move":"swim southeast"},{"to":178,"exit":"southwest","move":"swim southwest"},{"to":179,"exit":"west","move":"swim west"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":181,"x":120,"y":760,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Under Wharfs","descriptions":["You lean against a piling for a moment to catch your breath, but mosquitoes as large as bees seem to home in on you and make your stay as unpleasant as possible.  You look about in confusion trying to get a sense of where you are, but the darkness and the maze of pilings are daunting."],"exits":[{"to":184,"exit":"northeast","move":"swim northeast"},{"to":183,"exit":"east","move":"swim east"},{"to":182,"exit":"southeast","move":"swim southeast"},{"to":195,"exit":"south","move":"swim south"},{"to":196,"exit":"southwest","move":"swim southwest"},{"to":178,"exit":"west","move":"swim west"},{"to":180,"exit":"northwest","move":"swim northwest"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":182,"x":140,"y":780,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Under Wharfs","descriptions":["In the nearly total darkness you bump into the remains of a piling, which once supported the wharf above but now supports only a colony of barnacles.","One of the pilings here has rotted right through, leaving a slimy wooden stalagmite that ends just inches above Faldesu's turbulent surface.  Fortunately the ceiling above seems no worse for it."],"exits":[{"to":183,"exit":"north","move":"swim north"},{"to":185,"exit":"east","move":"swim east"},{"to":186,"exit":"southeast","move":"swim southeast"},{"to":195,"exit":"west","move":"swim west"},{"to":181,"exit":"northwest","move":"swim northwest"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":183,"x":140,"y":760,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Under Wharfs","descriptions":["Bits of fish and other undigested food floats by.  Apparently you are under a tavern where the owner dumps his garbage from the day's feasting.  The water barely moves here and the stench from the bloated debris only hastens your desire to move on as quickly as possible."],"exits":[{"to":184,"exit":"north","move":"swim north"},{"to":185,"exit":"southeast","move":"swim southeast"},{"to":182,"exit":"south","move":"swim south"},{"to":195,"exit":"southwest","move":"swim southwest"},{"to":181,"exit":"west","move":"swim west"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":184,"x":140,"y":740,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Under Wharfs","descriptions":["Your heart almost leaps out of your ribcage as a solid thump from above echoes through the wharf.  You overhear grunting and more loud noises as you pause a moment, fearing that whoever is fighting above you may break through the thin planks.  After a moment, the racket lessens and is followed by a hearty cheer.  It sounds as if whoever bet on the winner is very pleased with the outcome."],"exits":[{"to":183,"exit":"south","move":"swim south"},{"to":181,"exit":"southwest","move":"swim southwest"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":185,"x":160,"y":780,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Under Wharfs","descriptions":["The sounds of crickets intermingle with your heartbeat causing it to race faster, but you're not sure why.  The lapping of the river against the wharf makes a slow slurping sound as bits of plants and twigs mix with the water making it thicker and harder to move through."],"exits":[{"to":186,"exit":"south","move":"swim south"},{"to":182,"exit":"west","move":"swim west"},{"to":183,"exit":"northwest","move":"swim northwest"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":186,"x":160,"y":800,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Under Wharfs","descriptions":["Strands of cobwebs brush lightly against your face, creating goosebumps on your skin as you move about in the low light.  Mumbled sounds from above do nothing to help you feel any more at ease.  You feel for a solid place to put your hand to steady yourself, but almost end up cutting yourself on the badly splintered wooden pilings."],"exits":[{"to":185,"exit":"north","move":"swim north"},{"to":187,"exit":"southeast","move":"swim southeast"},{"to":182,"exit":"northwest","move":"swim northwest"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":187,"x":180,"y":820,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Under Wharfs","descriptions":["In the darkness above, boards creak and groan under the onslaught of dozens of stomping feet.  Or maybe they're dancing.  Whatever it is, the few weak rays of light from a guttering lantern which leak between the planks are intermittently blocked by the moving bodies.","Your heart nearly stops as a great bearlike roar pierces the air, rivalling the cry of the World Dragon itself.  But after a few moments, you realize it was merely someone snoring prodigiously in the room above.  The sleeper must have shuttered his windows, for very little light reaches you through the planking."],"exits":[{"to":188,"exit":"northeast","move":"swim northeast"},{"to":186,"exit":"northwest","move":"swim northwest"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":188,"x":200,"y":800,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Under Wharfs","descriptions":["Trace amounts of phosphorous in the river glimmer faintly, but provide far too little light to see.  The sound of music and laughter trickles down from above.","The sound of music and laughter trickles down from above, as does a little light.  A gap in the netting allows you to follow the river eastward."],"exits":[{"to":189,"exit":"north","move":"swim north"},{"to":187,"exit":"southwest","move":"swim southwest"},{"to":193,"exit":"go","move":"go gap"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":189,"x":200,"y":780,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Under Wharfs","descriptions":["A glimmer of flickering torchlight shines through a knothole in the planking above.  Not really enough to illuminate, it is nevertheless bright enough to ruin your night vision for a while.","A knothole in the planking above admits a narrow beam of light.  Darkness would be preferable.  Many of the deobar pilings supporting the wharf have eroded or been chewed away, giving the impression that the whole mess will collapse any day now.  You have no desire to be underneath it when it does."],"exits":[{"to":188,"exit":"south","move":"swim south"},{"to":190,"exit":"northwest","move":"swim northwest"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":190,"x":180,"y":760,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Under Wharfs","descriptions":["Trace amounts of phosphorous in the river glimmer faintly, but provide far too little light to see.","Someone has strung heavy fishing nets along the pilings to either side, forcing you to travel either northwest or southeast.  Several carrionfish are occupied with the body of a young rivertooth entangled in one of the nets.  Perhaps the netting is here to keep this watery path safe from predators."],"exits":[{"to":189,"exit":"southeast","move":"swim southeast"},{"to":191,"exit":"northwest","move":"swim northwest"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":191,"x":160,"y":740,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Under Wharfs","descriptions":["Trace amounts of phosphorous in the river glimmer faintly, but provide far too little light to see.  A syncopated plopping noise indicates water or some other liquid dripping from above.","Very little light issues from the planking above, but a steady drip does. Moving closer to it, you identify it as cheap wine, doubtless leaking from an even cheaper barrel in a warehouse above."],"exits":[{"to":190,"exit":"southeast","move":"swim southeast"},{"to":192,"exit":"south","move":"swim south"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":192,"x":160,"y":760,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Under Wharfs","descriptions":["Trace amounts of phosphorous in the river glimmer faintly, but provide far too little light to see.  You hear the swirling and gurgling of the river around you and the occasional bump or footstep from above.","Narrow rays and pinpricks of light filtering through the planks of the wharf above form an artificial night sky supported by a bewildering array of pilings.  Trace amounts of phosphorous swirl madly in the river.  The overall effect is quite beautiful but somewhat disorienting.  One especially thick ironwood piling catches your eye."],"exits":[{"to":191,"exit":"north","move":"swim north"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":193,"x":220,"y":800,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Under Wharfs","descriptions":["Trace amounts of phosphorous in the river glimmer faintly, but provide far too little light to see.  A little salt trickles down from above.","A few stray grains of salt and a few narrow beams of light slip between the planks of the wharf above.  Where the two meet, they sparkle like fairy dust, or like Faenella's eyes -- a sharp contrast to the flotsam and junk caught between the pilings."],"exits":[{"to":194,"exit":"southeast","move":"swim southeast"},{"to":188,"exit":"west","move":"swim west"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":194,"x":240,"y":820,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Under Wharfs","descriptions":["Trace amounts of phosphorous in the river glimmer faintly, but provide far too little light to see.","The wreckage of a small boat caught in the maze of pilings blocks further progress eastward.  Other wreckage and oddments have been trapped against it by the current, including what looks like an Elven thighbone.  Beneath the river's surface, your feet brush against something solid but slimy."],"exits":[{"to":193,"exit":"northwest","move":"swim northwest"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":195,"x":120,"y":780,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Under Wharfs","descriptions":["Feeling your way around in the dark, it quickly becomes clear that debris makes the way south impassible.  Now and then a muffled giggle is audible over the gentle noise of the swirling water.","A twisted tangle of debris impedes southward movement.  A tiny water beetle darts around aimlessly on the water's surface, heedless of the river's mad swirls and eddies."],"exits":[{"to":181,"exit":"north","move":"swim north"},{"to":183,"exit":"northeast","move":"swim northeast"},{"to":182,"exit":"east","move":"swim east"},{"to":179,"exit":"northwest","move":"swim northwest"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":196,"x":80,"y":800,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Under Wharfs","descriptions":["Miniature whitecaps are the river's reaction to the submerged debris it encounters on its eastward journey.  They glow with what looks like moonlight but is really, according to the Lorethews, phosphorescent algae.  Pretty, but you couldn't read a book by the meager light."],"exits":[{"to":178,"exit":"north","move":"swim north"},{"to":181,"exit":"northeast","move":"swim northeast"},{"to":197,"exit":"south","move":"swim south"},{"to":198,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":197,"x":80,"y":840,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Under Wharfs","descriptions":["A tremendous splash shatters the silence and pelts the back of your head with heavy drops.  You whirl to see a smallish turtle paddling frantically away, more frightened of you than you were by its noisy dive into the river."],"exits":[{"to":196,"exit":"north","move":"swim north"},{"to":198,"exit":"northwest","move":"swim northwest"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":198,"x":60,"y":820,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Under Wharfs","descriptions":["For a brief moment your feet touch bottom.  Then to your chagrin, the riverbed twitches and shifts under your feet, then swims away upriver!  Strange that so large a ray could maneuver in this twisted labyrinth of pilings and submerged junk."],"exits":[{"to":196,"exit":"northeast","move":"swim northeast"},{"to":197,"exit":"southeast","move":"swim southeast"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":199,"x":140,"y":710,"z":0,"title":"Dead Bird's Paradise","descriptions":["A massive stuffed albatross, its outstretched wings suspended from the ceiling, hovers over the heads of the denizens of this small tavern.  Tables and chairs are packed together tightly, leaving just enough room for the barmaid to squeeze between as she delivers orders.  The floor is sticky with spilled ale and crumbs of food, and the cheerful sound of voices raised in somewhat drunken songs echoes from the rafters."],"exits":[{"to":3,"exit":"out","move":"out","hidden":true}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Dead Bird's Paradise"]},
  {"id":200,"x":200,"y":710,"z":0,"title":"Enfermine's Dry Goods, Showroom","descriptions":["Neat and tidy is the only way to describe Enfermine's shop of goods.  Everything in its place and a place for everything keeps repeating in your mind.  Row upon row of items needed for the traveler are stacked in good order all around you.  Leaning across the counter in anticipation of a quick sale, Enfermine tries to gauge your net worth so as to receive the highest profit possible from you."],"exits":[{"to":4,"exit":"out","move":"out","hidden":true}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Enfermine's Dry Goods","dry goods","general store"]},
  {"id":201,"x":440,"y":900,"z":0,"title":"Her Opulence","descriptions":["Long, wide and low, this vessel is built for utility, but the hand of luxury can be discerned in the ornately carved walnut railings, down-cushioned benches and the well polished deck.  Six lanterns along the ferry's rail fill the boat with a soft light, creating a feeling of closure from the surrounding blackness."],"exits":[{"to":103,"exit":"go","move":"go riverhaven docks"},{"to":0,"exit":"go","move":"go north docks"}],"linksTo":"Map998_Transports.xml"},
  {"id":202,"x":480,"y":900,"z":0,"title":"His Daring Exploit","descriptions":["Most of the passengers on this low riding barge have descended into quiet conversation, not wishing to stir the night.  A single lantern, swinging from the fore rail, pushes its dull gold rays across the dark water."],"exits":[{"to":103,"exit":"go","move":"go riverhaven docks"},{"to":0,"exit":"go","move":"go north docks"}],"linksTo":"Map998_Transports.xml"},
  {"id":203,"x":920,"y":700,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Stone Bridge","descriptions":["The lanes outside the eastern gate of Riverhaven are crowded with the bustle of street peddlers and merchant wagons coming and going in a great rush to sell their wares.  Beggars line the paved road, aware that the more influential and wealthy folks use this gate.  They hover, hands extended, hoping that a moment of kindness and charity might befall them.  A stone bridge that once provided passage across the river is now little more than a crumbling stone pier used by some local fishermen."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":15,"exit":"go","move":"go gate"}],"aliases":["E Gate","egate"],"linksTo":"Map31_Riverhaven_East_Gate.xml"},
  {"id":204,"x":460,"y":120,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Outside North Gate","descriptions":["The great North Gate guards the entrance to the town of Riverhaven.  Guards lounge nearby, leaning on their pikes but still managing to keep a wary eye on people passing their post.  A wide road, impassable for now due to construction work, runs northwards.  A dirt path wanders northeast, away from the main road."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":26,"exit":"go","move":"go gate"}],"aliases":["N Gate","ngate"],"linksTo":"Map32_Riverhaven_North_Gate.xml"},
  {"id":205,"x":420,"y":880,"z":0,"title":"Theren's Star, Deck","descriptions":["The first of the massive barges to traverse Lake Gwenalion, Theren's Star still maintains a quiet elegance despite its apparent age.  The utilitarian deck upon which casual travelers walk is spartan, but the decking is made of expensive tabor wood felled from far southern forests.  An oval doorway leads down to the barge's cargo bay, while an elaborately-carved wooden door provides ingress to the comfortably appointed lounge."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"go","move":"go doorway"},{"to":0,"exit":"go","move":"go wooden door"},{"to":0,"exit":"go","move":"go langenfirth wharf"},{"to":99,"exit":"go","move":"go riverhaven pier"}],"linksTo":"Map998_Transports.xml"},
  {"id":206,"x":562,"y":370,"z":0,"title":"Bantheld's Ironworks, Salesroom","descriptions":["You immediately notice the stark simplicity of this armor shop.  No fancy displays or signs, just a half-awake Gor'Tog sitting behind the oak counter swatting away the occasional fly.  An inelegant catalog sits atop the counter waiting for your review.  A large wooden door leads to the back room from whence you hear much banging and scraping."],"exits":[{"to":68,"exit":"out","move":"out","hidden":true},{"to":342,"exit":"go","move":"go large door"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Bantheld's Ironworks","ironworks"]},
  {"id":207,"x":780,"y":840,"z":0,"title":"Stone Docks, Covered Shore","descriptions":["Barely extending from the shore, the dock is little more than a short series of solid blocks of weather-battered stone.  Thick sheets of canvas are lashed in a tent-like fashion around this port, keeping the onslaught of the skies and winds at bay while also serving to mask its presence from passing ships.  With the excessive vegetation that creates yet another disguising layer outside the canvas, it's clear that many boats could pass along the Faldesu without ever knowing this place exists."],"exits":[],"linksTo":"Map35_Throne_City.xml"},
  {"id":208,"x":210,"y":660,"z":0,"title":"Unspiek's Repair Shop, Workroom","descriptions":["The sound of hammering and grinding is deafening in this cramped workshop.  The heat from a small forge nearly roasts you and you try to move away from it without getting in the way of an apprentice hammering out fist-sized dents in a bloody steel cuirass.  Unspiek, a squat and massive Dwarf, is filing the nicks out of a battle-axe nearly as broad as he is.  Sparks shower the floor from his rapid work and the noise, on top of the rest of the infernal din, makes your teeth ache."],"exits":[{"to":50,"exit":"out","move":"out","hidden":true}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Unspiek's Repair Shop","Repair Metal"]},
  {"id":209,"x":190,"y":610,"z":0,"title":"Seli's Armory, Sales Room","descriptions":["A masked figure, clad head to toe in black leather, stands alongside a scaled curtain dividing the front room from the workshop in back.  Only a little light filters into the room through the drawn window shades, lending the whole room a spooky, otherworldly feel.  Shadowy outlines along the walls reveal themselves on closer examination as pieces of leather armor hung for display."],"exits":[{"to":47,"exit":"out","move":"out","hidden":true},{"to":370,"exit":"go","move":"go scaled curtain"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Seli's Armory","armor"]},
  {"id":210,"x":290,"y":660,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Dance Academy","descriptions":["Jeseri's dance academy consists of a single room with polished hard wood floors.  Polished metal paneling provides students and teacher alike with reflected images that allows self observation.  An assistant dance instructor acknowleges you with a smile then turns back to her students, continuing her patient coaching.  A young elf sits quietly in the corner, awaiting his instruction to provide more music on his lute.  There is a large sign that is tacked to the wall on the far end of the room."],"exits":[{"to":40,"exit":"out","move":"out","hidden":true}],"color":"#FFFF00","aliases":["Agility Training"]},
  {"id":211,"x":500,"y":690,"z":0,"title":"Temple, Shadowy Chamber","descriptions":["A lone candle glows faintly atop a corroded slab of black stone, caked with a filthy mixture of dirt, old leaves, and wax.  Its light is eerily muted, and fades into a wall of shadows which seem to press inwards with each tiny flicker of the flame.  A thick moist stench assaults you, flowing in warm sickening waves from somewhere out in the blackness.  Tangled roots hanging from the ceiling reach out and grab you as you make your way through the near-dark cavern, as if moved by some malicious will."],"exits":[{"to":132,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FFFF00","aliases":["Discipline Training","opening","triage"]},
  {"id":212,"x":150,"y":350,"z":0,"title":"Academy, Garden","descriptions":["Low stone benches rest beneath the shade of a large cherry tree in full bloom.  Fallen pink petals cover the ground in a sweet-smelling floral carpet.  To the west stands an old brick building, which a sign proclaims is the Riverhaven Town Library.  To the north and east stand newer buildings of stone set up as classrooms."],"exits":[{"to":214,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":215,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":216,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":213,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":29,"exit":"out","move":"out","hidden":true}]},
  {"id":213,"x":140,"y":350,"z":0,"title":"Academy, Library","descriptions":["A grim-faced Dwarven librarian sits behind a dusty desk piled high with papers, glowering at visitors as they come and go.  Faded scrolls and pieces of parchment rest on display behind panes of protecting glass.  A wooden reading table runs through the center of the room, next to a tall shelf covering one wall."],"exits":[{"to":212,"exit":"go","move":"go door"}],"aliases":["Academy Library"]},
  {"id":214,"x":150,"y":340,"z":0,"title":"Academy, Lecture Hall","descriptions":["A small lectern set upon a table stands alone and exposed at the front of the room, facing rows of high-backed chairs where students sit, each waiting their turn to speak.  Aside from the front podium which is flanked by 4 glowing lanterns, the room is poorly lit, with shades covering all of the windows."],"exits":[{"to":212,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FFFF00","aliases":["Charisma Training"]},
  {"id":215,"x":160,"y":350,"z":0,"title":"Academy, Lecture Hall","descriptions":["Cheery, attentive students sit on polished wooden benches gazing up at an instructor jotting notes on a black slate board.  The teacher is animated in his lecturing, and seems truly engrossed in his subject.  Against the back wall is a banner reading Knowledge is the key to unlocking many doors."],"exits":[{"to":212,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FFFF00","aliases":["Wisdom Training"]},
  {"id":216,"x":150,"y":360,"z":0,"title":"Academy, Lecture Hall","descriptions":["This small room is not designed like the other lecture halls found in this academy.  Here, chairs sit in small groups of three to four, with each cluster having its own professor assigned.  Several discussions are taking place, while some instructors wait for students to join their group.  A large slate board dominates the room and has something written on it."],"exits":[{"to":212,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FFFF00","aliases":["Intelligence Training"]},
  {"id":217,"x":480,"y":140,"z":0,"title":"Clerics' Guild, Main Entrance","descriptions":["A silent, masked figure stands before the tall arched doorway leading onto the street, a naked sword resting across his folded arms.  A spotless red tile floor stretches between clean white walls under a tall beamed ceiling. Robed figures glide quietly by, engrossed in their private errands.","A silent, masked figure stands before the tall arched doorway leading onto the street, a naked sword resting across his folded arms.  A spotless red tile floor stretches between clean white walls under a tall beamed ceiling.  Robed figures glide quietly by, engrossed in their private errands."],"exits":[{"to":26,"exit":"out","move":"out","hidden":true},{"to":343,"exit":"go","move":"go door"},{"to":344,"exit":"climb","move":"climb stair"}],"aliases":["Clerics' Guild"]},
  {"id":218,"x":500,"y":860,"z":0,"title":"Lybadel, Main Deck","descriptions":["In the middle of the ship, the main deck is closest to the water of all the open decks, and on a hard heel the waves can wash over the exposed planks.  For this reason, everything is securely fastened down to keep it from sliding or being washed away, and the hatches are tightly dogged shut.  Forward lies the forecastle and an oak door leading to the galley, while aft rises the quarterdeck and under it, a cabin door."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"go","move":"go oak door"},{"to":0,"exit":"go","move":"go cabin door"},{"to":0,"exit":"climb","move":"climb narrow ladder"},{"to":0,"exit":"climb","move":"climb steep stairway"},{"to":104,"exit":"go","move":"go riverhaven"},{"to":0,"exit":"go","move":"go surlaenis"}],"aliases":["Lybadel","Aesry"],"linksTo":"Map998_Transports.xml"},
  {"id":219,"x":20,"y":660,"z":0,"title":"West Guard Tower, Entrance","descriptions":["A bored-looking city guard sits slumped over a mound of paperwork behind a simple wooden desk.  Various notices are posted on the wall behind his head.  To his left, an open doorway leads to a steep flight of stairs heading up to the second floor."],"exits":[{"to":1,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":220,"exit":"go","move":"go door"}]},
  {"id":220,"x":20,"y":640,"z":0,"title":"West Guard Tower, Barracks","descriptions":["Narrow cots, each with a footlocker at the end, extend into the circular room like spokes in a wheel.  A trapdoor in the floor leads down to the first level, while a ladder in one corner leads up to the next.  Light comes from torches lining the mortared stone walls.  Two barred slit windows look out over the countryside from the western side of the wall."],"exits":[{"to":219,"exit":"go","move":"go trapdoor"},{"to":267,"exit":"climb","move":"climb ladder"}]},
  {"id":221,"x":280,"y":710,"z":0,"title":"Lokthal's Bakery Shop, Salesroom","descriptions":["You begin to salivate freely as your eyes take in the pastries and confections arranged before you.  A small dwarven child rushes in and immediatly places his face against the glass of a nearby display that holds a luscious yellow and white funnel cake.  Lokthal is busy mixing together ingredients for some sweet concoction and every now and then takes a lick from his fingers in glee."],"exits":[{"to":5,"exit":"out","move":"out","hidden":true}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Lokthal's Bakery Shop"]},
  {"id":222,"x":300,"y":720,"z":0,"title":"Clothiers, Sales Floor","descriptions":["Brightly colored silk veils hang down from the ceiling above you, forming a brilliant canopy overhead.  Rich velvet curtains hang from the shop's many windows, and the floor is covered in a soft thick rug.  Several low tables are set about the room, piled with bolts of cloth and spools of decorative thread and ribbon."],"exits":[{"to":6,"exit":"out","move":"out","hidden":true}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Clothiers"]},
  {"id":223,"x":340,"y":740,"z":0,"title":"A Touch of Comfort","descriptions":["This cozy shop is decorated with bright linens and cheerful paints in rich primary colors.  Arranged around the room, a collection of comfortable-looking armchairs invites customers to sit down and enjoy Sereah's charming company while she demonstrates the quality of her wares and the durability of her fabrics."],"exits":[{"to":6,"exit":"out","move":"out","hidden":true}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Touch of Comfort","chair shop"]},
  {"id":224,"x":360,"y":640,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Traders' Guild Lobby","descriptions":["The lobby of the Guild is a grand place.  High narrow windows of stained glass show pictures of traders bringing the benefits of civilized marketing and goods to primitive peoples in many lands and strange places.  The heavy carpeting on the floor is done in patterns representing coins and monies of distant and forgotten lands.  Nearby, the Guild Office handles official matters.  A tall and wide doorway, gated and guarded, leads to the Trading Pit where only Traders may go to conduct their deals."],"exits":[{"to":225,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":7,"exit":"out","move":"out","hidden":true},{"to":226,"exit":"go","move":"go guild office"},{"to":227,"exit":"climb","move":"climb curved stairway"},{"to":357,"exit":"go","move":"go wide gate"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Trader","Trade Minister"]},
  {"id":225,"x":370,"y":640,"z":0,"title":"Traders' Guild, Foreign Trade Office","descriptions":["This office suite is the paragon of efficiency.  Assistants quickly and quietly enter and leave carrying reports of the needs of neighboring provinces and what they have to offer this one.  A map of the known world graces a plastered wall."],"exits":[{"to":224,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Interprovincial Broker"]},
  {"id":226,"x":350,"y":640,"z":0,"title":"Traders' Guild, Office","descriptions":["The Office of the Guild handles all official matters.  Promotions, joining, leaving and all internal disputes are brought here for the Master Trader to handle.  A huge desk, covered with scrolls and tally-sheets and rosters occupies the center of the room.  An equally massive safe sits nearby, holding secure the finances of this branch."],"exits":[{"to":224,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FF8000","aliases":["GL Trader","Willowbrook","RS Trader"]},
  {"id":227,"x":360,"y":630,"z":0,"title":"Traders' Guild, Upper Hallway","descriptions":["This hallway leads to the Guild library and to a small lounge overlooking the Trading Pit.  Walls painted a soft blue harmonize with pale gold carpeting.  The frenzied atmosphere below is much reduced here.  A few apprentices lounge about talking quietly among themselves or reading scrolls from the library."],"exits":[{"to":230,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":224,"exit":"climb","move":"climb curving stair"},{"to":228,"exit":"go","move":"go guild library"},{"to":229,"exit":"go","move":"go small lounge"}]},
  {"id":228,"x":370,"y":630,"z":0,"title":"Traders' Guild, Library","descriptions":["Thick carpeting and heavy drapes muffle outside noises to keep the library a peaceful place.  A shelf of books and racks of scrolls are here for the edification of young Guild members and even the general public.  A low table with several chairs awaits the eager scholar.  A sharp-eyed librarian keeps a watchful eye on the room lest rare books or scrolls leave unbidden."],"exits":[{"to":227,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":229,"x":370,"y":620,"z":0,"title":"Traders' Guild, Upper Lounge","descriptions":["This quiet lounge overlooks the bustling Trading Pit.  Large windows, with thick panes of glass, prevent the clamorous din of buying and selling from making its way here and keep any non-guild member from possibly overhearing any private conversations or learning any guild secrets.  Couches lined up along the walls allow observation of the chaos below in comfort."],"exits":[{"to":227,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":230,"x":360,"y":620,"z":0,"title":"Traders' Guild, Upper Hallway","descriptions":["Polished brass sconces with lit white candles line the wide hallway.  Colorfully patterned rugs line the polished mahogany floors, practically laid not only to add dimension to the room, but also to mute the sound of scores of feet that enter the busy corridor.  A hand-carved mahogany entrance stands open to welcome guests into the auction hall foyer, while on the opposite end a large brass-hinged door marks the way to the banquet hall."],"exits":[{"to":227,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":231,"exit":"go","move":"go small office"},{"to":232,"exit":"go","move":"go auction foyer"},{"to":0,"exit":"go","move":"go brass door"}]},
  {"id":231,"x":350,"y":630,"z":0,"title":"Anzu ia Bima, Reservations","descriptions":["Framed chalk sketches and paintings line the walls of the small office, displaying party rooms filled with guests in some, and others displaying food and drink presentations.  Comfortable chairs sit in front of a fine birch desk, where guests may sit to discuss their plans with the reservation clerk."],"exits":[{"to":230,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":232,"x":350,"y":620,"z":0,"title":"Traders' Guild, Auction Foyer","descriptions":["Auctioneers, bidders, and spectators alike make their way back and forth through the open eggshell white doors that lead into the Auction Hall.  A lovely marble statue of a young, beautiful serving girl stands between the doors, her head turned ever so slightly to the side and her eyes lidded to display an almost dreamy, far-off look.  Her arms are stretched out before her with her hands together and fingers curved up, delicately holding a silver tray."],"exits":[{"to":230,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":233,"exit":"go","move":"go auction hall"}]},
  {"id":233,"x":360,"y":610,"z":0,"title":"Traders' Guild, Auction Hall","descriptions":["Prospective buyers hover near a fine parchment that hangs almost reverently in finished brass clasps along the back wall of the room, hoping to get an idea of what homeless treasures will soon grace the auction stand.  Offsetting the smooth, eggshell white walls and ceiling is carved crown molding, finished with fine gold leaf that glistens in the light of the ironwork chandelier above.  Below, long wooden benches with horsehair seats are placed before the long table where the items for bid are displayed."],"exits":[{"to":232,"exit":"go","move":"go foyer"}],"aliases":["Auction Hall"]},
  {"id":234,"x":500,"y":720,"z":0,"title":"Town Hall Lobby","descriptions":["The entrance to the town's civil nerve center is simple and businesslike.  Pale grey stone floor and white-washed walls allow little in the way of decor, but are functional.  Opposite the main entrance is the Licensing and Debt Office where citizens handle matters of taxation, fines and public debts owed.  A sweeping staircase leads to the upper floor."],"exits":[{"to":8,"exit":"out","move":"out","hidden":true},{"to":235,"exit":"go","move":"go curving stair"},{"to":238,"exit":"go","move":"go licensing office"}],"aliases":["Town Hall Lobby"]},
  {"id":235,"x":510,"y":720,"z":0,"title":"Town Hall, Upper Landing","descriptions":["The decor here is somewhat more elaborate than the utilitarian mode of the ground floor.  The office of the Mayor and the Hall of Public Assembly bring the great and powerful to gather.  The walls, washed a soft cream, are hung with paintings of past mayors, each wearing a suitably aloof expression.  A glass case to one side holds a large ship's model."],"exits":[{"to":234,"exit":"go","move":"go curving stair"},{"to":236,"exit":"go","move":"go double doors"},{"to":237,"exit":"go","move":"go carved door"}]},
  {"id":236,"x":510,"y":730,"z":0,"title":"Town Hall, Hall of Public Assembly","descriptions":["This hall is designed to hold the major portion of the town's gentry for important meetings.  Padded benches form long curved rows facing a raised speaker's platform.  The decor is subdued but elegant, with figured walnut and dark burgundy velvet hangings as the major features.  Only one odd note mars the sober and reserved scene, a painting on one wall seems oddly out of place."],"exits":[{"to":235,"exit":"go","move":"go double doors"}],"aliases":["Public Assembly"]},
  {"id":237,"x":540,"y":720,"z":0,"title":"Town Hall, Mayor's Office","descriptions":["This office defines luxury.  The walls are covered in tooled leather and burled flamewood.  A huge desk of tiger-striped oak dominates the room.  High-backed chairs of soft-cushioned leather await the lordlings of the city."],"exits":[{"to":235,"exit":"go","move":"go carved door"}],"aliases":["Mayor's Office"]},
  {"id":238,"x":500,"y":730,"z":0,"title":"Town Hall, Debt Office","descriptions":["Depressingly like any office anywhere in all the realms you have travelled, this one is obviously where people come to part with money that someone else thinks they can spend more wisely.  A bored clerk behind a worn counter patiently answers questions and takes payments from all comers.  The floor, once a soft grey, has been scuffed and rubbed into a dingy mud color that no scrubbing will ever alleviate."],"exits":[{"to":234,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Debt"]},
  {"id":239,"x":580,"y":680,"z":0,"title":"Pierless Inn, Courtyard","descriptions":["The Inn rises above you on three sides.  Stone and half-timber work make a pleasing sight and the place radiates charm and comfort.  A sizable stable at the back of the courtyard accomodates travelers' horses and carriages.  One wing houses the kitchens, butteries and storerooms for the ever-full dining and drinking rooms.  A wide-open door beckons you into the dark interior where laughter and the scent of good food emanate."],"exits":[{"to":9,"exit":"go","move":"go open gate","hidden":true},{"to":240,"exit":"go","move":"go wide-open door"}],"aliases":["Pierless Inn"]},
  {"id":240,"x":580,"y":670,"z":0,"title":"Pierless Inn, Foyer","descriptions":["Polished oak and silverwood parquet floors glitter with the soft light of many candles.  Walls of quarrystone might look chill and formal elsewhere, but not here, for embroidered rugs and silken tapestries adorn every wall.  Truly, this is a place that knows how to make you welcome.  A small kiosk to one side for the convenience of arriving guests checking in stands ready, along with a cloakroom for storing of heavy gear."],"exits":[{"to":241,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":239,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":242,"exit":"go","move":"go main hall"},{"to":246,"exit":"go","move":"go kiosk"},{"to":253,"exit":"go","move":"go cloakroom"}]},
  {"id":241,"x":580,"y":660,"z":0,"title":"Pierless Inn, Quiet Bar","descriptions":["This small, quiet room is warm and cozy.  Resembling the parlor of a prosperous house more than a bar, it exudes comfort and serene enjoyment.  A large fireplace holds a cheery blaze filling the room with warmth.  Fragrant fruitwood smoke scents the air.  Leather couches and chairs gather around small tables for the comfort of guests.  A small service counter offers an array of drinks and food to match the ambiance."],"exits":[{"to":240,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":242,"x":590,"y":670,"z":0,"title":"Pierless Inn, Main Hall","descriptions":["The lavish main hall of the Inn dazzles one with the richness of its decor.  Fumed oak and dark leather cover the walls and a decorated ceiling of hammered tin form the cup into which the elite and powerful in this town pour out their gold and silver in return for lavish food and drink.  A constant low hum of talk and whispered confidences fill the air.  Small groups huddle around their tables, no doubt making deals that will affect trade across the province and well into others.","The lavish main hall of the Inn dazzles one with the richness of its decor.  Fumed oak and dark leather cover the walls and a decorated ceiling of hammered tin form the cup into which the elite and powerful in this town pour out their gold and silver in return for lavish food and drink.  A constant low hum of talk and whispered confidences fill the air, some drifting in from the nearby bar.  Small groups huddle around their tables, no doubt making deals that will affect trade across the province and well into others."],"exits":[{"to":240,"exit":"go","move":"go main foyer"},{"to":243,"exit":"go","move":"go shadowy corner"},{"to":244,"exit":"go","move":"go quiet corner"},{"to":245,"exit":"go","move":"go table"}]},
  {"id":243,"x":600,"y":670,"z":0,"title":"Pierless Inn, Shadowy Corner","descriptions":["The bright lights of the main room fail to penetrate to this far corner.  The shadows are thick and heavy.  A few small candles glimmer on scattered tables, but their glow is limited to a few feet.  Dark shapes huddle over drinks and talk in low voices, anxious not to be overheard.  Scattered pairs and groups of people maintain a discreet distance from one another."],"exits":[{"to":242,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":244,"x":600,"y":660,"z":0,"title":"Pierless Inn, Quiet Corner","descriptions":["This quiet corner of the main bar seems to be insulated from the noise and babble elsewhere.  Heavy velvet hangings on the walls and thick carpets account for much of the quietude.  Silver and crystal sconces shed a warm light and a low settee offers respite for tired feet."],"exits":[{"to":242,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":245,"x":590,"y":660,"z":0,"title":"Pierless Inn, Large Table","descriptions":["A large circular table that can seat many people stands beneath an elaborate chandelier of crystal and bronze.  Comfortable chairs ring the table, ready for patrons' use.  The seal of the town has been worked into the table in a delicate inlay and you suspect that much of the town's business gets done here."],"exits":[{"to":242,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":246,"x":570,"y":660,"z":0,"title":"Pierless Inn, Kiosk","descriptions":["The kiosk is set to one side of the busy foyer so that guests may come and go with a minimum of fuss and bother.  An antique bronze counter inset with soft wine-colored velvet serves as desk for the dignified Elothean behind it.  A nearby stair climbs to the upper stories.  Overhead, a wrought iron candelabra sheds a warm glow over all."],"exits":[{"to":240,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":247,"exit":"go","move":"go winding stair"}]},
  {"id":247,"x":570,"y":650,"z":0,"title":"Pierless Inn, Stair Landing","descriptions":["A wide hallway leads to the north, where several private salons for entertaining reside.  Thick carpets warm the cold stone floor and elegant wall-hangings depict scenes of revelry and banqueting."],"exits":[{"to":248,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":246,"exit":"go","move":"go down staircase"},{"to":254,"exit":"go","move":"go up staircase"}]},
  {"id":248,"x":570,"y":640,"z":0,"title":"Pierless Inn, Upper Hall","descriptions":["A number of doors to either side of the passage mark rooms set aside for patrons desiring privacy from the noise and tumult of the main room below.  At the far south end of the hallway stands a circular staircase, its wooden steps extending from ceiling to floor, and beyond."],"exits":[{"to":247,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":249,"exit":"go","move":"go pine door"},{"to":251,"exit":"go","move":"go oak door"},{"to":252,"exit":"go","move":"go mahogany door"}]},
  {"id":249,"x":560,"y":630,"z":0,"title":"Pierless Inn, Sunset Room","descriptions":["Facing west, this room captures the sunset each evening through large floor-to-ceiling doors that open onto a private patio.  A small fireplace opposite these features a magnificent painting of a twilight ocean under a silver moon hung above the mantel.  A modest table set with silver candlesticks on a white linen cloth awaits the next dinner party."],"exits":[{"to":250,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":248,"exit":"go","move":"go pine door"}]},
  {"id":250,"x":550,"y":630,"z":0,"title":"Pierless Inn, Second Floor Balcony","descriptions":["A wide balcony opens out from the Sunset Room on the Inn's second floor.  Facing west to capture the evening's last light, the balcony looks out over the town below.  Bronze lanterns set high overhead and along the low railing wait the coming of night to add their soft radiance to the stars above."],"exits":[{"to":249,"exit":"east","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":251,"x":570,"y":630,"z":0,"title":"Pierless Inn, Sunrise Room","descriptions":["Facing east to greet the morning sun, this room is done in merry tones of gold and blue to reflect the cheery orb of morning as it rises high in a cloudless sky.  Pale yellow table cloths set with bright polished silver decorate small white tables scattered about the room.  Few, save the weariest slug-a-bed, would begrudge breakfast here."],"exits":[{"to":248,"exit":"go","move":"go door"}]},
  {"id":252,"x":580,"y":630,"z":0,"title":"Pierless Inn, Traders' Lounge","descriptions":["Set with heavy leather-covered chairs and couches, this large room is normally reserved for the Traders of the town.  To ease the stress of their fevered profession, gatherers here are forbidden to discuss any aspect of Trade and commerce.  Meant as a refuge from their daily cares, the room is comfortable and a bit stodgy, like an old uncle."],"exits":[{"to":248,"exit":"go","move":"go mahogany door"}]},
  {"id":253,"x":570,"y":670,"z":0,"title":"Pierless Inn, Cloakroom","descriptions":["Many shelves line the walls, allowing gear and garments to be stored easily.  Hooks for cloaks and hats line one wall and not a few walking sticks are propped here and there.  There is a small stool for the attendant and a tiny table."],"exits":[{"to":240,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":254,"x":590,"y":650,"z":0,"title":"Pierless Inn, Third Floor Landing","descriptions":["This floor holds the bedrooms available for guests.  Newly picked rushes cover the flagstone floor and ewers of water and bowls and towels for washing are arrayed on tables at the head of the stairs.  A skylight overhead lets in a slight breeze from off the river and the air is full of the smell of clean sheets and fresh linens."],"exits":[{"to":255,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":247,"exit":"go","move":"go winding stair"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":255,"x":590,"y":640,"z":0,"title":"Pierless Inn, Hallway","descriptions":["Bedrooms open off both sides of the hallway.  To the south, the great circular stairway leads down to the lower floors.  Each door has a small table next to it with a good supply of candles and such for each guest's need."],"exits":[{"to":256,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":254,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":261,"exit":"go","move":"go blue door"},{"to":262,"exit":"go","move":"go scarlet door"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":256,"x":590,"y":630,"z":0,"title":"Pierless Inn, Hallway","descriptions":["White-washed wall and clean stone floors continue down this hallway.  Skylights overhead allow a goodly amount of light into the passage."],"exits":[{"to":255,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":257,"exit":"go","move":"go carved door"},{"to":260,"exit":"go","move":"go wooden door"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":257,"x":590,"y":620,"z":0,"title":"Pierless Inn, Owner's Suite","descriptions":["This room, the grandest of the Inn, is done in a nautical style.  Resembling an elegant ship's stateroom, the furnishings would do a great sailing vessel proud.  The lamps are on gimbals and the dining table swings down from the wall for use.  A large double bed is set within a niche in the far wall complete with leeboards to keep the guests from falling out.  Paintings of various maritime themes complete the effect."],"exits":[{"to":258,"exit":"go","move":"go stairs"},{"to":256,"exit":"go","move":"go carved door"}]},
  {"id":258,"x":590,"y":610,"z":0,"title":"Pierless Inn, Roof Garden","descriptions":["Concealing the roof of the inn is a tiny but lovely garden filled with flowers and low shrubs.  A waterfall set among ferns and lillies empties into a tiny pond complete with fish.  Hedges rise along the perimeter to block out the view of the town and give a secluded feel to this spot of greenery. Birds sing in the dwarf trees scattered among the shrubs along a pebbled walkway."],"exits":[{"to":259,"exit":"go","move":"go canvas tent"},{"to":257,"exit":"go","move":"go stairs"}],"aliases":["Roof Garden Telescope"]},
  {"id":259,"x":580,"y":610,"z":0,"title":"Pierless Inn, Moon Mage Tent","descriptions":["Large piles of musty leather tomes, yellowed star charts, and assorted brass instruments lie strewn about in a haphazard mess under the brown canvas of this tent.  Although the equipment would seem to indicate a place of learning, your first impression is more that of a refugee camp, and a disorganized one at that."],"exits":[{"to":258,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"aliases":["Moon Mage Tent"]},
  {"id":260,"x":600,"y":620,"z":0,"title":"Pierless Inn, Dormitory","descriptions":["Unlike the elegant rooms elsewhere, this room is meant for the more penurious traveller or those who simply do not care to toss around their coins.  Comfortable but simple bunks, two high, line both sides of the room.  A long table down the center holds washbasins and pitchers at the ready and a small privy at the far end of the room handles the necessities of nature."],"exits":[{"to":256,"exit":"go","move":"go wooden door"}]},
  {"id":261,"x":600,"y":630,"z":0,"title":"Pierless Inn, Blue Room","descriptions":["Done entirely in shades of blue, this room feels cool and soft.  Sky blue curtains filter the light of day into a soft and relaxing color.  A four-poster bed set with a great counterpane the color of a sparkling twilight sky beckons the weary guest.  A pair of comfortable chairs sit alongside a small dining table in one corner. A small iron stove, set with pale blue tiles provides a gentle warmth against the chill of night or inclement weather."],"exits":[{"to":255,"exit":"go","move":"go blue door"}]},
  {"id":262,"x":600,"y":640,"z":0,"title":"Pierless Inn, Scarlet Room","descriptions":["This bedroom, done in flame and scarlet, sets the blood to dancing and the senses awakening with the intensity of the colors. Velvet wall coverings in a fiery red turn the cool light of day into the heated fires of a gypsy camp.  Even the bedspread is a deep and rich crimson, like scattered rubies beneath the heel of a conqueror, glittering in the soft white embrace of the sheets beneath."],"exits":[{"to":255,"exit":"go","move":"go scarlet door"}]},
  {"id":263,"x":920,"y":660,"z":0,"title":"East Guard Tower, Ingress","descriptions":["Staring upwards, you are unable to see the top of the tower from your current vantage point.  The walls are made of strong ironwood timbers reinforced with iron strappings.  Musky odors cling to the wood from repeated assaults by the river below.  A well built set of stairs ascends into the darkness far above.  To the south you see a door leading to the rivergate controls which is securely locked and guarded by two burly Gor'Togs."],"exits":[{"to":15,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":264,"exit":"climb","move":"climb sturdy stairs"}]},
  {"id":264,"x":920,"y":640,"z":0,"title":"East Guard Tower, Second Floor","descriptions":["You stand on the first stratum of the tower.  Small rectangular windows that serve as arrow slits for the bowmen of Riverhaven completely surround you.  Frequently the breeze blows through the slits to rustle the many small flags that are done in the shades of Riverhaven's military colors.  A wooden bucket to hold water for the parched archers sits nearby.  Stairs lead down to the ingress while a wooden ladder leads up."],"exits":[{"to":263,"exit":"climb","move":"climb sturdy stairs"},{"to":265,"exit":"climb","move":"climb wooden ladder"}]},
  {"id":265,"x":920,"y":620,"z":0,"title":"East Guard Tower, Third Floor","descriptions":["A few tall thin windows that allow one to survey the countryside are interspersed amongst the arrow slits.  Looking down you instinctively hug the rough wooden walls for fear of falling.  A rope swaying from the landing above seems to be the only way to gain entrance to the lookout."],"exits":[{"to":264,"exit":"climb","move":"climb wooden ladder"},{"to":266,"exit":"climb","move":"climb length rope"}]},
  {"id":266,"x":940,"y":620,"z":0,"title":"East Guard Tower, Lookout","descriptions":["Gazing from the top of this lofty tower, all of Riverhaven is displayed before you.  To the north, far away, palisade walls nestle into the low mountains.  A breeze brings smells and sounds from the warehouse district directly below.  Peering over the side, you see the river rushing by below.  From this height you are unable to hear its sounds but the moisture of the river still makes its way up."],"exits":[{"to":265,"exit":"climb","move":"climb rope"}]},
  {"id":267,"x":20,"y":620,"z":0,"title":"West Guard Tower, Armory","descriptions":["This is the tower's armory and storage room.  The walls are hung with swords, shields, pikes and all manner of weaponry, and the floors are stacked with boxes of crossbow bolts, arrows, and crates of food and supplies.  The outer wall of the tower forms a neat semi-circle, with a wooden partition dividing this floor of the tower in half."],"exits":[{"to":268,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":269,"exit":"go","move":"go flight stairs"},{"to":220,"exit":"climb","move":"climb ladder"}]},
  {"id":268,"x":0,"y":620,"z":0,"title":"West Guard Tower, Officers Quarters","descriptions":["This room looks to be a barracks for officers in the town guard.  A wide barred window in the western wall looks out over the countryside surrounding the town of Riverhaven.  Maps, reports, and requisitions cover a large table set under the window, opposite two comfortable beds flanking the doorway to the next room."],"exits":[{"to":267,"exit":"east","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":269,"x":20,"y":600,"z":0,"title":"West Guard Tower, Roof","descriptions":["From the top of the guardtower, you can peer through slits in the stone wall to look out over the town and the surrounding countryside.  A raised platform in the center of the tower supports a hinged pole, which looks like it might be a mounting for a ballista.  A tarp is strung across four poles to one side of the area, to provide some shelter against the weather for the guards constantly stationed here."],"exits":[{"to":267,"exit":"go","move":"go stairs"}]},
  {"id":270,"x":900,"y":560,"z":0,"title":"Town Jail, Judgement Chamber","descriptions":["Long benches fill this simple room.  A large desk and two chairs set facing out on a two foot wood riser.  Alone in the corner is an iron barred cage, no doubt the holding area for the accused.  Railed platforms on opposite walls provide the place for the town's barristers to spin their yarns in an effort to persuade the sitting judge."],"exits":[{"to":76,"exit":"go","move":"go deobar door"}],"aliases":["Judgement Chamber"]},
  {"id":271,"x":900,"y":520,"z":0,"title":"City Togs, Storeroom","descriptions":["Padded mannequins, shrouded in cheesecloth to keep off the dust, stand in the center of the storeroom.  The fabric is pulled back to reveal bridal outfits.  Boxes and trunks lie in neat piles around it, holding assorted garments not currently on display in the main salesroom."],"exits":[{"to":75,"exit":"go","move":"go narrow hallway"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":272,"x":700,"y":340,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Northeast Guard Post","descriptions":["Little more than a wooden plank a couple of feet wide, this lookout serves as a backup position for the main guard towers.  A narrow little ladder leads back down to the street far below.  Gazing out,  you see the flat fields and marshy areas around town and the small plots of farmland being plowed.  Far to the north, a range of low hills can just be made out."],"exits":[{"to":24,"exit":"climb","move":"climb narrow ladder"}]},
  {"id":273,"x":382,"y":110,"z":0,"title":"Noble Inn, Foyer","descriptions":["Bright shimmering light streams down from a huge chandelier hung from the polished maple beams in the ceiling.  Cloth of gold drapes the tall arched windows facing the street.  A broad staircase of pink marble leads to the second floor, flanked on one side by a tall columned archway leading to the dining room, and on the other by the ornately carved desk of the inn's registry."],"exits":[{"to":26,"exit":"out","move":"out","hidden":true},{"to":274,"exit":"go","move":"go door"},{"to":275,"exit":"climb","move":"climb broad staircase"},{"to":281,"exit":"go","move":"go archway"}],"aliases":["Noble Inn"]},
  {"id":274,"x":372,"y":110,"z":0,"title":"Noble Inn, Stables","descriptions":["The inn's vast stables are so elegantly appointed that the word 'luxurious' is not out of place here.  The tall arched ceiling is made of stone, and decorated with colorful inlaid tiles.  A raised brick walkway runs between twin lines of wooden stalls.  Each stall has its own marble waterbasin, fed by bronze spigots set into the wall.  A few horses clustered together in one corner are the only beneficiaries of this opulent home."],"exits":[{"to":27,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":364,"exit":"go","move":"go tack room"},{"to":273,"exit":"go","move":"go door"},{"to":392,"exit":"go","move":"go brokerage office"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Stable"]},
  {"id":275,"x":392,"y":100,"z":0,"title":"Noble Inn, Hallway","descriptions":["A red and gold patterned carpet runs along the center of the polished wood panel floor, past rows of doors leading to private rooms for the guests.  Matching tapestries, depicting a parade of well dressed men and women being led up to a glittering golden throne, cover the walls between the doorways."],"exits":[{"to":276,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":277,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":273,"exit":"climb","move":"climb staircase"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":276,"x":392,"y":89,"z":0,"title":"Noble Inn, Hallway","descriptions":["The hallway runs past openings leading into private suites, towards an open double door flanked with stained wooden columns.  Vases of fresh flowers rest on marble tables set near the entrance to each room."],"exits":[{"to":275,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":366,"exit":"go","move":"go double door"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":277,"x":372,"y":100,"z":0,"title":"Noble Inn, Hallway","descriptions":["Rows of doors line the hallway flanked by decorative spiral-carved wooden pillars.  Between the doors, shallow nooks in the walls display a collection of porcelain vases and statuary.  A red and gold patterned carpet runs along the length of the hall, soft and yielding underfoot."],"exits":[{"to":275,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":278,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":446,"exit":"go","move":"go white door"},{"to":447,"exit":"go","move":"go blue door"}]},
  {"id":278,"x":362,"y":100,"z":0,"title":"Noble Inn, Hallway","descriptions":["Shallow nooks in the walls display a collection of porcelain vases and statuary.  At the end of the hall, a black ironwood door stands open, flanked by marble-topped plant stands.  A sign on the door identifies this as the headquarters for the local representative of the Paladin's Guild."],"exits":[{"to":277,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":279,"exit":"go","move":"go green door"},{"to":280,"exit":"go","move":"go crimson door"},{"to":393,"exit":"go","move":"go ironwood door"}]},
  {"id":279,"x":352,"y":89,"z":0,"title":"Noble Inn, Green Room","descriptions":["A bronze bowl filled with cedar chips sits upon the hearth, the heat of the fire releasing the fragrant oils to fill the room with the scent of the forest.  Green damask curtains sway gently in the breeze through the open window.  A copperleaf sleigh bed juts out from the wall at an angle, its feather mattress covered by fine linen sheets and lace-trimmed pillows.  On the other side of the door, a fern sways in a knotted hanger over a round table."],"exits":[{"to":278,"exit":"go","move":"go green door"}]},
  {"id":280,"x":362,"y":89,"z":0,"title":"Noble Inn, Crimson Room","descriptions":["A cast iron bed features lacy basketwork finials topping the four tall posts and crimson velvet draperies pulled back with heavy silver silk tassels.  Nearby, a vase of fragrant white orange blossoms rests on a glass-topped filigree cast iron table.  The whitewashed walls and exposed dark oak beams make the room appear larger than it really is."],"exits":[{"to":278,"exit":"go","move":"go crimson door"}]},
  {"id":281,"x":382,"y":120,"z":0,"title":"Noble Inn, Dining Hall","descriptions":["A long banquet table runs across the center of the room, flanked on each side by padded benches upholstered in delicate embroidered silk.  Smaller round dining tables sit in private nooks in the walls, next to tall brass candelabra which shine with a low flickering light.  A low murmur of conversation carries from parties of guests seated about the area.  The walls are hung with tapestries matching the embroidered burgundy rug covering the floor."],"exits":[{"to":273,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":282,"x":340,"y":280,"z":0,"title":"Magnolia Corner, Dry Creek Lane","descriptions":["The din of the city is muffled by magnificent magnolia trees that line the wide lane.  A brick path greets a small bridge that leads toward a small community of well-kept homes and tended gardens."],"exits":[{"to":283,"exit":"go","move":"go wooden bridge"},{"to":27,"exit":"go","move":"go brick path"}]},
  {"id":283,"x":330,"y":290,"z":0,"title":"Magnolia Corner, Dry Creek Bridge","descriptions":["White painted wood creates this small bridge that arches over an ornamental creek bed.  Towering magnolia trees shade the sloping, mossy banks with their large white blossoms.  Folks heading to and from their homes stop momentarily to chat a while before continuing on their way."],"exits":[{"to":282,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":284,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":284,"x":320,"y":300,"z":0,"title":"Magnolia Corner, Blossom Circle","descriptions":["Matching the owner's home with every shutter and shingle, a birdfeeder stands atop a thick pole in the center of the yard to welcome feather-winged boarders.  Sweet smelling jasmine twines its way around the shaft and over the roof, one major digression from the original design.  Lush green moss creates an abstract tiling as it creeps around the white cobblestones of the road."],"exits":[{"to":285,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":289,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":283,"exit":"go","move":"go wooden bridge"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":285,"x":330,"y":310,"z":0,"title":"Magnolia Corner, Blossom Circle","descriptions":["The dark purple blossoms of wood violets encircle a few tree trunks, lending a splash of color to the dull brown.  Residents stroll casually beneath the shady branches of magnolia trees along the cobblestone lane.  Fresh and inviting, the surroundings provide aesthetic scenery while venturing to the casual gathering spot in the middle of the circle."],"exits":[{"to":286,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":284,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":286,"x":320,"y":320,"z":0,"title":"Magnolia Corner, Blossom Circle","descriptions":["Flower boxes adorn several verandas in the neighborhood, filling the area with a glorious rainbow colors and fragrance.  A pair of white wicker chairs rock lazily in the breeze on one porch, while a pitcher of lemonade on a nearby table waits patiently to quench a thirst.  Soft, cheery music drifts into the lane from an open window."],"exits":[{"to":285,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":287,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":287,"x":310,"y":330,"z":0,"title":"Magnolia Corner, Blossom Circle","descriptions":["Intermittent gusts of wind cause showers of velvety petals to descend upon the cobblestone path from the trees on either side.  The white droppings collect near a terracotta pot turned over on its side, decorating the lawn of a nearby house.  A wild mess of flower tendrils spills from the interior, spiraling up and over the rim to threaten total domination over the grass."],"exits":[{"to":286,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":295,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":288,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":288,"x":300,"y":320,"z":0,"title":"Magnolia Corner, Commons","descriptions":["Dozens of magnolia trees with evergreen leaves border the park, rendering shadows at all points of the day.  Narrow pathways lined with perfectly-shaped gardenia bushes frame the manicured lawn.  White iron benches form a circle in the center of the commons, allowing a restful pause away from the hurried bustle."],"exits":[{"to":289,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":287,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":294,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":290,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":376,"exit":"go","move":"go brick mansion"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":289,"x":310,"y":310,"z":0,"title":"Magnolia Corner, Blossom Circle","descriptions":["The cobblestone lane sashays around a central tree-lined park, allowing a pleasant view from all the surrounding homes.  A pie cools on an open window sill, its aroma of baked apples and cinnamon creating a mouth-watering temptation on the breeze.  Tall bear's breeches are dominant in one of the gardens, and their dark green heart-shaped leaves form spiky hems around the white and purple flowers."],"exits":[{"to":284,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":288,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":290,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":290,"x":290,"y":310,"z":0,"title":"Magnolia Corner, Blossom Circle","descriptions":["Homes with large front porches and gabled rooftops surround the recreational area to the southeast, many dangling baskets of light pink begonias from their eaves.  Hanging from a tall oak tree, a wooden swing is decorated with brightly colored pillows.  Warbling avian melodies fill the area with just enough sound to enhance the natural ambiance."],"exits":[{"to":289,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":288,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":291,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":291,"x":280,"y":300,"z":0,"title":"Magnolia Corner, Blossom Circle","descriptions":["A raised box of growing herbs and vegetables sits near a kitchen doorway of one of the homes.  Dressed in top hat and waistcoat, a scarecrow looks more inviting than fearful as it stands sentinel over the garden.  Occasionally, the aroma of roasted chicken wafts into the area from just around the bend."],"exits":[{"to":290,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":292,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":292,"x":270,"y":310,"z":0,"title":"Magnolia Corner, Blossom Circle","descriptions":["The cobblestone lane continues along uninterrupted, appearing freshly pruned of intrusive weeds.  Ivy makes a sport of climbing on several buildings in the area, clinging tenaciously to chimneys and walls.  Frilly eyelet curtains are visible inside one window, accenting the dark purple verbena growing in a faded flower box."],"exits":[{"to":291,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":293,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":293,"x":280,"y":320,"z":0,"title":"Magnolia Corner, Blossom Circle","descriptions":["Nature abounds here despite the close proximity to the urban landscape beyond the trees.  Boxwood hedges blend with the magnolias to border the cobblestone lane, offering some semblance of privacy for the residents.  Light floral scents float on a lingering breeze, occasionally mixed with a dose fresh river air."],"exits":[{"to":294,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":292,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":294,"x":290,"y":330,"z":0,"title":"Magnolia Corner, Blossom Circle","descriptions":["Tones of conversation from the commons to the northeast flavor the atmosphere along with a few select notes from passing songbirds.  The magnolia trees droop favorably over the homes, casting them in curtains of green leaves and vibrant blooms.  It is almost hard to believe that the rough city streets lie just beyond the foliage."],"exits":[{"to":288,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":295,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":293,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":295,"x":300,"y":340,"z":0,"title":"Magnolia Corner, Blossom Circle","descriptions":["One particularly large tree rests in the middle of the path, forcing the pavers to split the line of cobble in two to accommodate the trunk's breadth.  Laden with pristine white blossoms, the magnolia's branches extend far over the rooftops of several nearby houses.  Local birds twitter noisily above, concealed by the leaves."],"exits":[{"to":287,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":294,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":300,"exit":"go","move":"go wooden gate"}],"color":"#00FFFF","aliases":["Magnolia Corner"]},
  {"id":296,"x":50,"y":420,"z":0,"title":"Dunkard's Tavern","descriptions":["Students gather in small groups, some poring over their books as they drink, and others clustered around the dartboard on the back wall.  The wine is weak, the beer somewhat flat, but the tavern's cheap prices and dim lighting combine to ensure a brisk business despite the shortcomings of the food and drink."],"exits":[{"to":30,"exit":"out","move":"out","hidden":true}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Dunkard's Tavern","dartboard"]},
  {"id":297,"x":50,"y":650,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Ioun's Pawn","descriptions":["Nothing in your lifetime has prepared you for the clutter you encounter in this shop.  Not a single hint of organization meets the eye.  Looking behind the counter you see an assortment of items that span the gamut from antique to brand new.  Dust is so thick on some of the older items that it is difficult to make out any color.  You kick yourself a path to the counter and are startled by Ioun, the shop owner, who was hidden by a stack of items on the counter."],"exits":[{"to":33,"exit":"out","move":"out","hidden":true}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Ioun's Pawn","pawn"]},
  {"id":298,"x":150,"y":500,"z":0,"title":"Zanthron's Artificer Shop, Salesroom","descriptions":["You flinch as you feel slight shocks of static running up your arm while standing in Zanthron's shop.  A purple and black tapestry hangs in the back of the shop while glass display cases of miniature animals sit on shelves arranged haphazardly on another wall.  Zanthron herself sits on a stool behind the counter scowling at a runestone and muttering arcane phrases as if looking for an opening in the stone."],"exits":[{"to":36,"exit":"out","move":"out","hidden":true}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Zanthron's Artificer Shop","artificer"]},
  {"id":299,"x":300,"y":360,"z":0,"title":"Magnolia Corner, Alleyway","descriptions":["Stacks of boxes flank the passage, likely left by hired hands after delivering produce and other foodstuffs to the neighborhood residents.  Local street artists have painted murals upon the building walls, the images roughly styled and exhibiting a raw realism.  Though the brick lining the alley is cracked, the area seems well-maintained albeit a bit cluttered."],"exits":[{"to":300,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":37,"exit":"go","move":"go main street"}]},
  {"id":300,"x":320,"y":340,"z":0,"title":"Magnolia Corner, Alleyway","descriptions":["Relatively clean and lacking any overly foul odor, the path weaves between city buildings to facilitate access to the cozy community nestled discreetly amidst Riverhaven's urban landscape.  Vigorous weeds have intruded between several of the bricks, and a tall boxwood hedge blocks most of the view beyond the wooden gate."],"exits":[{"to":299,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":295,"exit":"go","move":"go wooden gate"}]},
  {"id":301,"x":320,"y":610,"z":0,"title":"Fine Leaf's End, Sales Room","descriptions":["A rush of pungent tobacco fumes greets patrons upon entering the Fine Leaf.  This enormous amount of smoke is created by the numerous half-pint customers trying out new blends, but the most proficient creator of the dense haze is the proprietor, Beeanna Donee, who is never without her long walnut pipe."],"exits":[{"to":42,"exit":"out","move":"out","hidden":true}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Tobacco Shop"]},
  {"id":302,"x":280,"y":530,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Halfling Quarter","descriptions":["Covered with tiny footprints, this small alley runs behind Noot's Teahouse.  Unused and hidden from the main street, this site is a perfect locale for a youth's first smoke or to sleep off a drunk."],"exits":[{"to":45,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":388,"exit":"none","move":"room sear;-3knock low grate;-whisper grate $haven.pw"}]},
  {"id":303,"x":541,"y":545,"z":0,"title":"Bards' Guild, Patron's Lounge","descriptions":["A dozen flambeaus cast pools of light across the malachite tile of the floor.  The style and decor of the lounge offers comfort for the bard and sufficient pretentiousness to impress the potential client.  Leather chairs sit ready to coddle rich bodies while inlaid tables snuggle nearby to insure that elegant manicures don't strain to reach glasses of port.  Surrounded on two sides by a screen carved from scented woods, each chair sits facing a long-legged stool and matching music stand."],"exits":[{"to":140,"exit":"go","move":"go marbled arch"}]},
  {"id":304,"x":541,"y":555,"z":0,"title":"Bards' Guild, Rehearsal Room","descriptions":["Barely larger than a closet, the wood-paneled room provides a place for bards to warm up before tackling the more imposing atmosphere of the performance hall.  Only a music stand is in the middle of the otherwise empty floor."],"exits":[{"to":140,"exit":"go","move":"go door"}]},
  {"id":305,"x":660,"y":440,"z":0,"title":"Blind Alley, Corner Slip","descriptions":["If this narrow passageway and its equally slender opening onto the alley were originally intended to provide an escape route in the event of fire, Damaris help those caught off guard in the servants' quarters and wayfarers' shanties which form the cluttered and cramped area nicknamed the Rookery.  Only rats can run through here more than two abreast."],"exits":[{"to":306,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":147,"exit":"go","move":"go opening"},{"to":390,"exit":"none","move":"room sear;-3knock shadowed doorway;-whisp doorway $haven.pw"}],"aliases":["Rookery"]},
  {"id":306,"x":670,"y":450,"z":0,"title":"The Rookery, Drekkhet's Prowl","descriptions":["Barely a scrap of sky can be seen above what appears to be a tottering pile of randomly arranged building parts, so cramped and crowded is the Rookery.  Uglier still than the unkempt facades they present to Crescent Way and neighboring thoroughfares, the back ends of Riverhaven's buildings in this quarter are graceless and functional, much like the many workaday dwellings which have sprung up in their shadows.","Two reed torches struggle to illuminate the entrance to the Rookery.  The poverty of their effort suggests the half-light is intended not so much to welcome visitors, rather to aid a watchful eye in identifying them or appraising their belongings, depending on the nature of their business here at this time of night."],"exits":[{"to":307,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":305,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":307,"x":680,"y":460,"z":0,"title":"The Rookery, Drekkhet's Prowl","descriptions":["The alley widens into a narrow lane lined with coarse structures which crouch up against the backs of the larger streetfront buildings.  Many of the squat huts and shacks appear fairly well-established and even passably maintained, but most ordinary folk are ill-at-ease here and move on as soon as their circumstances permit.  A restless sense of impermanence prevails.","Numerous small homes give out little light from around the edges of their doors, but the darkness is still impenetrable.  A curtain twitches occasionally as if by some invisible hand alerted almost instinctively to the presence of a passer-by. "],"exits":[{"to":308,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":306,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":308,"x":690,"y":470,"z":0,"title":"The Rookery, Drekkhet's Prowl","descriptions":["A ragged lean-to teeters against the back wall of Natron's Workyard, a yellowing ivy creeping around the ill-fitting door of the abode and poking inquisitive tendrils into the cracks in its roof.  A large clump of weeds has sprung up at the side of the lane, thriving in an open gutter which draws away the used washing-water and other refuse thrown from the upper windows of the taller buildings.","An overgrown clump of weeds lurks in the shadows at the side of the road, its lengthy tendrils reaching out to catch on clothing and startle unsuspecting visitors.  The smell of salt is particularly strong here, due in large part to Natron's Workyard and the scatterings of his product which slip under the boundary fence."],"exits":[{"to":309,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":307,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":309,"x":680,"y":480,"z":0,"title":"The Rookery, Drekkhet's Prowl","descriptions":["The lane closes in a dead end of tawdry tradesmen's entrances.  Several large trash containers lean against one wall, strewing sodden bags and empty food wrappers all over the beginnings of a deeply rutted dirt path which leads off to the west.  The town's refuse collectors are clearly among those people who avoid the area as much as possible.","During the hours of darkness, several overfilled trash containers sprawl their contents yet further across the path as cats and rats and all manner of beggared beasts seek out a meal amidst the day's refuse.  Occasional loud squeaks and yowls of displeasure echo around the area as the scavengers fight for the best pickings."],"exits":[{"to":308,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":310,"exit":"go","move":"go dirt path"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":310,"x":690,"y":490,"z":0,"title":"The Rookery, Dogleg Lane","descriptions":["The impacted dirt pathway is treacherously pot-holed and as hard as stone underfoot.  Over the years, heavy rains and hot sun have petrified the deep ruts formed by heavily-laden handcarts passing this way under cover of darkness, their burdens of contraband moving silently through the side streets leading up from the docks, onward bound to unknown destinations in Riverhaven and beyond.","The treacherous pot-holes underfoot make the dirt pathway dangerous for anyone not completely familiar with the area.  Many an uttered curse has fouled the air here as nightblind pedestrians stumble and sprain an ankle in their haste to depart the Rookery in one piece and without a knife between their shoulderblades."],"exits":[{"to":311,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":309,"exit":"go","move":"go dirt path"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":311,"x":680,"y":490,"z":0,"title":"The Rookery, Dogleg Lane","descriptions":["Despite the efforts of some residents to brighten their surroundings with a splash of paint or a scrap of colored fabric hanging in a window, the area's silent and perilous nightly business overpowers the atmosphere with breathless suspense and no small measure of prickling fear.  Upon closer inspection, even the most meager dwelling has a sturdy lock on its door.","Residents tend to keep their homes under lock and key at all times in this dangerous neighborhood, but at dusk many even go so far as to board up their windows from the inside.  For those uninvolved in the nightly industry of the Rookery, even catching a glimpse of any nocturnal deal-making can be a risky business."],"exits":[{"to":310,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":312,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":315,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":312,"x":670,"y":490,"z":0,"title":"The Rookery, Dogleg Lane","descriptions":["Heaped in a corner, a tangled fishing net buzzes with flies and festers with the nauseating stench of rotting fish.  When it was first dumped here, a steady trickle of brackish water dripped off it and pooled into what is now a sticky brown stain in the dirt.  At least, the circumstances suggest it's a pool of water, but in the Rookery any stain on the ground could just as easily be blood."],"exits":[{"to":315,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":311,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":313,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":313,"x":660,"y":490,"z":0,"title":"The Rookery, Dogleg Corner","descriptions":["This corner of the Rookery is particularly dank and unwelcoming.  The buildings crowd together in such a way as to prevent any breeze from blowing through and clearing out the moist mustiness from the air.  Various mosses and lichens thrive in a spreading green belt at the base of every wall here, using the rising damp to their best advantage."],"exits":[{"to":314,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":312,"exit":"east","move":"east"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":314,"x":660,"y":480,"z":0,"title":"The Rookery, Gristle Grove","descriptions":["Stacked in a corner, a selection of rusty handcarts and rickety wheelbarrows leans up against a wall, surrounded by old tobacco ashes and a few scattered food wrappers.  A coil of heavy jute rope hangs on an iron hook nailed to the side wall of a locked wooden shack.  Beneath it, a pile of neatly-folded but grimy hessian tarps awaits usage during the night.","Silent figures move to and fro, pulling handcarts and wheelbarrows from a stack against one wall.  The dim glow of a pipe bobs back and forth, its tiny light and the occasional wisp of foul-smelling smoke the only clue that a real being is here, working to coordinate the concealed influx of contraband and the intermittent visits by contacts coming to collect their illicit wares."],"exits":[{"to":315,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":313,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":315,"x":670,"y":480,"z":0,"title":"The Rookery, Gristle Grove","descriptions":["Someone has thoughtfully placed a few old benches in a tight semi-circle at the foot of the tallest warehouse in the area.  This is the one spot in the Rookery which receives any direct sunlight, and for those residents who are out and about during the day, it makes a reasonable place to sit and discuss clandestine transactions or quietly make arrangements for the next night's activities.","A few reed torches glow dimly around some wooden benches, giving off just enough light to see the faces and clothing of others in the area.  Long shadows jump and flicker uneasily every time a slight breeze blows, and with the stealthy movement of wayfarers passing through the area."],"exits":[{"to":311,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":312,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":314,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":316,"exit":"climb","move":"climb iron ladder"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":316,"x":670,"y":470,"z":0,"title":"The Rookery, Lookout Tower","descriptions":["From this vantage point on top of the tallest warehouse, the Riverhaven Docks can be viewed without obstruction through a narrow gap between two rooftops.  To the west, the Town Hall and the Temple rise grandly above other edifices around the Square, while to the east the roof of the Mausoleum peeks above its vanguard of trees.  In the far distance, a glimpse of Lake Gwenalion glitters against the rustic blue-grey shoreline of Langenfirth.","Perched high above the rooftops of Riverhaven, the night-time view from the lookout tower is magnificent.  The bobbing lights of the ferries and barges slowly traverse the still black water toward Langenfirth, a glimmering golden band in the far distance.  Silhouetted against the sky, the hunched black expanse of the Journalai Mountains hugs the horizon."],"exits":[{"to":315,"exit":"climb","move":"climb iron ladder"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":317,"x":470,"y":240,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven Hospital, Entrance Hall","descriptions":["You stand in the entrance hall of Riverhaven's famed hospital.  Tall sea-green marble columns reach from the floor to the ceiling. Moss-stuffed pillows line one wall for the minor wounded to sit in while waiting for the empaths to finish with the more seriously impaired.  Beneath your feet, a woven rug of soft fleece adorns the room.  To the east, a cream colored arch with the words, For Their Pain, My Heart inscribed on it, beckons those who need immediate tending."],"exits":[{"to":59,"exit":"out","move":"out","hidden":true},{"to":318,"exit":"go","move":"go cream-colored arch"}]},
  {"id":318,"x":480,"y":240,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven Hospital, Tending Chamber","descriptions":["An empath glances at you while scurrying over to help a wounded citizen.  All around you are wounded or dying from every walk of life, but the efficiency of the empaths keeps everyone calm and assured. The smooth cream-colored marbled walls lend a cool feel to the room, helping to keep down any fevers that may afflict the diseased or poisoned.  Peering through a small arch you see a glimpse of a garden outside."],"exits":[{"to":317,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":319,"exit":"go","move":"go small arch"}],"color":"#00BF80","aliases":["Healer","Autopath","Hospital"]},
  {"id":319,"x":490,"y":240,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven Hospital, Garden","descriptions":["The smell of herbs is strong in this small but well-kept garden.  Numerous herbal flower beds are laid out in rows holding Balm, Chickweed, Fenugreek, Basil and more.  An empath helps an elderly female dwarf slowly around the garden, all the while chanting softly to help ease the senior dwarf's old age ills."],"exits":[{"to":318,"exit":"go","move":"go small arch"}]},
  {"id":320,"x":480,"y":420,"z":0,"title":"House of Bardic Blues, Baubles and Bits","descriptions":["Candlelight dances off of trinkets and spangles that are on casual display about the small room.  Jewelry pieces rest on silk pillows and silk-covered stands with seemingly cavalier disregard for their safekeeping.  More broadcloth hangs from the ceiling and walls in a shade of blue that's a bit lighter than the cloth in the Den.  Sparkling jewels, sewn into the heavy fabric, create a spectacular kaleidoscope of reflecting shades of blue as the candlelight caresses them."],"exits":[{"to":158,"exit":"go","move":"go flowing curtain"},{"to":321,"exit":"go","move":"go iron gate"},{"to":356,"exit":"go","move":"go cloth-draped arch"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":321,"x":480,"y":410,"z":0,"title":"House of Bardic Blues, Secluded Courtyard","descriptions":["This partially covered courtyard is pungent with the smells of savory spices and incense.  Exotic plants and flowers thrive here, creating an oasis away from the city's bustle and noise.  Filmy blue fabric falls from the latticework overhead, cloaking the courtyard from outside view and creating a cozy, shrouded ambiance.  Tall ironwork tables stand close to one another, providing stable and attractive places to enjoy a light repast.  A roped-off stairway leads up to the next level of the building."],"exits":[{"to":320,"exit":"go","move":"go iron gate"}]},
  {"id":322,"x":590,"y":330,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Warehouse","descriptions":["From the dust-free stone slabs that make up the floor to the neat stacks of clearly-marked barrels and crates towering high over your head, this building is absolutely immaculate.  The high ceiling with its many skylights gives the modest warehouse a feeling of wide open space.  However, the strong fishy odor detracts from one's appreciation of the architecture."],"exits":[{"to":323,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":68,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":323,"x":600,"y":330,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Warehouse","descriptions":["A sturdy wagon, heavily laden with large sacks of feed, rests here facing a pair of oversized doors in the north wall.  A stack of pallets rests beside a lunat office door to the east.  Even those are painted white, free of splinters and stains, and stacked with obsessive precision."],"exits":[{"to":324,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":322,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":325,"exit":"go","move":"go lunat door"}]},
  {"id":324,"x":600,"y":340,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Warehouse","descriptions":["Massive iron ingots are piled in the corner, and a great gouge in the stone floor shows where one was dropped.  Rope lies neatly coiled alongside boxes of pulleys and winches, atop a stack of lumber.  To the east, an intimidating wall of crates rises nearly to the ceiling, taking up a large portion of the building's floor space."],"exits":[{"to":323,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":326,"exit":"climb","move":"climb crates"}]},
  {"id":325,"x":610,"y":330,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Warehouse Office","descriptions":["This spacious office is as tidy as the rest of the warehouse.  The odor of fish is effectively masked by sweet glaysker incense.  The chairs for Suanealaena's clients are quite comfortable-looking, and her own a veritable throne of commercial power.  A landscape by Dochaval adorns the rear wall."],"exits":[{"to":323,"exit":"go","move":"go lunat door"}],"aliases":["Daralaendra"]},
  {"id":326,"x":610,"y":340,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Warehouse","descriptions":["You are precariously perched atop a wall of crates tall enough you can almost reach the building's solid-looking deobar rafters.  Below you on the east side, shadows gather in a corner concealed from the rest of the warehouse.  A knotted rope hangs from the rafters, out of your reach."],"exits":[{"to":327,"exit":"none","move":"east"},{"to":324,"exit":"none","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":327,"x":620,"y":340,"z":0,"title":"Back of Warehouse","descriptions":["A high stack of crates separates this hidden corner from the rest of the warehouse, while a few more crates serve as crude tables and chairs.  A knotted rope dangles from the rafters above, swinging slightly."],"exits":[{"to":326,"exit":"climb","move":"climb crates"}]},
  {"id":328,"x":270,"y":250,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Mansion Gate","descriptions":["A tall wrought-iron gate stands between walls of crystal-flecked granite.  Beyond rises a slate-roofed manse of some size, dominated by a single turret that sprouts from the gabled roof."],"exits":[{"to":329,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":73,"exit":"go","move":"go wrought-iron gate","hidden":true}]},
  {"id":329,"x":280,"y":260,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Armiger's Mansion Grounds","descriptions":["Dark green hedges, sculpted into geometric patterns with loving care, guide the eye along a pathway of brightly colored crushed stone that runs from the stately mansion and the equally stately gate."],"exits":[{"to":328,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":330,"exit":"climb","move":"climb porch stairs"}]},
  {"id":330,"x":290,"y":260,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Armiger's Mansion Porch","descriptions":["Overhanging eaves provide a cool shade along the front of the manor.  A nearby lounge swing, set with soft velvet cushions, invites one to sit and enjoy the rich green gardens.  A pair of ornately carved ironwood doors flanked by stained-glass windows lead into the house proper."],"exits":[{"to":329,"exit":"climb","move":"climb stairs"},{"to":331,"exit":"go","move":"go doors"}]},
  {"id":331,"x":300,"y":260,"z":0,"title":"Armiger's Mansion, Foyer","descriptions":["Hexagonal tiles set in bands of alternating gold and azure form the floor in this elegantly decorated foyer.  To one side is the comfortable lounge, with food and drink.  A sun parlor matches it on the opposite side of the hall.  A large hall tree holds the cloaks and other garments of visiting members."],"exits":[{"to":332,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":333,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":334,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":330,"exit":"go","move":"go outer doors"}],"aliases":["Armiger's Mansion","Estate Holders"]},
  {"id":332,"x":300,"y":250,"z":0,"title":"Armiger's Mansion, Members' Lounge","descriptions":["Flamewood panels cover the lower half of the walls in this delightfully decadent lounge.  Above a gilded chair rail, the upper walls are hung with heavy tapestries interset with heroic paintings.  Numerous low tables and soft settees and chairs abound in cozy groups for conversation or just plain relaxation.  An elaborate sideboard holds a cornucopia of refreshments.  Tall floor to ceiling windows look out onto a side garden where a fountain dances, silver drops of water sparkling as they fall."],"exits":[{"to":331,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":336,"exit":"go","move":"go doors"}],"aliases":["Members' Lounge"]},
  {"id":333,"x":310,"y":260,"z":0,"title":"Armiger's Mansion, Teller Windows","descriptions":["Deep emerald green floor tiles, gleaming oak walls and polished railings glow under the light of a dozen shaded oil lamps.  Patient clerks, standing behind the brass bars of the teller windows, murmur quietly to bank patrons, each word accentuated by the quiet clink of coins being tallied for deposit or withdrawal.  A pair of grim-faced guards flank the entrance, watching both clerks and customers with the same alert gaze, their presence giving palpable notice that naught will happen on their watch."],"exits":[{"to":335,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":331,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Premium Teller"]},
  {"id":334,"x":300,"y":270,"z":0,"title":"Armiger's Mansion, Sun Parlor","descriptions":["Enclosed on three sides in crystalline glass, the room seems to merge into the gardens outside.  Potted plants and cunningly pruned flowering vines cover the walls and most surfaces.  Wicker furniture set with floral-patterned cushions ranges about the room, no one piece blocking the relaxing view, giving the illusion that each grouping is in a private bower.","In the daytime, this parlor is flooded with natural light from three crystal walls opening onto a magnificent garden.  Even at night, the gardens outside are a delight to the eyes as hundreds of tiny lights sparkle and gleam in a myriad of colors, miniature stars caught in nets of flower-laden vines."],"exits":[{"to":331,"exit":"north","move":"north"}]},
  {"id":335,"x":310,"y":270,"z":0,"title":"Armiger's Mansion, Foreign Exchange","descriptions":["In contrast to the serene atmosphere of the outer teller area, the foreign exchange fairly thrums with the energy of motion and magic.  An iron-banded door set into the rear of the building bursts open at regular intervals, admitting dark-robed moon mages accompanied by sweating porters grunting under the weight of padlocked boxes.  Apprentices unpack stacks of exotic coinage under the watchful eyes of senior clerks, filling racks that are quickly conveyed to frantically gesturing tellers."],"exits":[{"to":333,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":338,"exit":"go","move":"go small niche"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Premium Exchange"]},
  {"id":336,"x":310,"y":250,"z":0,"title":"Armiger's Mansion, Garden of Fountains","descriptions":["Tucked between the high outer wall and the sturdy shoulder of the manse, this tiny garden somehow seems much larger than it really is.  A central fountain rises from mounds of deep green foliage covered with tiny star-shaped flowers of a silver-white hue.  A narrow path of crushed alabaster disappears into a compact, tree-shrouded glen."],"exits":[{"to":332,"exit":"go","move":"go doors"},{"to":337,"exit":"go","move":"go narrow path"}]},
  {"id":337,"x":320,"y":250,"z":0,"title":"Armiger's Mansion, Garden Bower","descriptions":["Miniature lunat trees form a quiet bower removed from the garden nearby.  The soft music of a fountain sweetens the grove as if butterflies had been given the gift of song.  A mossy hummock rises like a bench in the center.  The air is rich with the earthy smell of turf mingled with the soft scent of the many flowers growing all about."],"exits":[{"to":336,"exit":"go","move":"go narrow path"}]},
  {"id":338,"x":320,"y":270,"z":0,"title":"Armiger's Mansion, Gemseller","descriptions":["Set off the floor of the Foreign Exchange, this small niche is home to gemsmith Thramis Marflet.  Several brightly burning wax pillars illuminate the oak counter where the gemseller's tools of the trade sit.  Dotting the gleaming countertop, piles of loose gemstones refract the candlelight onto the walls in a glimmering pastel light show."],"exits":[{"to":335,"exit":"go","move":"go foreign exchange"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Premium Gems"]},
  {"id":339,"x":780,"y":760,"z":0,"title":"Salt Yard, Top of the Mound","descriptions":["You stand atop a huge salt mound in the middle of the yard, struggling to keep your footing on the slippery surface.  Around you on all sides, the city and the surrounding countryside stretches out in a colorful canvas.  To the west and south, the river winds its slow course past the town and out into the farmlands and forests beyond.  To the north, the narrow streets and low buildings of Riverhaven sit nestled within the tall city walls."],"exits":[{"to":79,"exit":"down","move":"down"}]},
  {"id":340,"x":597,"y":182,"z":0,"title":"War Mage Tower, Earth Floor","descriptions":["Bare, dark soil forms the floor underfoot.  The stony walls surrounding this circular room are similarly devoid of decoration, keeping instead the plain, natural look preferred by those mages who favor the element of Earth.  Doors leading to the initiates' cells line the walls."],"exits":[{"to":117,"exit":"climb","move":"climb brass staircase"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":341,"x":587,"y":222,"z":0,"title":"Warrior Mage Guild, Sanctuary","descriptions":["The walls of the small, dark cavern press close together, almost as if the earth were trying to reclaim this hole in its heart.  A small crack far above is the only possible exit from this place.  While wide enough to crawl out, it is doubtful anyone could squeeze their way back through."],"exits":[{"to":114,"exit":"up","move":"up"}]},
  {"id":342,"x":552,"y":370,"z":0,"title":"Bantheld's Ironworks, Backroom","descriptions":["Several workers grunt and sweat in this storage area as they lift and move huge crates of armor and accessories.  A gruff-looking Gor'Tog peers at you with a look which asks without words, Just what are you doing in my kingdom?  Several of the wooden boxes are open revealing different types of rings and plates used in making armor."],"exits":[{"to":206,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FFFF00","aliases":["Strength Training"]},
  {"id":343,"x":490,"y":140,"z":0,"title":"Clerics' Guild, Guildmaster's Office","descriptions":["The guildmaster's office is plain and austere, lit only by a single brass lantern resting atop a small neat desk.  A narrow cot, table, and a narrow footlocker beneath the bed complete the furnishings.  The walls and floor are simple stone, with a small prayer rug resting against one wall before a glittering silver icon."],"exits":[{"to":217,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FF8000","aliases":["GL Cleric","Jelna","RS Cleric"]},
  {"id":344,"x":480,"y":130,"z":0,"title":"Clerics' Guild, Hallway","descriptions":["The hallway runs along the center of the building, flanked by simple wooden doors leading to the cells where the guild's acolytes live.  Most of the doors are closed, but one stands open with a smiling robed monk waiting just inside."],"exits":[{"to":217,"exit":"climb","move":"climb stair"},{"to":345,"exit":"go","move":"go door"}]},
  {"id":345,"x":490,"y":130,"z":0,"title":"Clerics' Guild, Meditation Room","descriptions":["This tiny cell is utterly devoid of all ornament.  A bright fire burns in a simple stone pit in the center of the room, strangely smokeless.  The flickering light casts surreal shadows on the smooth white walls.  A smiling monk in a simple brown robe glances quietly at you from his position near the door."],"exits":[{"to":344,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":346,"x":920,"y":560,"z":0,"title":"Town Jail, The Cell","descriptions":["A very small barred window provides some fresh air to this barren room.  The walls, made of iron reinforced oak, would be barren were it not for the shackle rings placed every few feet apart.  A stone floor provides the only place to sit or lay.  A small wooden bucket sits in the corner but as you begin to approach it, the smell convinces you quickly that you don't want to know what's still in there."],"exits":[]},
  {"id":347,"x":561,"y":555,"z":0,"title":"Bards' Guild, Hallway","descriptions":["A single torch lights the short length of the hallway, its fitful flame casting more shadow than light.  Only a few strides in length, the cool stone floor terminates its journey at the base of a steep stair."],"exits":[{"to":348,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":139,"exit":"go","move":"go tall archway"},{"to":349,"exit":"climb","move":"climb steep stair"}]},
  {"id":348,"x":551,"y":555,"z":0,"title":"Bards' Guild, Cell","descriptions":["A few feet across and a scant Gor'Tog height in depth, this tiny cell is completely bare of any adornment save a sputtering oil torch.  The grey roughly finished stone of the walls is oddly uneven in size and shape and the flickering light gives a rippling impression as if seen underwater."],"exits":[{"to":347,"exit":"east","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":349,"x":561,"y":565,"z":0,"title":"Bards' Guild, Hallway","descriptions":["Delicately embroidered tapestries hang along the walls, accentuating the cool blue of the marble floor.  A thick carpet runner, woven with bold geometric shapes, leads the eye down the corridor to where it jogs westward."],"exits":[{"to":350,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":347,"exit":"climb","move":"climb steep stair"},{"to":352,"exit":"go","move":"go silver door"},{"to":353,"exit":"go","move":"go green door"},{"to":354,"exit":"go","move":"go blue door"},{"to":355,"exit":"go","move":"go plum door"}]},
  {"id":350,"x":551,"y":565,"z":0,"title":"Bards' Guild, Conservatory","descriptions":["Gleaming with a lemon oil and elbow grease polish, massive oak bookshelves overflow with haphazard stacks of manuscripts, scrolls, bound manuals and half-built instruments.  A leather chair, large enough to hold two Elotheans side-by-side, sits facing a set of etched glass doors.  Brass candle stands fitted with lit beeswax pillars cast warm pools of illumination and the middle of the room is occupied by a battered podium, its surface covered with curling sheets of parchment."],"exits":[{"to":349,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":351,"exit":"go","move":"go double doors"}]},
  {"id":351,"x":551,"y":575,"z":0,"title":"Bards' Guild, Terrace","descriptions":["A riotous landscape of life sprawls over the entire rooftop of the guild, sending the pungent odor of rich soil and growing things rising into the air.  From tiny bowls holding seedlings to behemoth tubs hosting fruit trees, containers are scattered across every inch of the flagstones.  A slim trail wends its way around an apricot tree, a swing dangling from its branches, before twisting out of sight behind a flowering calodendrum."],"exits":[{"to":350,"exit":"go","move":"go double doors"},{"to":516,"exit":"go","move":"go slim trail"}]},
  {"id":352,"x":571,"y":565,"z":0,"title":"Bards' Guild, Silver Room","descriptions":["A tall flambeau, filled with dozens of lit candle pillars, casts a glimmering curtain of light across a delicate curio cabinet snuggled into a corner of the charcoal-grey walls.  A cream rug with the guild insignia embroidered in silver thread cushions a tall three-legged stool and ornately carved music stand."],"exits":[{"to":349,"exit":"go","move":"go silver door"}]},
  {"id":353,"x":571,"y":555,"z":0,"title":"Bards' Guild, Green Room","descriptions":["Myriad shades of green give this room the aura of a forest glen.  From the deep emerald of the wall hangings, like summer leaves on an oak, to the pale spring grass berylline of the carpet, the glade-like illusion is spoiled only by the music stand and tall stool in the center of the floor."],"exits":[{"to":349,"exit":"go","move":"go green door"}]},
  {"id":354,"x":571,"y":575,"z":0,"title":"Bards' Guild, Blue Room","descriptions":["Linen-crisp clouds float across a deep indigo horizon.  Upon a second look, it becomes apparent that the summer sky is actually painted upon the ceiling.  The richly colored fresco is accentuated by the pale blue of a cushioned chair and the eggshell shade of the walls."],"exits":[{"to":349,"exit":"go","move":"go blue door"}]},
  {"id":355,"x":561,"y":575,"z":0,"title":"Bards' Guild, Plum Room","descriptions":["A loveseat, upholstered in a velvet dyed a dark plum, draws the eye to the center of the floor where a tall mahogany music stand waits patiently to hold the latest ballad or satire.  Thickly woven hangings and rugs, dyed in shades of gold and plum, give a warm and elegant aura to the room."],"exits":[{"to":349,"exit":"go","move":"go plum door"}]},
  {"id":356,"x":480,"y":430,"z":0,"title":"House of Bardic Blues, Shadowed Niche","descriptions":["Carefully placed sconces hold candles which cheerfully attempt to light this small area.  The walls are draped in light blue silk woven with silvery threads which help reflect the candlelight.  A display stand holds several baskets that show off artistically arranged jewelry pieces."],"exits":[{"to":320,"exit":"go","move":"go cloth-draped arch"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":357,"x":360,"y":650,"z":0,"title":"Traders' Guild, Trading Pit","descriptions":["The Pit is a crowded and noisy place full of rushing messengers and shouting Traders.  Deals are being made and unmade all about you as rows of numbers are scrawled and erased on chalkboards almost faster than you can read them.  Here and there, Traders shout out offers or counter-offers to one another as their scribes make hasty notes on wax tablets.  Goods and materials for half the province pass through the many hands at work all about you."],"exits":[{"to":224,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":137,"exit":"go","move":"go steep steps"}]},
  {"id":358,"x":640,"y":680,"z":0,"title":"City Statements","descriptions":["Plush lambswool carpeting in the foyer gives way to a polished oak plank floor supporting an array of building materials.  Although the best of the inventory has been used to furnish the shop's exterior, the selection on offer within is still attractive to the eye, and clearly of good quality.  The attendant, Junalar, is a meticulously-dressed man who seems to spend a good deal of his time polishing fingerprints off the merchandise."],"exits":[{"to":359,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":10,"exit":"out","move":"out","hidden":true}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["City Statements","door shop"]},
  {"id":359,"x":640,"y":670,"z":0,"title":"City Statements, Doors of Distinction","descriptions":["The polished oak plank floor serves as a suitable display area for a selection of unpretentious doors which stand in tidy rows around the room.  A willowy Elothean saleswoman leans casually against the central counter, wincing occasionally as the sound of hammers pounds from a back room and rattles the shutters on the oak-framed window overlooking the street."],"exits":[{"to":358,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":360,"x":590,"y":750,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Carousel Square","descriptions":["A massive conical building rises from the square's center, its snowy alabaster surfaces gleaming brilliantly against the drab backdrop of the surrounding stone and wood.  A bejeweled mosaic set above an oval doorway reads \"THE CAROUSEL.\"  ","A massive conical building rises from the square's center, its snowy alabaster surfaces gleaming brilliantly against the drab backdrop of the surrounding stone and wood.  Rows of torches encircle the structure's girth, their flames wavering lightly with the surrounding commotion and casting the building in sconces of shifting red tint.  A bejeweled mosaic set above an oval doorway reads THE CAROUSEL."],"exits":[{"to":10,"exit":"out","move":"out","hidden":true},{"to":361,"exit":"go","move":"go oval doorway"},{"to":556,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":361,"x":600,"y":750,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Carousel","descriptions":["Paneled in a rich dark wood of exotic origin, the walls of this circular room support a vast framework of iron and timbers rising to the building's apex.  Countless gears, pulleys and weights within the structure form the strikingly complex and beautiful mechanism which drives the Carousel."],"exits":[{"to":360,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":362,"exit":"go","move":"go registration desk"},{"to":363,"exit":"go","move":"go bronze arch"},{"to":363,"exit":"go","move":"go copper arch"},{"to":363,"exit":"go","move":"go brass arch"},{"to":542,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Vaults","Carousel Square"]},
  {"id":362,"x":610,"y":760,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Carousel Desk","descriptions":["A long wooden desk spans the width of the western wall.  Brass lanterns hang from the ceiling, and the floor behind the desk is covered in spotless red tile."],"exits":[{"to":361,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Lost and Found"]},
  {"id":363,"x":610,"y":750,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Carousel Booth","descriptions":["A polished wooden lever protrudes from the eastern wall of the small, ebony-panelled room, flanking a slightly rusted iron door to the north."],"exits":[{"to":361,"exit":"go","move":"go arch"},{"to":428,"exit":"go","move":"go door"}]},
  {"id":364,"x":362,"y":110,"z":0,"title":"Noble Inn Stable, Tack Room","descriptions":["Even the small tack room shows the marks of fine craftsmanship and attention to detail.  The brick floor is laid out in a herringbone pattern, and the terrazzo walls are polished to a soft gleam."],"exits":[{"to":274,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":365,"exit":"go","move":"go stablemaster's office"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Tack Room","Derlyk"]},
  {"id":365,"x":352,"y":110,"z":0,"title":"Noble Inn, Stablemaster's Office","descriptions":["The stablemaster's office lacks the opulent amenities offered to his charges.  The brick floor is laid out in a herringbone pattern, and the terrazzo walls are polished to a soft gleam, but the only furnishings are a wooden stool and a flame-scarred oak table.  A loft overhead presumably leads to a storage area, but no ladder is in sight to let you get there."],"exits":[{"to":364,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Samlet"]},
  {"id":366,"x":402,"y":89,"z":0,"title":"Noble Inn, Ballroom","descriptions":["Lines of soft black carpeting along the walls give way to a smooth polished wooden dance floor in the center of the room.  Atop a marble dais against the far wall stands what looks like a throne, veiled under a cloth of rich black velvet.  Opposite the throne is a sunken area where musicians would play for the grand balls held here.  Faded banners embroidered with coats of arms hang in a brightly colored parade from the high beamed ceiling overhead."],"exits":[{"to":276,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":367,"x":220,"y":210,"z":0,"title":"Aldamus Guesthouse, Dormitory","descriptions":["Windows at either end of the long room provide a cool breeze in the dormitory.  A double row of cots, separated by wood-framed parchment screens, provides inexpensive sleeping quarters to guests newly arrived in the town of Riverhaven."],"exits":[{"to":107,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":368,"x":440,"y":850,"z":0,"title":"The Masinyo Audru, Fore Waist","descriptions":["Slightly shorter than the main mast, the fore mast rises up with its stays and other rigging shooting off of it in all of the proper directions.  The fore shroud's lanyards are secured to polished chain-plates on the side of the ship, supporting the mast laterally.  A black-painted bulwark surrounds the deck, slightly lower along the starboard side to allow for easier disembarking once the vessel is moored."],"exits":[{"to":369,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":100,"exit":"go","move":"go marina"}],"aliases":["Masinyo Audru","chartered boat","boat"]},
  {"id":369,"x":440,"y":840,"z":0,"title":"The Masinyo Audru, Fore Topmast","descriptions":["The foretop platform rests at the head of the fore mast.  Aftward from here the main mast and its rigging is visible.  The vessel's bow is below and forward with its jigged sails and the fore stay which is rigged to the bowsprit."],"exits":[{"to":368,"exit":"down","move":"down"}]},
  {"id":370,"x":180,"y":610,"z":0,"title":"Seli's Armory, Workshop","descriptions":["The scent of freshly cured leather mixes with the sharp tang of burning wax rising from a large vat in the center of the room.  Bits of cuirboiled leather dry on wooden molds hung from the ceiling overhead.  Awls, hammers and decorative rivets lie scattered  amid scraps of leather, silk laces and pots of various dyes and stains atop the dented wooden table.  Stacks of cured and uncured hides stand in neat piles along the western wall."],"exits":[{"to":209,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Repair Leather","Wyla"]},
  {"id":371,"x":630,"y":390,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Small House","descriptions":["The surrounding buildings would obscure the small house tucked neatly between its more imposing neighbors if it were not for the single candle burning in the window facing the street.  From the gate on the street, a brick path leads through the yard to the entrance.","Cast into perpetual shadow by the surrounding buildings, this small house is easily missed by the casual passerby.  Thin, white lace curtains are drawn back in the window facing the street.  Smooth white stones cover the small front yard, a row of bright red bricks cuts through the floor of white creating a path from the gate to the front door."],"exits":[{"to":372,"exit":"go","move":"go front door"},{"to":55,"exit":"go","move":"go iron gate"}]},
  {"id":372,"x":630,"y":380,"z":0,"title":"Small House, Main Room","descriptions":["The interior is bright and cheerful as the stained woodwork contrasts the brightness of the whitewashed walls.  Covering more than half of the wooden floor, a deep crimson rug divides the room into a foyer and living area.  A polished cloak rack stands along the south wall.  On the opposite side of the room, an opulent set of chairs has been arranged around a small mahogany table."],"exits":[{"to":375,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":374,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":373,"exit":"go","move":"go wooden door"},{"to":371,"exit":"go","move":"go front door"}],"aliases":["Faysien"]},
  {"id":373,"x":630,"y":370,"z":0,"title":"Dilapidated House, Small Room","descriptions":["The small bedroom barely holds the vast amount of toys that are scattered around a thick oval carpet.  Upon the bed a battle of wooden soldiers appears to have taken place with the Humans the victor over the annihilated mass of carved Elven figurines.  Hanging above, from a wire that stretches from wall to wall, a stuffed silk balloon carries a miniature gondola through the air.  Cubbyholes crafted into the north wall of the room store the wardrobe of the room's young owner."],"exits":[{"to":372,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":374,"x":620,"y":380,"z":0,"title":"Small House, Master Bedroom","descriptions":["A brass bed frame with an over-stuffed mattress dominates the center of the room.  Sheer white lace bed curtains are tied back to the brass posts that nearly scrape the ceiling.  Atop a mahogany chest that lies at the foot of the bed, a pile of thick wool blankets stands ready to provide that extra warmth needed to fend off the chill of a Riverhaven night."],"exits":[{"to":372,"exit":"east","move":"east"}],"aliases":["Lalbot"]},
  {"id":375,"x":640,"y":380,"z":0,"title":"Small House, Kitchen","descriptions":["Highly polished floorboards and the bright yellow walls amplify the moderate light that the kitchen gets, making this the brightest room in the house.  A small table opposite the water basin has place settings for three.  Hanging above either side of the water basin, two wicker baskets of flowers are in magnificent bloom despite the limited amount of sunlight."],"exits":[{"to":372,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":376,"x":300,"y":290,"z":0,"title":"Mayor's Mansion, Entrance Hall","descriptions":["Wide and spacious, the imposing room features a high vaulted ceiling stretching up to the second story.  Gleaming white marble mined from the finest Therengian quarries tiles the floor, softened by a vivid Musparan silk rug.  A long mistwood table lines each of the side walls, both supporting ostentatious arrangements of fresh-cut flowers."],"exits":[{"to":377,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":378,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":380,"exit":"climb","move":"climb mistwood staircase"},{"to":288,"exit":"go","move":"go mistwood door"}],"aliases":["Mayor's Mansion"]},
  {"id":377,"x":310,"y":290,"z":0,"title":"Mayor's Mansion, Sitting Room","descriptions":["Stationed opposite each other, a pair of plush couches offers regulars and visitors ample opportunity to relax and converse.  A collection of paintings depicting the Therengian countryside hang from the mistwood-paneled walls, a convenient topic of discussion whenever an exchange grows dull.  The miniature bar off to one side appears fully stocked and supports several rows of crystal snifters atop its polished marble surface."],"exits":[{"to":376,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":378,"x":290,"y":290,"z":0,"title":"Mayor's Mansion, Dining Room","descriptions":["Stretching nearly the length of the entire area, an ornate mistwood table provides more than adequate space for hosting large parties or meals for a few.  Several chairs of the same wood flank the table, and a glittering crystal chandelier overhead douses the room with ambient light.  A multi-shelved cabinet rests in one corner, its glass door revealing the excessive amount of porcelain dinnerware and sterling silver flatware inside."],"exits":[{"to":376,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":379,"exit":"go","move":"go mistwood doors"}]},
  {"id":379,"x":280,"y":290,"z":0,"title":"Mayor's Mansion, Kitchen","descriptions":["The brightly lit area is home to dozens of shiny pots and pans dangling from a ceiling rack.  Covering the island in the middle of the room, various cooking utensils are made available for quick grabbing during rushed preparation.  Numerous mistwood cabinets sprawl across the painted white walls, and the double-basined sink allots more space for stray dishes and containers."],"exits":[{"to":378,"exit":"go","move":"go mistwood doors"}]},
  {"id":380,"x":300,"y":280,"z":0,"title":"Mayor's Mansion, Upstairs Hallway","descriptions":["A carved railing permits observers the chance to overlook the foyer below.  Filling the space with light and scent, a detailed gaethzen rose sprinkled with fragrant oil hangs overhead.  The glow highlights the characteristic green veins of the mistwood flooring, buffed meticulously for an immaculate presentation."],"exits":[{"to":381,"exit":"go","move":"go mistwood door"},{"to":382,"exit":"go","move":"go other mistwood door"},{"to":376,"exit":"climb","move":"climb mistwood staircase"}]},
  {"id":381,"x":310,"y":280,"z":0,"title":"Mayor's Mansion, Guest Room","descriptions":["Draped with a sheer gossamer canopy, the modest mistwood bed fits comfortably in the corner near a tall glass window.  A small couch lines the opposing wall, with a colorful Musparan silk area rug in the center of the room to break up the monotony.  Adjacent to the door, a porcelain washbasin and a clean white cloth sit atop a stout utility stand."],"exits":[{"to":380,"exit":"go","move":"go mistwood door"}]},
  {"id":382,"x":280,"y":280,"z":0,"title":"Mayor's Mansion, Master Bedroom","descriptions":["Piled high with down pillows, the massive bed is dressed in the best silk coverings Muspar'i has to offer.  A hefty chest at the foot and the broad desk in the corner completes the mistwood furniture theme.  Designed with a corresponding bench seat, a large bay window overlooks the activity on the commons."],"exits":[{"to":383,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":380,"exit":"go","move":"go mistwood door"}]},
  {"id":383,"x":260,"y":300,"z":0,"title":"Mayor's Mansion, Dressing Room","descriptions":["Light reflects off practically every surface of the room due to the multiple mirrors stationed strategically about.  A colossal mistwood wardrobe takes up the entire rear wall, filled to bursting with every piece of male attire imaginable.  Several shoe trees form an accessory forest underneath the dimpled glass window."],"exits":[{"to":382,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"}]},
  {"id":385,"x":890,"y":770,"z":0,"title":"Sandcastle Cove, Driftwood Designs","descriptions":["Moderately-priced home accessories created from natural materials line the walls of this small shop.  The owner, Rastmarrest, sits at the entrance, greeting customers with a friendly nod as he carves a small statuette from driftwood."],"exits":[{"to":86,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Sandcastle Cove","Driftwood Designs"]},
  {"id":386,"x":140,"y":480,"z":1,"title":"Riverhaven, A Cramped Corridor","descriptions":["This cramped space runs in a straight line for the length of a moderately sized building.  The lighting provided by a pair of hanging lanterns is little better than complete darkness and the space is restrictive enough to make even the bravest of Gor'Togs feel a twinge of claustrophobia.  Though the space has received enough care to remain reasonably clean, long scratches on the floor reveal a history of somewhat less than gentle treatment."],"exits":[{"to":36,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":421,"exit":"go","move":"go trap door"}]},
  {"id":387,"x":300,"y":580,"z":1,"title":"Thieves' Guild Bolthole, Beneath a Chicken Coop","descriptions":["An occasional feather and the rank smell of the chicken coop drift through the air of the bolthole.  Overhead, footsteps slap against the cobblestoned streets as the residents of the Halfling quarter make their way about their business.  Gaps between the floorboards allow a bit of light to filter in from outside."],"exits":[{"to":412,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":41,"exit":"go","move":"go trap door"}]},
  {"id":388,"x":280,"y":500,"z":1,"title":"Thieves' Guild Bolthole, Basement of Noot's Teahouse","descriptions":["Boxes and crates have been carefully piled to leave this part of the basement hidden from view.  The low ceiling provides a definite hazard to the heads of taller races as they make their way over to a low door in the back corner."],"exits":[{"to":302,"exit":"go","move":"go window grate"},{"to":414,"exit":"go","move":"go low door"},{"to":414,"exit":"go","move":"go shadowed nook"}]},
  {"id":389,"x":113,"y":640,"z":1,"title":"Thieves' Guild Bolthole, Near the Pawnshop","descriptions":["A group of men and women hunker down around a crate in one corner of this small shed, their attention focused on the cards in their hands.  The shack seems at first glance to be a flimsy affair, but despite the splintered boards, no drafts chill the interior of the structure.  Bales of straw piled around the door in the brick wall muffle the noise of the street outside and shield the glow of the lantern hanging from the ceiling.  Rickety wooden stairs lead down into darkness."],"exits":[{"to":417,"exit":"climb","move":"climb wooden stairs"},{"to":33,"exit":"go","move":"go wooden door"},{"to":417,"exit":"go","move":"go shadowed corner"}]},
  {"id":390,"x":690,"y":430,"z":1,"title":"Thieves' Guild Bolthole, The Rookery","descriptions":["Built out of scraps from wooden crates and boxes, the bolthole is little more than a rough shelter from the wind.  An arch at the back of the shelter leads into a brick building in somewhat better repair than most around the neighborhood.  The smell of cooking onions and cabbages permeates the air, almost masking the sour stench of dirt and worse."],"exits":[{"to":305,"exit":"go","move":"go narrow doorway"},{"to":425,"exit":"go","move":"go arch"},{"to":425,"exit":"climb","move":"climb cellar stairs"}]},
  {"id":391,"x":180,"y":580,"z":1,"title":"Riverhaven, A Wretched Hovel","descriptions":["The chill dirt floor is criss-crossed by slender lines of light as they pass through gaps in the wooden plank walls.  The 'door' is little more than a heavy piece of cloth with a few loose boards leaning against it to keep it from being blown inward by the occasional stiff breeze.  Deep shadows cloak the far corners of the hovel, undisturbed by light or wind in spite of nature's best efforts."],"exits":[{"to":47,"exit":"go","move":"go makeshift door"},{"to":423,"exit":"go","move":"-search shadow;-go opening"}]},
  {"id":392,"x":372,"y":120,"z":0,"title":"Noble Inn Stables, Brokerage Office","descriptions":["Traders congregate at the local stables, buying and selling horses and ponies.  The office lacks the usual plush accouterments found in the Traders' guild.  Instead of working behind polished mahogany desks, the clerks perch atop piles of sweet-smelling hay as they record the sales."],"exits":[{"to":274,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Brokerage Office"]},
  {"id":393,"x":352,"y":100,"z":0,"title":"Noble Inn, Paladin Representative's Quarters","descriptions":["Blue-grey silk draperies hang from a central point in the room's high ceiling, fanning out to fall in soft folds that conceal the walls.  A glass lantern hanging from the ceiling casts a warm glow over a sand table in the center of the room, and a folding screen curtains off one corner.  The windows are opened wide to let the night air carry with it the scent of the forest beyond the town walls.","Blue-grey silk draperies hang from a central point in the room's high ceiling, fanning out to fall in soft folds that conceal the walls.  A glass lantern hangs above a sand table in the center of the room, and a folding screen curtains off one corner.  The windows are opened wide to provide a view of the town walls and the forest beyond."],"exits":[{"to":278,"exit":"go","move":"go ironwood door"}],"color":"#FF8000","aliases":["GL Paladin","Remen","RS Paladin"]},
  {"id":394,"x":730,"y":680,"z":0,"title":"Saltfisher Inn, Basement","descriptions":["Even under the inn, you can still smell the fish aroma wafting from the nearby warehouses, mixing in with the dry dusty air.  A few wooden crates and some coiled ropes are the only occupants of the room.  An open door to your east leads into Harwell's back office."],"exits":[{"to":395,"exit":"go","move":"go open door"},{"to":93,"exit":"climb","move":"climb trapdoor"}]},
  {"id":395,"x":740,"y":680,"z":0,"title":"Saltfisher Inn, Harwell's Office","descriptions":["Harwell himself is upstairs, busy with his patrons, but when he finds a few moments of quiet, he comes here to count, among other things, his inventory and his money.  An ironwood desk sits huddled inbetween mounds of crates and boxes that hold most of Harwell's dry stock.  A lone lantern sits on the desk as if it were the guardian of all its light shines on.  A quill pen and heaps of parchment paper sit stacked neatly atop the desk."],"exits":[{"to":394,"exit":"go","move":"go open door"}]},
  {"id":398,"x":100,"y":490,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven Forging Society, Hallway","descriptions":["The ardent sound of anvil work carries from doors on either side of the hallway and echoes off the well-fitted granite floor.  A pair of masterwork weapons lines the wall as testament to the skilled work accomplished within."],"exits":[{"to":399,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":402,"exit":"go","move":"go oak arch"},{"to":404,"exit":"go","move":"go birch door"},{"to":441,"exit":"go","move":"go leather tarp"},{"to":557,"exit":"go","move":"go narrow alcove"}],"aliases":["Forging Society","Forging Clerk"]},
  {"id":399,"x":100,"y":500,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven Forging Society, Crafting Shop","descriptions":["A storefront backed up by boxes and cabinetry offers tools for sale.  Attendants rush back and forth helping customers and shout above the din of forging hammers smacking metal.  A stockpile of coal sits off to one side."],"exits":[{"to":398,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":400,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":406,"exit":"go","move":"go ebony arch"},{"to":408,"exit":"go","move":"go pine door"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["forging tools"]},
  {"id":400,"x":100,"y":510,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven Forging Society, Supply Shop","descriptions":["Bins of recently mined metal await sale next to eager attendants happily serving crafters' needs.  Several nearby crates contain additional materials for sale, including already smelted ingots."],"exits":[{"to":399,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":401,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":561,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":410,"exit":"go","move":"go willow arch"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["forging supplies"]},
  {"id":401,"x":100,"y":520,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven Forging Society, Office","descriptions":["A massive iron table decorated with pewter miniatures dominates this small office.  A soot-stained bookshelf and an oak chest with an ornate haralun lock sit nearby.  A chart detailing the techniques available for training hangs from the wall.","A massive iron table decorated with pewter miniatures dominates this small office.  A soot-stained bookshelf and an oak chest with an ornate haralun lock sit nearby.  Three charts detailing the techniques for weaponsmithing, armorsmithing and blacksmithing hang from the wall."],"exits":[{"to":400,"exit":"north","move":"north"}]},
  {"id":402,"x":110,"y":490,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven Forging Society, Crucible","descriptions":["Soot-stained stone walls rise up to a peaked roof where smoke and ash escape through several air vents.  To one side of the room a granite crucible hangs suspended over a glowing fire.  A pile of fuel lay scattered across the room from it and black footprints cover the stony ground."],"exits":[{"to":403,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":398,"exit":"go","move":"go oak arch"}]},
  {"id":403,"x":120,"y":490,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven Forging Society, Forge","descriptions":["Even the walls have accumulated moisture from the incredible heat rising from the forge fires.  A short distance away sits a hefty anvil with an extra long horn, a slack tub filled with water and a messy pile of fuel.  The clang of metal on metal assaults your ears as nearby forgers ply the trade."],"exits":[{"to":402,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":404,"x":90,"y":490,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven Forging Society, Crucible","descriptions":["Smaller than the other forging sections, this area shows extreme scorching from the great heat rising up from the forge fires.  Not an inch of the walls or floor has escaped, and now sits completely blacked out.  A granite crucible hangs from the ceiling over a glowing fire and a tidy fuel pile rests in the corner."],"exits":[{"to":405,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":398,"exit":"go","move":"go birch door"}]},
  {"id":405,"x":80,"y":490,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven Forging Society, Forge","descriptions":["Squeezed in as though space were a premium, this forging area is the smallest yet.  An iron anvil and slack tub occupy one corner and a pile of fuel occupies the other.  A distinct lack of clutter is the only thing keeping this area useable for getting work done."],"exits":[{"to":404,"exit":"east","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":406,"x":110,"y":500,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven Forging Society, Crucible","descriptions":["A cozy little room for forging, this room dampens the outside pounding noises for some reason.  In the room's center, a sturdy granite crucible hangs over a glowing fire and a pile of fuel occupies the corner."],"exits":[{"to":407,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":399,"exit":"go","move":"go ebony arch"}]},
  {"id":407,"x":120,"y":500,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven Forging Society, Forge","descriptions":["A low ceiling and thicker walls seem to muffle outside noises here.  An iron anvil with a thick horn sits across from a slack tub filled with water.  A pile of fuel rests atop a leather tarp in the corner."],"exits":[{"to":406,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":408,"x":90,"y":500,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven Forging Society, Crucible","descriptions":["A large granite crucible hanging over a glowing fire rests in the center of the room.  The fire pit beneath the crucible forms a star pattern from the way in which its stones arrange."],"exits":[{"to":409,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":399,"exit":"go","move":"go pine door"}]},
  {"id":409,"x":80,"y":500,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven Forging Society, Forge","descriptions":["Dents and chips line the walls as though someone once became careless with a forging hammer.  Placed diagonal to the wall is an iron anvil and a slack tub filled with water."],"exits":[{"to":408,"exit":"east","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":410,"x":110,"y":510,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven Forging Society, Crucible","descriptions":["The freshly scrubbed walls of this smelting spot indicate it is the preferred place for upper class patrons.  An organized pile of fuel sits nearby, and a large granite crucible hangs from decorated leather straps above a glowing fire."],"exits":[{"to":411,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":400,"exit":"go","move":"go willow arch"}]},
  {"id":411,"x":120,"y":510,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven Forging Society, Forge","descriptions":["Barely any soot remains on the walls or floor here, despite constant use.  A nice leather tarp holds a mountain of fuel, and nearby is a large anvil and forge fire that crackles and pops in the low light."],"exits":[{"to":410,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":412,"x":300,"y":570,"z":1,"title":"Thieves' Guild Bolthole, Beneath a Chicken Coop","descriptions":["Crates are piled one atop the other along each wall, some marked with the seal of the Trader's guild, others conspicuous in their lack of any markings whatsoever.  Boards laid across the crates serve to shore up the ceiling, though bits of dirt still trickle down as wagons roll over the cobblestoned street above.  A shielded lantern provides illumination for those who seek to practice their skills, secure from prying eyes."],"exits":[{"to":387,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":413,"exit":"go","move":"go shadowed corner"}]},
  {"id":413,"x":300,"y":560,"z":1,"title":"Thieves' Guild, A Shadowed Corner","descriptions":["Dampness coats the walls and floors of the boltholes used by the Thieves' Guild, barely noticeable as a faint, musty odor overlain by the earthy fragrance of wine and spices.  A thick rush mat covers the floor in this shadowed corner, though it's hard to see through the piles of boxes and crates, barrels and bundles, all heaped atop each other."],"exits":[{"to":412,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["GL Thief Coop","GL Thief 1"]},
  {"id":414,"x":290,"y":490,"z":1,"title":"Thieves' Guild Bolthole, A Narrow Tunnel","descriptions":["Water trickles through the dirt ceiling, falling with a loud *plop* against the floor.  Someone has laid down rushes and wooden boards to reduce the chance of muddy footprints that could lead the guards to the guild's lair.  The passage is narrow enough to require well-fed Gor'Togs to sidle through sideways if they want to avoid knocking against the beams that support the walls and ceiling."],"exits":[{"to":415,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":388,"exit":"go","move":"go low door"}]},
  {"id":415,"x":300,"y":480,"z":1,"title":"Thieves' Guild Bolthole, Muddy Cavern","descriptions":["The tunnel widens into a small cavern supported by an ingenious octagon arrangement of interlocking wooden beams along the walls and ceiling.  Mud forms an irregular moat spanned by wooden boards anchored to a rocky island piled high with barrels at the center of the cavern.  Fires burn around the perimeter of the space, helping to dry out the mud and keep the area warm."],"exits":[{"to":414,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":416,"exit":"go","move":"go shadowed nook"}]},
  {"id":416,"x":310,"y":469,"z":1,"title":"Thieves' Guild, A Shadowed Corner","descriptions":["Dampness coats the walls and floors of the boltholes used by the Thieves' Guild, barely noticeable as a faint, musty odor overlain by the earthy fragrance of wine and spices.  A thick rush mat covers the floor in this shadowed corner, though it's hard to see through the piles of boxes and crates, barrels and bundles, all heaped atop each other."],"exits":[{"to":415,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["GL Thief Halfling","GL Thief Own Kind","GL Thief Kind","GL Thief 2"]},
  {"id":417,"x":123,"y":640,"z":1,"title":"Thieves' Guild Bolthole, Small Cavern","descriptions":["Musty straw squelches unpleasantly underfoot, absorbing the water that trickles down the walls of the cavern.  Empty crates serve as tables to hold muslin-wrapped bolts of jewel-toned velvet, pale silk and white lace, rapidly tarnishing silver or small boxes filled with assorted jewelry.  Other crates are piled one atop the other, their contents hidden from view, with narrow aisles running between them."],"exits":[{"to":419,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":418,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":389,"exit":"climb","move":"climb stairs"}]},
  {"id":418,"x":113,"y":630,"z":1,"title":"Thieves' Guild Bolthole, Small Cavern","descriptions":["A workbench at the back of the cavern contains an array of jeweler's tools -- a small vice, a brazier, a hammer and some pliers, and other less readily recognizable pieces of equipment for removing precious gems and melting down metals into unidentifiable lumps.  The lamp above the bench is unlit, and the jeweler nowhere in sight.  Wooden crates stacked one atop the other line the center of the cavern, forming small passages through the cave."],"exits":[{"to":419,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":417,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}]},
  {"id":419,"x":133,"y":630,"z":1,"title":"Thieves' Guild Bolthole, Small Cavern","descriptions":["The floor slopes down to the west and south from this, the highest (and dryest) point in the cavern.  Smoked hams and sausages, bags of salt and spices, all hang from hooks in the ceiling.  Other perishable goods such as fabric are stacked in open crates which line the walls."],"exits":[{"to":417,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":418,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":420,"exit":"go","move":"go shadowed corner"}]},
  {"id":420,"x":133,"y":640,"z":1,"title":"Thieves' Guild, A Shadowed Corner","descriptions":["Dampness coats the walls and floors of the boltholes used by the Thieves' Guild, barely noticeable as a faint, musty odor overlain by the earthy fragrance of wine and spices.  A thick rush mat covers the floor in this shadowed corner, though it's hard to see through the piles of boxes and crates, barrels and bundles, all heaped atop each other.  "],"exits":[{"to":419,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["GL Thief Pawnshop","GL Thief Selling Goods","GL Thief 3"]},
  {"id":421,"x":140,"y":470,"z":1,"title":"Riverhaven, Storage Area","descriptions":["Shipping crates are stacked throughout the area in a manner that indicates either a very complex method of organization or total chaos.  Each crate is stamped with the names of several locations that were probably intended to indicate their origin, destination, and various outposts through which they passed.  Curiously, however, not a single crate is marked in such a way that indicates that it ought to have ended up here."],"exits":[{"to":386,"exit":"climb","move":"climb trap door"},{"to":422,"exit":"go","move":"go shadowed corner"}]},
  {"id":422,"x":140,"y":460,"z":1,"title":"Thieves' Guild, A Shadowed Corner","descriptions":["Dampness coats the walls and floors of the boltholes used by the Thieves' Guild, barely noticeable as a faint, musty odor overlain by the earthy fragrance of wine and spices.  A thick rush mat covers the floor in this shadowed corner, though it's hard to see through the piles of boxes and crates, barrels and bundles, all heaped atop each other.  "],"exits":[{"to":421,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["GL Thief Silvermoon Road","GL Thief Silvermoonroad","GL Thief 4"]},
  {"id":423,"x":170,"y":580,"z":1,"title":"Riverhaven, A Narrow Passage","descriptions":["This cramped space is reasonably well enclosed, although the rough planks do little to hold back the dampness which seems to ooze out of the walls.  One end of this corridor ends at a small opening, giving access to the hovel outside.  The opposite corner is too deeply cloaked in shadows to judge what it contains."],"exits":[{"to":391,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":424,"exit":"go","move":"go shadowed corner"}]},
  {"id":424,"x":160,"y":580,"z":1,"title":"Thieves' Guild, A Shadowed Corner","descriptions":["Dampness coats the walls and floors of the boltholes used by the Thieves' Guild, barely noticeable as a faint, musty odor overlain by the earthy fragrance of wine and spices.  A thick rush mat covers the floor in this shadowed corner, though it's hard to see through the piles of boxes and crates, barrels and bundles, all heaped atop each other.  "],"exits":[{"to":423,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["GL Thief Crescent Way","GL Thief Crescentway","GL Thief 5"]},
  {"id":425,"x":700,"y":430,"z":1,"title":"Thieves' Guild Bolthole, A Cramped Apartment","descriptions":["No more than five paces from end to end, this tiny room on the first floor of the building is full of worn-out furniture.  Tufts of padding poke out of comfortable chairs, a sofa has a small chest propping up a missing leg, and the low table in the center of the room is marred by water rings.  A clear path has been left between the arch on the outer wall and the cellar stairs.  Curiously enough, there doesn't seem to be any entrance from this apartment into the main part of the tenement."],"exits":[{"to":390,"exit":"go","move":"go arch"},{"to":426,"exit":"climb","move":"climb cellar stairs"}]},
  {"id":426,"x":700,"y":440,"z":1,"title":"Thieves' Guild Bolthole, Cellar","descriptions":["A lantern hangs by the base of the stairs, casting a soft circle of light about ten paces across, but since the cellar is closer to twenty paces in width, much of the area is in shadows.  More lanterns would pose a risk of fire or the chance of outside notice, always something to be avoided by those who do business here.  The single lamp provides just enough light to see the piles of boxes, crates and barrels that fill the dank, dirt-floored basement."],"exits":[{"to":425,"exit":"climb","move":"climb cellar stairs"},{"to":427,"exit":"go","move":"go shadowed corner"}]},
  {"id":427,"x":710,"y":440,"z":1,"title":"Thieves' Guild, A Shadowed Corner","descriptions":["Dampness coats the walls and floors of the boltholes used by the Thieves' Guild, barely noticeable as a faint, musty odor overlain by the earthy fragrance of wine and spices.  A thick rush mat covers the floor in this shadowed corner, though it's hard to see through the piles of boxes and crates, barrels and bundles, all heaped atop each other."],"exits":[{"to":426,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["GL Thief Rookery","GL Thief 6"]},
  {"id":428,"x":620,"y":750,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Carousel Chamber","descriptions":["A sturdy vault, set in the back wall, stands ready for your use.  The floor is covered by a soft thick carpet, and the rooms walls are polished gold pine.  Looking at the back wall, you notice a tiny gap between it and the rest of the room.  A multifaceted quartz crystal hangs suspended from the ceiling."],"exits":[{"to":363,"exit":"go","move":"close vault;go door"}]},
  {"id":429,"x":423,"y":580,"z":0,"title":"Knight's Hall, Foyer","descriptions":["Column-ringed, this circular room has a high ceiling painted in birds, clouds and deep blue sky.  A soft light is provided by oil lamps in bowls that are suspended in rings.  Ornate, gilded chairs stand before a grey marble fireplace with a crackling fire.  Across from the seating area, a large listings board hangs between two of the three arches providing access to the shop fronts."],"exits":[{"to":433,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":437,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":430,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":51,"exit":"go","move":"go marble arch"},{"to":440,"exit":"go","move":"go oaken door"}],"aliases":["Knight's Hall","Market Plaza","Plaza","Foyer","listings board","board"]},
  {"id":430,"x":413,"y":570,"z":0,"title":"Knight's Hall, Keep Room","descriptions":["Placed centrally, a large and heavily varnished square mistwood case with a glass dome is the only piece of furniture in the room.  Portraits in ornate frames line the two long walls with the Therengia standard on brass poles standing guard at each end of the room.  Shoppers and merchants stop to gaze at the panorama before moving on to their business."],"exits":[{"to":429,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":431,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":562,"exit":"climb","move":"climb stone steps"}],"aliases":["Keep Room"]},
  {"id":431,"x":403,"y":560,"z":0,"title":"Knight's Hall, Dungeon Room","descriptions":["Manacles and leg irons hang from the dark granite-colored walls.  Low-set limestone tables with recesses carved into them are covered with heavy glass plates.  A brazier stands ready in the middle of the room with dark, cold coals and a large bellow leaning against it.  Oiled torches in heavy pewter sconces provide a flickering light and a haze of smoke near the ceiling."],"exits":[{"to":430,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":432,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"aliases":["Dungeon Room"]},
  {"id":432,"x":393,"y":550,"z":0,"title":"Knight's Hall, Storage Area","descriptions":["Large cabinets line all four walls, with plaques on each door pertaining to the various shops in the Hall.  Heavy padlocks on steel chains keep them secure.  A low cart on wheels stands vacant and ready to help transport the contents as each trader might need them.  The thick oaken planks of the floor have been swept clear of all debris, but is marked in places where there might have been spills or falling objects."],"exits":[{"to":431,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}],"aliases":["Storage Area"]},
  {"id":433,"x":423,"y":570,"z":0,"title":"Knight's Hall, Rose Room","descriptions":["Large crystal vases on cherrywood stands line the walls with two long rows of padded benches placed back to back down the center.  Freshly cut roses of white, pink and deep red are carefully arranged in each vase, lending a heady scent to the room.  Alert guards prevent curious children and lovesick young men escorting pretty young ladies from helping themselves to the flowers."],"exits":[{"to":434,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":429,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"aliases":["Rose Room"]},
  {"id":434,"x":423,"y":560,"z":0,"title":"Knight's Hall, Warrior Room","descriptions":["Central in the room, a life-sized carved wooden warhorse stands rearing on a woven burgundy runner outlined in brass stanchions with velvet covered ropes.  The steed is fully bedecked in a suit of polished plate, tassels of gold threads hanging from its harness and a brass-riveted scabbard hanging beside the black leather saddle.  Paintings of stallions in battle are hung above high-backed gilded chairs placed near the entrances to the various shops."],"exits":[{"to":435,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":433,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"aliases":["Warrior Room"]},
  {"id":435,"x":423,"y":550,"z":0,"title":"Knight's Hall, Food Plaza","descriptions":["Leather-backed chairs and small tables in sets of two to four are arranged neatly inside a small wrought-iron partitioned area.  Serving carts laded with food and drinks line the walls with staff ready to quickly wipe away all evidence of past partakers as customers and merchants stop for a small repast."],"exits":[{"to":436,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":434,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"aliases":["Food Plaza"]},
  {"id":436,"x":423,"y":540,"z":0,"title":"Knight's Hall, Children's Room","descriptions":["The oak walls have been whitewashed and then painted with a fanciful woodland scene in bright colors.  A young girl and boy watch from behind a large pine tree as animals gather peacefully around a sparkling stream as wisps dance in the air around them.  An equal number of small stools in white and silver are placed on a large checkerboard painted onto the floor."],"exits":[{"to":435,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"aliases":["Children's Room"]},
  {"id":437,"x":433,"y":570,"z":0,"title":"Knight's Hall, Theatre Room","descriptions":["Chairs in short rows are seated before a dais with a miniature stage set in a large box with a red velvet curtain hanging on the back.  The bright colorful hat of a jester puppet peeks through, awaiting the return of its handler.  Playbills from past performances of the Theren Theatre group are hung in simple frames.  A large barrel filled with bags of popcorn is filled by an industrious staff member."],"exits":[{"to":438,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":429,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}],"aliases":["Theatre Room"]},
  {"id":438,"x":443,"y":560,"z":0,"title":"Knight's Hall, World Room","descriptions":["Tapestries embroidered with battle scenes with noble paladins, valiant archers and mages releasing lightning bolts and balls of fire against their enemies are displayed on all four walls.  The floor is painted with an elaborate map of the five provinces of Elanthia that has been protected by many coats of clear varnish.  Children stop to follow the trade routes that have been outlined in grey, wandering on tip-toe through mountain ranges and rushing rivers alike."],"exits":[{"to":439,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":437,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}],"aliases":["World Room"]},
  {"id":439,"x":453,"y":550,"z":0,"title":"Knight's Hall, The Back Room","descriptions":["Compact and dark-paneled, the room is full of discarded furniture pushed together into all four corners.  Mismatched paintings hang askew on the walls a seascape, a faded portrait of a dark-haired woman and large oil of splashes of color that someone has sliced from corner to corner.  People move quickly into the shops and out, not caring to spend time loitering in this dimly-lit area."],"exits":[{"to":438,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}],"aliases":["Back Room"]},
  {"id":440,"x":413,"y":590,"z":0,"title":"Knight's Hall, Administration Office","descriptions":["Long benches line both sides of the door, filling quickly as another merchant or vendor is called up to the counter.  Clerks with long-suffering looks speak to the traders in low tones, as each appears to haggle over prices on sheets they hold or file a complaint about thieves, loiterers or noisy children."],"exits":[{"to":429,"exit":"go","move":"go oaken door"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Administration Office"]},
  {"id":441,"x":100,"y":480,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven Forging Society, Book Store","descriptions":["Well-fitted granite brick encloses this space.  Thick oak doors exit onto the street, and a thick tarp leads deeper into the forging chambers.  To the side a burly guard limits entry through a narrow arch.  A rhythmic pounding echoes from inside the building."],"exits":[{"to":442,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":35,"exit":"go","move":"go oak doors"},{"to":443,"exit":"go","move":"go narrow arch"},{"to":398,"exit":"go","move":"go leather tarp"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Forge","Forging Prestige"]},
  {"id":442,"x":90,"y":480,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven Forging Society, Deed Vendor","descriptions":["Thick steel bars block access to a depot storing a multitude of resources and crafted goods.  Workers hoist larger pieces atop massive shelving using an intricate network of ropes and pulleys."],"exits":[{"to":441,"exit":"east","move":"east"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Deed Vendor"]},
  {"id":443,"x":110,"y":480,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven Forging Society, Maker's Mark Shop","descriptions":["A selection of organized patterns, templates and designs for maker's marks line the walls.  A handful of prestigious crafters browse the possibilities and discuss selections with nearby attendants.  An arch leads back into the main lobby."],"exits":[{"to":441,"exit":"go","move":"go narrow arch"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Maker's Mark Shop"]},
  {"id":444,"x":500,"y":880,"z":0,"title":"The Kree'la, Main Deck","descriptions":["The deck is split down the middle by an open pit, bracketed on each end by the two masts.  The opening is more for ventilation for the rowers than for onlookers to look down on them, and rungs on each mast give access to the rower's pit.  Aft, a set of stairs climb up to the pilot's deck and underneath are located the only two cabins aboard the galley.  Rigging rises up to the masts, holding them in place, and a rope ladder ascends the forward mast."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"go","move":"go small door"},{"to":0,"exit":"go","move":"go narrow door"},{"to":0,"exit":"climb","move":"climb rope ladder"},{"to":104,"exit":"go","move":"go riverhaven"},{"to":0,"exit":"go","move":"forward"},{"to":0,"exit":"go","move":"go neh dock"}],"aliases":["Kree'la","Ratha"],"linksTo":"Map998_Transports.xml"},
  {"id":445,"x":440,"y":720,"z":0,"title":"Fang Cove, Fate's Fortune Lane","descriptions":["A towering marble archway opens a gap in the wall to the north and separates the ongoing construction and somewhat more refined completed structures of Fate's Fortune Lane from the crude structures and makeshift walkway along the beach.  The entrance to a squat, wide bungalow sits in opposition to the arch, and the sheltering cliffs of Fang's Peak rise up from behind it.  To either side of the arch, cobblestones of different shapes and sizes have been laid out to form the wide Fate's Fortune Lane."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":0,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":0,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":8,"exit":"go","move":"go exit portal"}],"aliases":["Fang Cove"],"linksTo":"Map150_Fang_Cove.xml"},
  {"id":446,"x":372,"y":89,"z":0,"title":"Noble Inn, White Room","descriptions":["Painted vines twine against a lattice background along the walls, creating a charming garden bower around the white wicker bed.  A plush moss-green rug, soft and inviting, covers the pale birch floor.  Dried lavender blossoms fill the room with a sweet herbal fragrance from a bowl of potpourri on the bedside table."],"exits":[{"to":277,"exit":"go","move":"go white door"}]},
  {"id":447,"x":382,"y":89,"z":0,"title":"Noble Inn, Blue Room","descriptions":["Flames crackle in a black cast iron stove atop a tiled hearth, filling the room with an inviting warmth and the scent of pine.  Plump white linen pillows create a soft nest atop the deep blue silk coverlet on the bed.  Nearby, a round cream table has been painted with pale blue forget-me-nots, echoing the painted border on the walls."],"exits":[{"to":277,"exit":"go","move":"go blue door"}]},
  {"id":448,"x":421,"y":356,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven Outfitting Society, Book Store","descriptions":["Shelves of books line the walls of this otherwise simple room.  Set off to one side is a long oak counter with a long silk tablecloth dangling just slightly over the edges where patrons wait patiently to purchase their work books."],"exits":[{"to":449,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":66,"exit":"go","move":"go double doors"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Outfitting Society"]},
  {"id":449,"x":421,"y":366,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven Outfitting Society, Hallway","descriptions":["Clear glass cases span the length of the hallway, displaying fanciful quilts of all different shapes, colors and patterns.  Upon a table set across from the displays is a simple bouquet of silk flowers within an ornate glass vase."],"exits":[{"to":448,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":451,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":452,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":450,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":555,"exit":"go","move":"go stone archway"}],"aliases":["Outfitting Prestige"]},
  {"id":450,"x":411,"y":366,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven Outfitting Society, Supply Depot","descriptions":["Grand marble tables and shelves fill the room with fashionable product for sale.  Upon the surfaces is a wide variety of stylish fabrics in a broad spectrum of color."],"exits":[{"to":449,"exit":"east","move":"east"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Outfitting Supplies"]},
  {"id":451,"x":431,"y":366,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven Outfitting Society, Tool Store","descriptions":["Devoid of decoration, rows of shelving line the walls and hold various tools for sale in the shop.  Filling them are fine spools of thread, flat irons, straight pins and needles -- the absolute essentials for creating the perfect garment.  Tiny cobwebs hang in the corners of the ceiling, strands dangling down to the surfaces below."],"exits":[{"to":449,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Outfitting Tools"]},
  {"id":452,"x":431,"y":376,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven Outfitting Society, Hallway","descriptions":["Painted upon the center of a brown wall are women and men dressed in a variety of stylish clothing.  From either side of the grandiose painting hang dark green curtains made of thick cloth which frame the work of art.  A soft chaise lounge rests on the other side of the hall next to a series of workroom doors."],"exits":[{"to":453,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":449,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":455,"exit":"go","move":"go painted door"},{"to":456,"exit":"go","move":"go pine door"},{"to":457,"exit":"go","move":"go oak door"}]},
  {"id":453,"x":441,"y":376,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven Outfitting Society, Hallway","descriptions":["Painted upon brown walls are soft green leaves that appear to be floating down from the branches of an unseen tree.  Near the base, chipmunks and squirrels play with each other.  Soft cloth mats rest before several workroom doors."],"exits":[{"to":454,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":452,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":458,"exit":"go","move":"go marble door"},{"to":459,"exit":"go","move":"go carved door"},{"to":460,"exit":"go","move":"go stylized door"}]},
  {"id":454,"x":451,"y":376,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven Outfitting Society, Office","descriptions":["Sheer green material dangles from the ceiling and flows down to the floor in billowing cascades surrounding a neat desk and chair.  Hanging on the walls are framed sketches of various clothing designs, each drawn with an obviously skilled hand.  Situated to one side of the room is a green velvet sofa before a masterfully carved oak table."],"exits":[{"to":453,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":455,"x":421,"y":376,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven Outfitting Society, Weaving Room","descriptions":["Set in the back of the large workroom is a hefty loom.  Hooks and shelves line the soft blue walls, holding various tools and spools of thread that are currently not in use.  To the rear of the room is a large work table and bench."],"exits":[{"to":452,"exit":"go","move":"go painted door"}],"aliases":["Weaving1"]},
  {"id":456,"x":421,"y":386,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven Outfitting Society, Weaving Room","descriptions":["Set in the back of the large workroom is a hefty loom.  Hooks and shelves line the deep purple walls, holding various tools and spools of thread that are currently not in use.  To the rear of the room is a large work table and bench."],"exits":[{"to":452,"exit":"go","move":"go pine door"}],"aliases":["Weaving2"]},
  {"id":457,"x":431,"y":386,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven Outfitting Society, Weaving Room","descriptions":["Set in the back of the large workroom is a hefty loom.  Hooks and shelves line the checkerboard walls, holding various tools and spools of thread that are currently not in use.  To the rear of the room is a large work table and bench."],"exits":[{"to":452,"exit":"go","move":"go oak door"}],"aliases":["Weaving3"]},
  {"id":458,"x":441,"y":366,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven Outfitting Society, Spinning Room","descriptions":["Pale pink silk flowers carefully affixed to the soft blue walls create a gentle elegance to the room.  Beneath a large spinning wheel is a white hide rug trimmed with thick ribbon.  A large workbench and chair pressed against the back wall provide a convenient place to relax."],"exits":[{"to":453,"exit":"go","move":"go marble door"}],"aliases":["Spinning1"]},
  {"id":459,"x":451,"y":366,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven Outfitting Society, Spinning Room","descriptions":["Pale yellow silk flowers carefully affixed to the burnt orange walls create a gentle elegance to the room.  Beneath a large spinning wheel is a yellow woven rug trimmed with black velvet tassels.  A large workbench and chair pressed against the back wall provide a convenient place to relax."],"exits":[{"to":453,"exit":"go","move":"go carved door"}],"aliases":["Spinning2"]},
  {"id":460,"x":441,"y":386,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven Outfitting Society, Spinning Room","descriptions":["Brilliant orange silk flowers carefully affixed to the dark green walls create a gentle elegance to the room.  Beneath a large spinning wheel is a padded silk rug trimmed with braided cord.  A large workbench and chair pressed against the back wall provide a convenient place to relax."],"exits":[{"to":453,"exit":"go","move":"go stylized door"}],"aliases":["Spinning3"]},
  {"id":461,"x":532,"y":182,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven Engineering Society, Main Hall","descriptions":["The bustling main hallway of the large building provides a place for people to gather and discuss new ideas with one another.  Stone benches topped with soft cushions offer moderately comfortable seating for those who wish to rest their weary bones.  On either side of the benches stand intricate pedestals which bear carved marble vases filled with floral bouquets."],"exits":[{"to":463,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":464,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":462,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":25,"exit":"go","move":"go stone archway"},{"to":560,"exit":"go","move":"go banded doors"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Engineering Society"]},
  {"id":462,"x":520,"y":182,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven Engineering Society, Paarupensteen's Office","descriptions":["An elaborate gold birdcage rests on a large stand, placed next to a makeshift desk in the center of the room.  Along the far wall, a workbench bearing a variety of gadgets and tools display what Paarupensteen treasures most in life.  Upon the wall above the workbench hangs a picture of a plump Halfling woman next to an equally so Halfling man."],"exits":[{"to":461,"exit":"east","move":"east"}],"aliases":["Paarupensteen's Office"]},
  {"id":463,"x":532,"y":170,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven Engineering Society, Repair Shop","descriptions":["Bustling back and forth from the shop's backroom, harried workers carry goods that are either in need of repair or have been completed.  Behind a long counter, which spans nearly the width of the room, stands the shop's repairwoman.  Upon the wall behind her are rows of shelves which hold repaired goods waiting for their owner to retrieve them."],"exits":[{"to":461,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Tool Repairs","Valomenica","Repair Tools"]},
  {"id":464,"x":544,"y":182,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven Engineering Society, Hallway and Bookstore","descriptions":["Marbled flooring surrounded by white walls, which are accented with brass lanterns, span the length of the hall.  Not as many crafters walk through this end of the building, though echoes of pounding hammers permeate the hallway.  A carved sign bearing workshop rules hangs from the wall before three doors."],"exits":[{"to":465,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":461,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":467,"exit":"go","move":"go blue door"},{"to":468,"exit":"go","move":"go brown door"},{"to":469,"exit":"go","move":"go black door"}],"aliases":["Engineering Prestige"]},
  {"id":465,"x":544,"y":170,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven Engineering Society, Crafting Supplies","descriptions":["Like most of the Society Hall, the shop is neat and clean.  Attendants bustle around with brooms and rags cleaning the marbled floors and smooth stone walls.  Behind the counter are crates of supplies to restock the tables and countertops so that any crafter in need of a specific tool does not go without.  Sheer black curtains upon a small oval window shield the shop from prying eyes outside."],"exits":[{"to":466,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":464,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Engineering Tools"]},
  {"id":466,"x":556,"y":170,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven Engineering Society, Resource Depot","descriptions":["Solid white stone walls encompass the marbled flooring of the shop.  A large double door guarded by two Gor'Togs allows workers to travel between the store and the outside of the building where they bring in new shipments or prepare to be transferred to one of the workshops.  Several raised platforms upon the floor bear heavy blocks of stone which are waiting to be crafted into furniture or unique decorations for the home.","Solid white stone walls encompass the marbled flooring of the shop.  A large double door guarded by two Gor'Togs allows workers to travel between the store and the outside of the building where they bring in new shipments or prepare to be transferred to one of the workshops.  Several raised platforms upon the floor bear thick logs and heavy blocks of stone which are waiting to be crafted into furniture or unique decorations for the home."],"exits":[{"to":465,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Engineering Supplies","Stone Depot"]},
  {"id":467,"x":544,"y":194,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven Engineering Society, Workshop","descriptions":["Smooth and clean white walls and floors bare of decorations span the room.  Several workstations are set up within, each neat and tidy and set up to accommodate any particular needs a crafter could have.  Standing next to the door is a pair of attendants who quietly wait for an opportunity to clear out the waste bucket or wipe down a dirty work area."],"exits":[{"to":464,"exit":"go","move":"go blue door"}]},
  {"id":468,"x":556,"y":194,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven Engineering Society, Workshop","descriptions":["Set firmly against the smooth stone walls are various tables bearing stone carved items in various stages.  Towards the far back of the room, roped off with a thick chain, is a large doorway to the outside, which is used to haul larger pieces outside the building for delivery.  Attendants stand at the ready waiting to clean off tables once they have been cleared and empty waste buckets."],"exits":[{"to":464,"exit":"go","move":"go brown door"}]},
  {"id":469,"x":556,"y":182,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven Engineering Society, Workshop","descriptions":["Not as neat and clean as the other workshops, this room is geared towards the crafting of smaller goods.  Rows of tables line the room, holding various carved weapons and small decorations.  Near the door, an inattentive attendant sits in a chair, her eyes closed and feet resting on an unused block of stone."],"exits":[{"to":464,"exit":"go","move":"go black door"}]},
  {"id":470,"x":37,"y":740,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven Alchemy Society, Entrance and Tool Store","descriptions":["Shelves showcasing a variety of alchemical tools line the thick stone walls of this room that is otherwise void of additional furniture.  The ground shifts from dirt to rough-hewn stone outside a heavily reinforced passage leading downward into the laboratories themselves.  A bright-eyed Moon Mage stands at the entrance to the earthen tunnel, welcoming society prospects and veterans alike."],"exits":[{"to":471,"exit":"down","move":"down"},{"to":1,"exit":"go","move":"go reinforced door"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Alchemy Society","Alchemy Tools"]},
  {"id":471,"x":37,"y":750,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven Alchemy Society, Tunnel","descriptions":["A series of sconces dot the heavily reinforced walls of the tunnel leading deep into the heart of the Alchemy Society's laboratories, ensuring that any disastrous explosions are safely contained away from the populace above.  Burly Human workers pass by intermittently, carefully guiding warning-labeled carts deep into the heart of the society."],"exits":[{"to":470,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":472,"exit":"down","move":"down"},{"to":559,"exit":"go","move":"go stone entryway"}]},
  {"id":472,"x":37,"y":773,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven Alchemy Society, Lobby and Supplies","descriptions":["Gaethzen spheres dot the ceiling of this the massive underground chamber, fully illuminating the heavy steel cases containing supplies located in the center of the room and brightening the long tunnels spreading outward to partitioned laboratories.  A group of young Warrior Mages stand beside a scowling Gnomish Barbarian, ready to respond to any disasters taking place."],"exits":[{"to":481,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":479,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":478,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":477,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":476,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":475,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":474,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":473,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":471,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":480,"exit":"down","move":"down"},{"to":482,"exit":"go","move":"go leather tarp"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Alchemy Supplies"]},
  {"id":473,"x":27,"y":763,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven Alchemy Society, Workroom","descriptions":["A set of alchemical equipment is centered in this laboratory carved out of dense granite.  The high ceilings are dotted with small holes that provide a way for any deadly gasses released to eventually make their way to the surface, while a passage to the southeast affords anyone in the room the chance to escape from a dangerous conflagration of chemicals."],"exits":[{"to":472,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}]},
  {"id":474,"x":27,"y":773,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven Alchemy Society, Workroom","descriptions":["A set of alchemical equipment is centered in this laboratory carved out of dense granite.  The high ceilings are dotted with small holes that provide a way for any deadly gasses released to eventually make their way to the surface, while a passage to the east affords anyone in the room the chance to escape from a dangerous conflagration of chemicals."],"exits":[{"to":472,"exit":"east","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":475,"x":27,"y":783,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven Alchemy Society, Workroom","descriptions":["A set of alchemical equipment is centered in this laboratory carved out of dense granite.  The high ceilings are dotted with small holes that provide a way for any deadly gasses released to eventually make their way to the surface, while a passage to the northeast affords anyone in the room the chance to escape from a dangerous conflagration of chemicals."],"exits":[{"to":472,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"}]},
  {"id":476,"x":37,"y":783,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven Alchemy Society, Workroom","descriptions":["A set of alchemical equipment is centered in this laboratory carved out of dense granite.  The high ceilings are dotted with small holes that provide a way for any deadly gasses released to eventually make their way to the surface, while a passage to the north affords anyone in the room the chance to escape from a dangerous conflagration of chemicals."],"exits":[{"to":472,"exit":"north","move":"north"}]},
  {"id":477,"x":47,"y":783,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven Alchemy Society, Workroom","descriptions":["A set of alchemical equipment is centered in this laboratory carved out of dense granite.  The high ceilings are dotted with small holes that provide a way for any deadly gasses released to eventually make their way to the surface, while a passage to the northwest affords anyone in the room the chance to escape from a dangerous conflagration of chemicals."],"exits":[{"to":472,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":478,"x":47,"y":773,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven Alchemy Society, Workroom","descriptions":["A set of alchemical equipment is centered in this laboratory carved out of dense granite.  The high ceilings are dotted with small holes that provide a way for any deadly gasses released to eventually make their way to the surface, while a passage to the west affords anyone in the room the chance to escape from a dangerous conflagration of chemicals."],"exits":[{"to":472,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":479,"x":47,"y":763,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven Alchemy Society, Workroom","descriptions":["A set of alchemical equipment is centered in this laboratory carved out of dense granite.  The high ceilings are dotted with small holes that provide a way for any deadly gasses released to eventually make their way to the surface, while a passage to the southwest affords anyone in the room the chance to escape from a dangerous conflagration of chemicals."],"exits":[{"to":472,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":480,"x":37,"y":797,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven Alchemy Society, Office","descriptions":["Musty boxes oozing long-abandoned alchemical experiments spill off of rust-eaten steel tables shoved into every corner of the constricting granite room.  Chalk formulas are scratched haphazardly onto the soot-stained walls, with sparse moments of cleanliness only afforded to sections wiped clean for future notations."],"exits":[{"to":472,"exit":"up","move":"up"}]},
  {"id":481,"x":37,"y":763,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven Alchemy Society, Workroom","descriptions":["A set of alchemical equipment is centered in this laboratory carved out of dense granite.  The high ceilings are dotted with small holes that provide a way for any deadly gasses released to eventually make their way to the surface, while a passage to the south affords anyone in the room the chance to escape from a dangerous conflagration of chemicals."],"exits":[{"to":472,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":482,"x":14,"y":773,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven Alchemy Society, Book Store","descriptions":["A small shelf advertising available alchemical books sits below a chart on alchemical techniques on one side of the small enclosure, while the other side an exhausted clerk notes work order completions on a board."],"exits":[{"to":472,"exit":"go","move":"go leather tarp"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Alchemy Books","Alchemy Prestige"]},
  {"id":483,"x":420,"y":840,"z":0,"title":"Northern Pride, Main Deck","descriptions":["This is the only barge of its type to ply the waters of Lake Gwenalion.  Ambitiously designed with an upper deck for passengers, its aft is completely given over to cargo.  Built recently, everything about it smacks of economy and minimalism."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"climb","move":"climb stairs"},{"to":99,"exit":"go","move":"go riverhaven pier"},{"to":0,"exit":"go","move":"go langenfirth wharf"}],"linksTo":"Map998_Transports.xml"},
  {"id":484,"x":60,"y":120,"z":-1,"title":"Old Boardwalk","descriptions":["Quite narrow and somewhat steep, the walkway's weathered wooden planks are incredibly old, though strong rivets leave them still quite sturdy.  Unlit wrought iron lanterns hang from poles along the railings, splotches of rust peppering their dark metal.  Turgid, salty air comes through the area on sporadic breezes, bringing all the scents of the river with it."],"exits":[{"to":485,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"aliases":["Old Boardwalk"]},
  {"id":485,"x":60,"y":140,"z":-1,"title":"Boardwalk, Pigeon's Roost","descriptions":["Scores of squab and elder pigeons have taken up residence in the covered seating on either side of the boardwalk.  Their coos intertwine with the burbling riverfront to almost musical effect.  A fair number of the birds peck and poke their way across the planks without care for the stepping feet of passersby, decidedly interested in whatever tidbits they might drop."],"exits":[{"to":484,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":486,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"aliases":["Pigeon's Roost"]},
  {"id":486,"x":60,"y":160,"z":-1,"title":"Boardwalk, Steep Ramp","descriptions":["The boardwalk takes a sharp turn as it follows the river's length, coming closer to the river's waterline.  Several rough-looking dock workers lean against the warped railings, speaking with each other in hushed tones.  A derelict building is visible at the end of the boardwalk to the east, looking even older than the boardwalk."],"exits":[{"to":485,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":487,"exit":"east","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":487,"x":80,"y":160,"z":-1,"title":"Boardwalk, River View","descriptions":["Though the boardwalk offers a sweeping view of the river's blue-green water as it meets the muddy riverbanks, this portion of the boardwalk seems comparatively unpopular.  Variegated greens, oranges and yellows dapple the craggy rocks that comprise the shore, the flowering mosses and brightly colored lichens bringing soft beauty to an otherwise dour landscape.  Several tiny, dead fish are strewn about the wooden walkway, their bloated corpses untouched by the throngs of birds living in the surrounds."],"exits":[{"to":488,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":486,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":488,"x":100,"y":160,"z":-1,"title":"Boardwalk, Tavern Approach","descriptions":["The boardwalk widens to meet the dimensions of the disheveled-looking tavern that lies at its end.  Crafted entirely from salvaged materials, the building is a jumble of mismatched and ill-fitted castoffs, starkly contrasting the neat, brightly painted sign proclaiming it to be open for business.  A large, crudely-cast bronze statue of an aquatic monster sits near the entrance, its surface a verdigris patina that lends a bit too much realism to the creature."],"exits":[{"to":487,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":489,"exit":"go","move":"go door"}],"aliases":["Tavern Approach"]},
  {"id":489,"x":120,"y":160,"z":-1,"title":"The Tepid Faldesu, Lobby","descriptions":["Though smelling strongly of salt-stained wood and rotting fish, the lobby somehow manages to remain inviting in a decidedly well-worn fashion.  Aged wood from shipping crates has been repurposed and fitted with sailcloth-covered cushions to create the benches lining the walls."],"exits":[{"to":490,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":491,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":488,"exit":"go","move":"go door"}],"aliases":["Tepid Faldesu"]},
  {"id":490,"x":140,"y":160,"z":-1,"title":"The Tepid Faldesu, Narrow Hallway","descriptions":["Barely wide enough for a single full grown Gor'Tog to squeeze through sideways, the hallway is dimly lit with greasy lanterns hanging from the ceiling.  Rusty stains streak the walls, visible through the salt-crusted fishing nets tacked over them.  A soggy green carpet lies on the floor, hastily thrown over its plain wooden boards and only half-hiding an old stain."],"exits":[{"to":495,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":489,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":494,"exit":"go","move":"go door"}]},
  {"id":491,"x":120,"y":180,"z":-1,"title":"The Tepid Faldesu, Dining Room","descriptions":["Several paintings of fishing boats hang on the unfinished wooden panels that partially enclose this cramped dining room.  A long counter serves to separate the eating area from the exposed kitchen, but does little to hide the view of the grimy cooking conditions.  Mismatched chairs surround makeshift tables, most of them badly stained with greasy food and cheap wine."],"exits":[{"to":489,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":492,"exit":"east","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":492,"x":140,"y":180,"z":-1,"title":"The Tepid Faldesu, Bar Room","descriptions":["Partially separated from the cramped dining area to the west by a series of unfinished wooden panels, the bar room feels quite open due to its sparse furnishings.  Steel-legged stools line the heavily-stained bar, bolted firmly to the floor to prevent damage during drunken brawls.  A bulky stack of liquor crates and beer kegs serves to further delineate the space."],"exits":[{"to":491,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":493,"exit":"go","move":"go shadowy corner"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":493,"x":140,"y":200,"z":-1,"title":"The Tepid Faldesu, Shadowy Corner","descriptions":["Nearly blocked off from all sides, this quiet little corner appears to be utilized mostly as a storage area.  The briny smell that permeates the entire establishment is particularly strong here, no doubt due to the open barrels of fish shoved between the other boxes.  A faint skittering can be heard from time to time as the vermin that gorge themselves on the poorly stored goods scurry to and fro in the darkness."],"exits":[{"to":492,"exit":"go","move":"go opening"}]},
  {"id":494,"x":140,"y":140,"z":-1,"title":"The Tepid Faldesu, Gambler's Den","descriptions":["Several dartboards dot this room's mottled blue walls.  Subdued desperation oozes from the players at the various card tables, punctuated by occasional cries of anger or greedy joy as the tides of fortune turn.  In one corner, a group of craggy-looking riverfolk have huddled together tightly, attending to a game of dice on an overturned crate."],"exits":[{"to":490,"exit":"go","move":"go door"}],"aliases":["Gambler's Den"]},
  {"id":495,"x":160,"y":160,"z":-1,"title":"The Tepid Faldesu, Narrow Hallway","descriptions":["Muddy bootprints mar the bare wooden floor in this portion of the windowless hallway, and the thick scent of tobacco wafts in from the smoking room to the north.  A large, soiled tapestry hangs from the ceiling to cover the southern wall, the speckled mold peeking out from its edges hinting at the most likely reason for its placement."],"exits":[{"to":490,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":496,"exit":"climb","move":"climb staircase"},{"to":500,"exit":"go","move":"go green-framed doorway"},{"to":503,"exit":"go","move":"go soiled tapestry","hidden":true}]},
  {"id":496,"x":160,"y":120,"z":-1,"title":"The Tepid Faldesu, Upstairs Hallway","descriptions":["More of a half-attic than a hallway, dim light streams in from cracks in the ceiling.  Sailcloth tarps spread over the holes do their best to keep out inclement weather, though bad water stains attest to the tavern's overall neglect.  A few planks have been haphazardly laid over a hole in the floor, a short-term solution that has become permanent."],"exits":[{"to":497,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":499,"exit":"go","move":"go door"},{"to":495,"exit":"climb","move":"climb staircase"}]},
  {"id":497,"x":140,"y":120,"z":-1,"title":"The Tepid Faldesu, Upstairs Hallway","descriptions":["Stacks of small boxes are piled up in the corners, nearly filling the end off the short hallway.  A small porthole window looks out on the river, but view into the city is blocked by the side of a salt-stained warehouse.  Spiders spin their webs in the bare rafters, feasting on the flies that buzz up from the dining room below."],"exits":[{"to":496,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":498,"exit":"go","move":"go door"}]},
  {"id":498,"x":140,"y":100,"z":-1,"title":"The Tepid Faldesu, Dimly Lit Room","descriptions":["The roof of this small room slopes down to the northern wall, and is relatively well-shingled in comparison to the hallway outside.  Small motes of dust drift through the air, lit up by greasy oil lanterns hanging on the walls.  The room's only real furnishing is a fairly good-sized bed stuffed with hay and a small chamberpot in the corner."],"exits":[{"to":497,"exit":"go","move":"go door"}]},
  {"id":499,"x":160,"y":100,"z":-1,"title":"The Tepid Faldesu, Dimly Lit Room","descriptions":["The roof of this small room slopes down to the northern wall, and is relatively well-shingled in comparison to the hallway outside.  A small painting hangs on the eastern wall, depicting an enormous sea creature strangling a wooden ship.  The room's only real furnishing is a fairly good-sized bed stuffed with hay and a small chamberpot in the corner."],"exits":[{"to":496,"exit":"go","move":"go door"}]},
  {"id":500,"x":180,"y":160,"z":-1,"title":"The Tepid Faldesu, Smoking Den","descriptions":["Set off from the adjacent gambling parlor by shabby tobacco-stained screens and algae-green paint, this lounge is furnished entirely with salvaged materials.  A splotchy yellowed sofa flanked by fish barrels dominates one wall, while along another, several low stools surround a footlocker coffee table."],"exits":[{"to":501,"exit":"go","move":"go blue curtain"},{"to":502,"exit":"go","move":"go greenish curtain"},{"to":495,"exit":"go","move":"go green-framed doorway"}],"aliases":["Smoking Den"]},
  {"id":501,"x":200,"y":160,"z":-1,"title":"The Tepid Faldesu, Private Booth","descriptions":["A blue-grey wooden table sits in the middle of this booth, contrasted by its nearly black benches.  Situated high on the wall, a series of rusty sconces holds tallow candles that have been burned to near nubs, their dim light effecting a more ominous than cozy atmosphere.  The heavy scent of smoke wafts in from beyond the dingy blue curtain."],"exits":[{"to":500,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":502,"x":180,"y":140,"z":-1,"title":"The Tepid Faldesu, Private Booth","descriptions":["A naturally algae-green table sits in the middle of this booth, matching its benches.  Dangling dangerously low, a rusted anchor chain suspends a fish-shaped lantern, its flickering light casting curious, shifting shadows across furnishings and occupants alike.  The slight smell of mold lingers in the air, mixed with the smoke coming from beyond a greenish curtain."],"exits":[{"to":500,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":503,"x":160,"y":260,"z":-2,"title":"Underground Passage","descriptions":["A constant 'drip, drip, drip' noise echoes through the air in the narrow passage, and the air smells heavily of damp moss.  Naturally occurring ruby growths protrude from the walls surrounding the door, their sharpness dulled somewhat by polishing.  Caught by the torchlight, the rubies cast a sanguine glow upon wood, stone, and occupants alike."],"exits":[{"to":505,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":504,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":510,"exit":"go","move":"go door"},{"to":495,"exit":"go","move":"go soiled tapestry"}]},
  {"id":504,"x":140,"y":260,"z":-2,"title":"Underground Passage","descriptions":["The underground passage is narrow and the air feels bloated with water, almost suffocatingly clingy and thick.  Carved niches hold torches that crackle and threaten to falter entirely in the dampness.  Ruddy discoloration speckles the ground, a dark echo of the glinting mineral veins that wend through the pallid stone walls."],"exits":[{"to":503,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":507,"exit":"go","move":"go door"}]},
  {"id":505,"x":180,"y":260,"z":-2,"title":"Underground Passage","descriptions":["The walls in this part of the passage are very smooth, as if some powerful force scoured them clean.  Several small area rugs are thrown onto the floor to cover it, some of them soggy but most of them dry.  A single gaethzen orb provides a harsh white light, making the relative darkness of the passages to the east and west seem like an endless blackness."],"exits":[{"to":506,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":503,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":508,"exit":"go","move":"go steel door"},{"to":543,"exit":"go","move":"climb stone stairs"}]},
  {"id":506,"x":200,"y":260,"z":-2,"title":"Underground Passage, Dead End","descriptions":["Roughly hewn from the surrounding stone, this chamber remains largely unadorned save for a trine of incarnadine gems set into the curving walls at even intervals.  Brownish-red stains streak the floor, punctuated by larger, similarly colored splotches.  A low, steady hum fills the air from an unknown source, the acoustics of the space causing distorting reverberations."],"exits":[{"to":505,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":507,"x":120,"y":260,"z":-2,"title":"Guildmaster's Office","descriptions":["With its riot of colors and textures, this room demands attention.  Swathes of vibrant batiked fabrics cover the walls and a wide river reed mat spreads across the floor, muffling the sound of footsteps upon the stone beneath.  Exotic cave-dwelling plants grow in the brightly enameled pots that rest upon nearly every available surface, except for the coral-edged driftwood desk that sits catty-corner to the door.  The desk itself is piled so high with scrolls as to nearly eclipse the numerous trinkets that vie with them for space."],"exits":[{"to":504,"exit":"go","move":"go door"}],"color":"#FF8000"},
  {"id":508,"x":180,"y":240,"z":-2,"title":"Cavern, Clinical Laboratory","descriptions":["Scrubbed and polished, the stone walls and floor of this room are extremely clean, as are its furnishings.  A gleaming steel operating table sits centered beneath several brightly glowing gaethzen orbs, while instrument racks line the north wall, providing easy access to the surgical tools held within.  Two sturdily reinforced cages, one large and one small, sit against the wall opposite the door."],"exits":[{"to":509,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":505,"exit":"go","move":"go steel door"},{"to":546,"exit":"go","move":"go frost door"}],"aliases":["Clinical Laboratory"]},
  {"id":509,"x":200,"y":240,"z":-2,"title":"Cavern, Visceral Laboratory","descriptions":["This laboratory seems as though it has never been cleaned, every surface bearing bloodstains both fresh and old.  Stone slabs illuminated by sputtering oil lamps provide experimentation surfaces, while buckets hold an assortment of tools from the mundane to the bizarre.  Burlap sacks streaked with gore sit piled in one corner, awaiting disposal."],"exits":[{"to":508,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"aliases":["Visceral Laboratory"]},
  {"id":510,"x":160,"y":280,"z":-2,"title":"Cavern, Shady Merchant","descriptions":["Wooden boards are set up to hide the cavern walls, giving the interior of this small room a feel similar to the interior of a ship.  Sailcloth curtains hang in long drapes from each of the walls, each one weathered from long use.  A large stuffed swordfish hangs on the western wall, its scales glinting in the dim candlelight."],"exits":[{"to":511,"exit":"go","move":"go curtain"},{"to":503,"exit":"go","move":"go door"}],"aliases":["Shady Merchant"]},
  {"id":511,"x":140,"y":280,"z":-2,"title":"Item Registration","descriptions":["The small room is predominated by a large desk in the center, with stacks of unsorted papers on the shelves.  Most of the papers are filled either with childish drawings of fish, nonsensical poems and short paragraphs of near gibberish, or angry rants.  Chaos and disorganization are predominant, although one very neat stack of papers is arranged in a small box on the desk."],"exits":[{"to":510,"exit":"go","move":"go curtain"}],"color":"#00FF00"},
  {"id":512,"x":561,"y":545,"z":-1,"title":"Bards' Guild, Dank Stairwell","descriptions":["Crumbled stone litters each step, making walking difficult.  Dampness radiates from the close walls as the *plink* of dripping water echoes in the narrow stairwell."],"exits":[{"to":513,"exit":"down","move":"down"}]},
  {"id":513,"x":561,"y":555,"z":-1,"title":"Bards' Guild, Dank Stairwell","descriptions":["Crumbled stone litters each step, making walking difficult.  Dampness radiates from the close walls as the *plink* of dripping water echoes in the narrow stairwell."],"exits":[{"to":512,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":514,"exit":"down","move":"down"}]},
  {"id":514,"x":561,"y":565,"z":-1,"title":"Bards' Guild, Dank Stairwell","descriptions":["Crumbled stone litters each step, making walking difficult.  Dampness radiates from the close walls as the *plink* of dripping water echoes in the narrow stairwell."],"exits":[{"to":513,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":515,"exit":"go","move":"go maple door"}]},
  {"id":515,"x":561,"y":575,"z":-1,"title":"Bards' Guild, Anthology Cellar","descriptions":["Quite unlike the dark, dreary passage that brings one here, this cellar room is cozy and warm, seemingly untouched by the world outside.  A large rug covers the floor, and colorful tapestries hang on every wall.  Not only does the multitude of thick fabrics keep out the chill, they also provide insulation from sound, making this a very quiet room.  Tall sconces rise from the floor, their contents providing light and warmth, while rocking chairs offer comfortable seating."],"exits":[{"to":514,"exit":"go","move":"go maple door"}],"aliases":["Anthology Cellar"]},
  {"id":516,"x":541,"y":575,"z":0,"title":"Bards' Guild, Terrace Gazebo","descriptions":["Cedar beams, silvered with age, rise upwards to bury themselves in the mass of ivy that has overgrown the slatwork ceiling.  Questing tendrils of jasmine curtain the lattice walls of the gazebo with heavy pink blossoms.  Wide pine benches line the eight edges of the smooth decking and the sharp scent of cedar intermingles with the rich perfume of fresh growth and jasmine."],"exits":[{"to":351,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":517,"x":640,"y":730,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven Meeting Hall, Entrance","descriptions":["A small building overlooking the water, the meeting Hall is made out of rough planks of repurposed wood.  Heavy glass windows overlook the water, and a few marsh plants grow in pots on opposite sides of the exit.  A piece of sailcloth covers the wall and runs the length of the long hallway, stained heavily with salt and smelling of the sea."],"exits":[{"to":518,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":11,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":520,"exit":"go","move":"go cedar door"},{"to":521,"exit":"go","move":"go oakwood door"}],"aliases":["Meeting Hall"]},
  {"id":518,"x":660,"y":730,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven Meeting Hall, Corridor","descriptions":["Torches in iron sconces illuminate the hallway, set into the walls in even intervals and burning with a bright light.  Salt-stained driftwood paneling covers the walls, and several trophies of various types of fish are proudly on display.  A large sailcloth runs the full length of the outer wall, a section of it stenciled with a fleet of sailing ships."],"exits":[{"to":519,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":517,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":522,"exit":"go","move":"go driftwood door"},{"to":523,"exit":"go","move":"go salt-stained door"}]},
  {"id":519,"x":680,"y":730,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven Meeting Hall, Dock","descriptions":["The eastern end of the meeting hall opens up into a small dock open to the air, though well sheltered by the slanting roof and long curtains of sailcloth.  The ceiling is peaked slightly, showing off the underside of the roof as tall and sturdy rafters.  Boards of polished and darkly stained driftwood make up the floor, giving it a rustic feel."],"exits":[{"to":518,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":524,"exit":"go","move":"go small houseboat"},{"to":525,"exit":"go","move":"go cypress door"}]},
  {"id":520,"x":630,"y":720,"z":0,"title":"Fisher's Meeting Room","descriptions":["Carved wooden fish cover the low walls of the meeting room, and a small arrangement of lilies grows in a wide stone bowl in one corner.  Several rows of high-backed benches are arranged in the center of the room, each roughly carved from sturdy strips of waterproofed oak.  A small window looks out on the river below, which fills the room with a quiet rushing noise."],"exits":[{"to":517,"exit":"go","move":"go cedar door"}],"aliases":["Fisher's Meeting Room"]},
  {"id":521,"x":640,"y":720,"z":0,"title":"Hunter's Meeting Room","descriptions":["Skins and busts from various animals are arranged the low walls of the meeting room, and small ferns grow in stone pots in one corner.  Several rows of high-backed benches are arranged in the center of the room, each roughly carved from sturdy strips of waterproofed oak.  A small window looks out on the river below, giving a distant view of the far bank."],"exits":[{"to":517,"exit":"go","move":"go oakwood door"}],"aliases":["Hunter's Meeting Room"]},
  {"id":522,"x":660,"y":720,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven Meeting Hall, Lounge","descriptions":["Candles adorn the many surfaces within the room, casting their fickle, flickering light across the area.  Rough-hewn wooden walls, dressed up with several trophies of past catches, encircle a floor that's made of bare wood.  Long sailcloth couches are arranged in the middle of the room, set up for quiet talking."],"exits":[{"to":518,"exit":"go","move":"go driftwood door"}]},
  {"id":523,"x":670,"y":720,"z":0,"title":"Swamp Meeting Room","descriptions":["A heavy swamp motif decorates the low walls of the meeting room, and small marsh plants grow in stone pots in one corner.  Several rows of high-backed benches are arranged in the center of the room, each roughly carved from sturdy strips of waterproofed oak.  A small window looks out on the river below, its frame decorated with several small designs."],"exits":[{"to":518,"exit":"go","move":"go salt-stained door"}],"aliases":["Swamp Meeting Room"]},
  {"id":524,"x":690,"y":720,"z":0,"title":"Meeting Houseboat","descriptions":["The small craft constantly rocks slightly from side to side, riding fairly high in the water as it remains tethered to the dock.  Several rows of high-backed benches are arranged in the center of the boat, each roughly carved from sturdy strips of waterproofed oak.  Small round windows look out from the craft, positioned to be just above the waterline."],"exits":[{"to":519,"exit":"go","move":"go small dock"}],"aliases":["Meeting Houseboat"]},
  {"id":525,"x":690,"y":730,"z":0,"title":"Riverside Meeting Room","descriptions":["A large mural of Riverhaven proper covers the low walls of the meeting room, and small blue flowers grow in stone pots in one corner.  Several rows of high-backed benches are arranged in the center of the room, each roughly carved from sturdy strips of waterproofed oak.  A small window looks out on the river below, though part of it is taken up by the ship docked nearby."],"exits":[{"to":519,"exit":"go","move":"go cypress door"}],"aliases":["Riverside Meeting Room"]},
  {"id":526,"x":360,"y":460,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven Enchanting Society, Entrance","descriptions":["Arched windows on either side of the doorway let the twilight into the Enchanter's Society, the area lit up with numerous torches and muted somewhat with dark grey carpet runners.  High above, the ceiling rises in a pointed dome, the spaces between the rafters painted with numerous stormy clouds.  Potted plants add a hint of green to the otherwise monochrome decor.","Arched windows on either side of the doorway illuminate the busy entrance of the Enchanter's Society, the dark marble floor shot through with veins of silver and muted somewhat with dark grey carpet runners.  High above, the ceiling rises in a pointed dome, the spaces between the rafters painted with numerous stormy clouds.  Potted plants add a hint of green to the otherwise monochrome decor."],"exits":[{"to":529,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":527,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":531,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":61,"exit":"go","move":"go double door"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Enchanting Society","Enchanting Prestige"]},
  {"id":527,"x":380,"y":460,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven Enchanting Society, Emerald Hall","descriptions":["Numerous plants in ornate pots line the hallway, the deep green marble floor running from east to west.  Most are in various states of bloom, and a few adventurous vines creep up the marble pillars that line either side of the hall.  More plants are painted onto the walls, and the hallway is lit with several gaethzen orbs behind triangular panes of green glass."],"exits":[{"to":528,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":526,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":535,"exit":"go","move":"go iron door"},{"to":536,"exit":"go","move":"go silver door"},{"to":537,"exit":"go","move":"go steel door"}]},
  {"id":528,"x":420,"y":460,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven Enchanting Society, Cerulean Hall","descriptions":["Light blue hues cover the eastern wall and ceiling, varying in vibrant shades that mimic a cloudless noon sky.  Deeper blue paneling comes halfway up the walls, peaked at points to resemble ocean waves.  To the west, the colors fade from blue into green, meeting to form a teal color in the center of the long corridor."],"exits":[{"to":527,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":538,"exit":"go","move":"go white door"},{"to":539,"exit":"go","move":"go grey door"},{"to":540,"exit":"go","move":"go black door"},{"to":541,"exit":"go","move":"go violet door"}]},
  {"id":529,"x":360,"y":440,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven Enchanting Society, Amethyst Hall","descriptions":["Delicate purple hues cover the entirety of the walls, enhanced somewhat by a large chandelier hanging from the high ceiling.  Teardrop-cut amethysts hang from the chandelier's multifaceted arms, scattering about flecks of light that range from deep violet to an almost transparent blue.  The colors painted on the walls vary in subtle shaded tones, giving the appearance of flowing and untamed aether."],"exits":[{"to":530,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":526,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":534,"exit":"go","move":"go elaborate arch"},{"to":558,"exit":"go","move":"go recessed alcove"}]},
  {"id":530,"x":360,"y":420,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven Society Master's Office of Enchanting","descriptions":["A single arched picture window gives a good view of the nighttime sky outside, and the high domed ceiling makes it feel larger than it really is.  Near the window is a large mahogany desk with an overstuffed chair behind it, while two much smaller chairs are placed in front of it as almost a careless afterthought.  Bookshelves line the walls, their contents kept meticulously neat and tidy.","A single arched picture window lets copious amounts of daylight into the room, and the high domed ceiling makes it feel larger than it really is.  Near the window is a large mahogany desk with an overstuffed chair behind it, while two much smaller chairs are placed in front of it as almost a careless afterthought.  Shelves line the walls, their contents kept meticulously neat and tidy."],"exits":[{"to":529,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":531,"x":360,"y":480,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven Enchanting Society, Citrine Hall","descriptions":["Carefully set crystals and panes of reddish orange glass give the appearance of fire crackling over the walls, the effect heavily stylized and abstract.  Light plays across the walls in fiery tones, reflecting off gemstones placed in flame mosaics.  Several large torches burn on their pillars on either side of the long hallway, which is completed with dark red carpeting flecked with occasional streaks of golden thread."],"exits":[{"to":526,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":532,"exit":"go","move":"go red curtain"},{"to":533,"exit":"go","move":"go narrow hallway"}]},
  {"id":532,"x":380,"y":500,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven Enchanting Society, Supply Store","descriptions":["Large volumes of deep red fabric hang from the walls in heavily draping sheets, enclosing the room and giving it a soft feel.  Wares for sale are laid out on cloth-covered tables, lit by candles that hang from the ceiling in enclosed lanterns.  A vase of firewheel flowers adorns a corner table, their broad petals red at the base and tipped with yellow."],"exits":[{"to":531,"exit":"go","move":"go red curtain"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Enchanting Supplies"]},
  {"id":533,"x":360,"y":500,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven Enchanting Society, Tool Store","descriptions":["Light from gaethzen orbs shines down from each cardinal point of the room, illuminating the numerous wares for sale.  Framed pictures hang on the stone walls, each depicting a complex formula or theory of artificing.  Embroidered into the carpet is an enormous compass, oriented so its northern needle points in the correct direction."],"exits":[{"to":531,"exit":"go","move":"go narrow hallway"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Enchanting Tools"]},
  {"id":534,"x":340,"y":440,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven Enchanting Society, Book Store","descriptions":["Numerous wooden shelves line the stone walls, each shelf crafted from a rich mahogany that is polished until glistening.  Tomes and manuscripts fill them, most displayed for sale but a few on the top shelf being labeled as 'do not touch'.  Only a few muted lanterns light the room, the low illumination protecting the more fragile of the aging parchments."],"exits":[{"to":529,"exit":"go","move":"go elaborate arch"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Enchanting Books"]},
  {"id":535,"x":380,"y":440,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven Enchanting Society, Iron Workroom","descriptions":["Metal tables provide ample working space, yet are easily moved out of the way for larger incantations.  The plain marble floor gives the rest of the building some protection against errant spells, while small windows in the ceiling allow for the fast removal of smoke and other fumes.  Acoustically dampened walls dissolve away the echoes of most sounds, making for few distractions in the room."],"exits":[{"to":527,"exit":"go","move":"go door"}],"aliases":["Iron Workroom","Enchanting Workroom1"]},
  {"id":536,"x":390,"y":440,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven Enchanting Society, Silver Workroom","descriptions":["Metal tables provide ample working space, yet are easily moved out of the way for larger incantations.  The plain marble floor gives the rest of the building some protection against errant spells, while small windows in the ceiling allow for the fast removal of smoke and other fumes.  Acoustically dampened walls dissolve away the echoes of most sounds, making for few distractions in the room."],"exits":[{"to":527,"exit":"go","move":"go silver door"}],"aliases":["Silver Workroom","Enchanting Workroom2"]},
  {"id":537,"x":380,"y":480,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven Enchanting Society, Steel Workroom","descriptions":["Metal tables provide ample working space, yet are easily moved out of the way for larger incantations.  The plain marble floor gives the rest of the building some protection against errant spells, while small windows in the ceiling allow for the fast removal of smoke and other fumes.  Acoustically dampened walls dissolve away the echoes of most sounds, making for few distractions in the room."],"exits":[{"to":527,"exit":"go","move":"go steel door"}],"aliases":["Steel Workroom","Enchanting Workroom3"]},
  {"id":538,"x":420,"y":440,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven Enchanting Society, White Workroom","descriptions":["Metal tables provide ample working space, yet are easily moved out of the way for larger incantations.  The plain marble floor gives the rest of the building some protection against errant spells, while small windows in the ceiling allow for the fast removal of smoke and other fumes.  Acoustically dampened walls dissolve away the echoes of most sounds, making for few distractions in the room."],"exits":[{"to":528,"exit":"go","move":"go white door"}],"aliases":["White Workroom","Enchanting Workroom4"]},
  {"id":539,"x":440,"y":440,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven Enchanting Society, Grey Workroom","descriptions":["Metal tables provide ample working space, yet are easily moved out of the way for larger incantations.  The plain marble floor gives the rest of the building some protection against errant spells, while small windows in the ceiling allow for the fast removal of smoke and other fumes.  Acoustically dampened walls dissolve away the echoes of most sounds, making for few distractions in the room."],"exits":[{"to":528,"exit":"go","move":"go grey door"}],"aliases":["Grey Workroom","Enchanting Workroom5"]},
  {"id":540,"x":440,"y":460,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven Enchanting Society, Black Workroom","descriptions":["Metal tables provide ample working space, yet are easily moved out of the way for larger incantations.  The plain marble floor gives the rest of the building some protection against errant spells, while small windows in the ceiling allow for the fast removal of smoke and other fumes.  Acoustically dampened walls dissolve away the echoes of most sounds, making for few distractions in the room."],"exits":[{"to":528,"exit":"go","move":"go black door"}],"aliases":["Black Workroom","Enchanting Workroom6"]},
  {"id":541,"x":420,"y":480,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven Enchanting Society, Violet Workroom","descriptions":["Metal tables provide ample working space, yet are easily moved out of the way for larger incantations.  The plain marble floor gives the rest of the building some protection against errant spells, while small windows in the ceiling allow for the fast removal of smoke and other fumes.  Acoustically dampened walls dissolve away the echoes of most sounds, making for few distractions in the room."],"exits":[{"to":528,"exit":"go","move":"go violet door"}],"aliases":["Violet Workroom","Enchanting Workroom7"]},
  {"id":542,"x":600,"y":760,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Carousel Family Services","descriptions":["A series of guarded arches line the southern wall.  The complicated framework of iron and timbers spans across the ceiling.  Countless gears, pulleys and weights form the strikingly complex mechanism which drives the Carousel."],"exits":[{"to":361,"exit":"north","move":"north"}],"aliases":["Family vaults"]},
  {"id":543,"x":180,"y":280,"z":-2,"title":"Underground Passage, Storage","descriptions":["Vibrant orange lichen grows out of the bluish algae that covers most of the stone encompassing this overstuffed storage room.  Crates and barrels abound, their contents safely nailed shut within, while rust-covered steel racks line the walls, holding a variety of jarred items.  The room holds a heavily spiced scent that nearly obscures the ever-present dank odor of the passage."],"exits":[{"to":505,"exit":"go","move":"climb stone stairs"},{"to":544,"exit":"go","move":"go narrow hallway"}]},
  {"id":544,"x":200,"y":280,"z":-2,"title":"Hidden Den","descriptions":["In striking counterpoint to the passage outside, the walls of this chamber are smooth and lined with plush fabrics that show no signs of mildew despite the dampness that pervades even in here.  Tall wrought iron poles, reaching nearly to the ceiling, bear both lanterns for illumination and sachets of aromatics to sweeten the air.  Several chairs, opulent though mismatched, are situated around a low stone serving-table filled with food and drink."],"exits":[{"to":543,"exit":"go","move":"go narrow hallway"},{"to":545,"exit":"go","move":"go driftwood door"}]},
  {"id":545,"x":200,"y":300,"z":-2,"title":"Cavern, Driftwood Library","descriptions":["Rather dry, the simple cavern has a thick layer of several carpet rugs thrown over the floor, and small torches burn on the wall, lighting up the area quite well.  Several large bookshelves are arranged in a couple rather haphazard rows, and appear to be made out of reclaimed shipping crates.  A simple desk stands in the front of the cavern for returns, and several chairs are set out for easy reading."],"exits":[{"to":544,"exit":"go","move":"go driftwood door"}],"aliases":["Necromancer Library","Necro Library"]},
  {"id":546,"x":200,"y":210,"z":-2,"title":"Cold Laboratory, Hallway","descriptions":["Built into what looks like a former sewer, the narrow hallway has curved metal walls and is dimly lit by torches mounted in makeshift stands on either side.  Dry wooden planks cover the floor and provide a sturdy footing, secured firmly in place by large metal bolts.  The air is extremely cold in the area, leaving bits of frost on the slightly rusted walls."],"exits":[{"to":508,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":547,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":549,"exit":"go","move":"open steel door"},{"to":550,"exit":"go","move":"open iron door"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Jaryon","Risen Supplies"]},
  {"id":547,"x":220,"y":210,"z":-2,"title":"Cold Laboratory, Hallway","descriptions":["Built into what looks like a former sewer, the narrow hallway has curved metal walls and is dimly lit by torches mounted in makeshift stands on either side.  Dry wooden planks cover the floor and provide a sturdy footing, secured firmly in place by large metal bolts.  Strange patterns of delicate frost have formed on the walls, tracing out circles and spirals that hint at complex magical devices behind the rusty metal."],"exits":[{"to":546,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":548,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":551,"exit":"go","move":"open steel door"},{"to":552,"exit":"go","move":"open iron door"}]},
  {"id":548,"x":240,"y":210,"z":-2,"title":"Cold Laboratory, Hallway","descriptions":["Built into what looks like a former sewer, the narrow hallway has curved metal walls and is dimly lit by torches mounted in makeshift stands on either side.  Dry wooden planks cover the floor and provide a sturdy footing, secured firmly in place by large metal bolts.  The hallway dead-ends at a solid piece of flat metal, likely a cap to the large metal pipe that makes up the walls."],"exits":[{"to":547,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":553,"exit":"go","move":"open steel door"},{"to":554,"exit":"go","move":"open iron door"}]},
  {"id":549,"x":190,"y":200,"z":-2,"title":"Cold Laboratory, Work Station","descriptions":["The air is quite chilly, cold enough to leave ice crystals with every breath.  A medium-sized and rather functional laboratory is set up, with a central marble table as the main feature.  Nearby, a row of cold lockers is designed to store specimens for later use, and a tray of very clean tools is set up near the table."],"exits":[{"to":546,"exit":"go","move":"open door"}]},
  {"id":550,"x":210,"y":200,"z":-2,"title":"Cold Laboratory, Work Station","descriptions":["The air is quite chilly, cold enough to leave ice crystals with every breath.  A medium-sized and rather functional laboratory is set up, with a central marble table as the main feature.  Nearby, a row of cold lockers is designed to store specimens for later use, and a tray of very clean tools is set up near the table."],"exits":[{"to":546,"exit":"go","move":"open door"}]},
  {"id":551,"x":210,"y":220,"z":-2,"title":"Cold Laboratory, Work Station","descriptions":["The air is quite chilly, cold enough to leave ice crystals with every breath.  A medium-sized and rather functional laboratory is set up, with a central marble table as the main feature.  Nearby, a row of cold lockers is designed to store specimens for later use, and a tray of very clean tools is set up near the table."],"exits":[{"to":547,"exit":"go","move":"open door"}]},
  {"id":552,"x":230,"y":220,"z":-2,"title":"Cold Laboratory, Work Station","descriptions":["The air is quite chilly, cold enough to leave ice crystals with every breath.  A medium-sized and rather functional laboratory is set up, with a central marble table as the main feature.  Nearby, a row of cold lockers is designed to store specimens for later use, and a tray of very clean tools is set up near the table."],"exits":[{"to":547,"exit":"go","move":"open door"}]},
  {"id":553,"x":230,"y":200,"z":-2,"title":"Cold Laboratory, Work Station","descriptions":["The air is quite chilly, cold enough to leave ice crystals with every breath.  A medium-sized and rather functional laboratory is set up, with a central marble table as the main feature.  Nearby, a row of cold lockers is designed to store specimens for later use, and a tray of very clean tools is set up near the table."],"exits":[{"to":548,"exit":"go","move":"open door"}]},
  {"id":554,"x":250,"y":200,"z":-2,"title":"Cold Laboratory, Work Station","descriptions":["The air is quite chilly, cold enough to leave ice crystals with every breath.  A medium-sized and rather functional laboratory is set up, with a central marble table as the main feature.  Nearby, a row of cold lockers is designed to store specimens for later use, and a tray of very clean tools is set up near the table."],"exits":[{"to":548,"exit":"go","move":"open door"}]},
  {"id":555,"x":411,"y":356,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven Outfitting Society, A Private Outfitting Room","descriptions":["A pure-white wainscoted hall is topped by lilac-hued paisley painted walls.  Occupying the back third of the room is a solid-looking loom, while a large spinning wheel sits near the entrance.  Resting atop a deep purple rug is a sturdy worktable and a comfortable, wicker chair.  Running parallel along opposing walls are several hooks and shelves, holding practically every conceivable tool, spool of thread, bobbin, thimble and scrap."],"exits":[{"to":449,"exit":"go","move":"go stone archway"}],"aliases":["Private Outfitting"]},
  {"id":556,"x":580,"y":740,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Rundmolen Post Office","descriptions":["Tucked away in a corner of the square is a wide stone counter set into the conical carousel beneath an angled metal awning.  Vast, countless rows of differently sized shelves are visible within, and the intricate Dwarven mechanisms that shuffle the vaults also rearrange the package-covered storage.  Clerks shuffle endlessly back and forth between the counters and shelving as they assist patrons with their packaging and mailing needs."],"exits":[{"to":360,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Post Office","mail"]},
  {"id":557,"x":80,"y":510,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven Forging Society, A Private Forge","descriptions":["Thick walls struggle to contain the blistering heat of the workshop where the fires blaze endlessly night and day.  The flickering flames give a reddish glow to the racks and shelves of tools and equipment, all neatly placed and ready for use.  Workers enter in their protective gear from time to time, checking the equipment and reporting back to a sentry at the entry."],"exits":[{"to":398,"exit":"go","move":"go narrow alcove"}],"aliases":["Private Forge"]},
  {"id":558,"x":340,"y":460,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven Enchanting Society, A Private Enchanting Room","descriptions":["Pieced together by a seemingly blind worker, the walls are covered with scraps of rugs, blankets, and carpets in a kaleidoscope of colors.  A burly, light pink feldspar table is stashed in a corner of the room, providing plenty of room to work."],"exits":[{"to":529,"exit":"go","move":"go recessed alcove"}],"aliases":["Private Enchanting"]},
  {"id":559,"x":27,"y":750,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven Alchemy Society, A Private Alchemy Room","descriptions":["A large workbench dominates one side of the room with numerous pieces of alchemical equipment scattered haphazardly upon its surface.  The high, vented windows provide relief from the common, yet unpleasant, smell that permeates the room."],"exits":[{"to":471,"exit":"go","move":"go stone entryway"}],"aliases":["Private Alchemy"]},
  {"id":560,"x":520,"y":170,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven Engineering Society, A Private Engineering Room","descriptions":["A fine layer of wood and stone shavings covers most of the well-worn granite floor.  The white walls have seen better days, and black and grey scuff marks adorn much of the open space.  A large workstation along one wall is unnaturally free of clutter and holds several organized tools and implements.  Grunts, curses, and labored breathing from other patrons echo throughout the large workroom."],"exits":[{"to":461,"exit":"go","move":"go banded doors"}],"aliases":["Private Engineering"]},
  {"id":561,"x":90,"y":510,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven Forging Society, Bulk Metals","descriptions":["A small counter and clerk sit beneath a tarp strung across the alley of Silvermoon Road.  Carts and wagons trickle through at a relaxed but steady pace.  The drivers hand over paperwork which the clerks quickly review, stamp and pass along to teams of workers.  With practiced efficiency, the workers navigate rows of pre-assembled pallets to retrieve and load the proper materials.  Two quick raps on the wagon signal that the order is complete, and the driver prods his beasts into motion to make way for the next in line."],"exits":[{"to":400,"exit":"east","move":"east"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Bulk Forging Supplies","Bulk Forging Materials"]},
  {"id":562,"x":380,"y":570,"z":0,"title":"Knight's Hall, Tower Room","descriptions":["Overlooking the plaza below, a handful of shopfronts are tucked into the recessed entryways of fanciful towers and spires that reach to the ceiling high above.  Though merely decorative and designed with the plaza's aesthetic, the stonework is masterfully done and could no doubt withstand the tests of time and nature if they were completed structures.  Colorful banners drape from each tower's face and are illuminated by fanciful dragon-headed sconces -- some clutching flickering torches and others glowing gaethzen orbs."],"exits":[{"to":430,"exit":"climb","move":"climb stone steps"},{"to":563,"exit":"north","move":"north"}],"aliases":["Tower Room"]},
  {"id":563,"x":380,"y":560,"z":0,"title":"Knight's Hall, The Shieldery","descriptions":["Tall columns of polished stone bricks rise high up overhead, each supporting numerous thick and heavy wooden beams that link all of the pillars together.  Shields of all shapes and sizes are stacked atop the beams while others hang from either side for viewers below to see.  Still more dangle from thick leather straps below the beams and sway gently as the occasional breeze swirls through.  From time to time, workers cart out ladders and climb up into the rafters to retrieve a particular shield for one gesturing patron or another."],"exits":[{"to":564,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":562,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"aliases":["The Shieldery","Shieldery"]},
  {"id":564,"x":380,"y":550,"z":0,"title":"Knight's Hall, Skyward Atrium","descriptions":["Whimsically designed, this wide-open space provides much of the natural lighting for the entire plaza with its open roof above and numerous windows set between the shopfronts.  A small fountain with crossed stone lightning bolts is perfectly positioned to catch any precipitation with funneling assistance from cleverly located, colorful canopies above.  The shop entries here are similarly themed with rainbows, glitter-covered raindrops, clouds of cotton and more.","Fancifully designed sconces brighten the nights with a mix of flickering flames and steady gaethzen globes.  A small fountain with crossed stone lightning bolts is perfectly positioned beneath the opened roof to catch any precipitation with funneling assistance from cleverly located, colorful canopies above.  The shop entries here are similarly themed with rainbows, glitter-covered raindrops, clouds of cotton and more."],"exits":[{"to":563,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"aliases":["Skyward Atrium"]},
  {"id":565,"x":-120,"y":320,"z":0,"title":"Dunshade Manor, Side Yard","descriptions":["A tall black iron fence overgrown with ivy encloses the Dunshade property, shutting out the Riverhaven streets that surround it.  Brittle leaves and dried yellow grass obscure what is left of a walkway.  The remnants of a long-abandoned child's playhouse sit forlornly in the corner of the lot."],"exits":[{"to":567,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":566,"exit":"east","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":566,"x":-40,"y":320,"z":0,"title":"Dunshade Manor, Front Lawn","descriptions":["Nothing seems to be alive in this shadow-filled yard.  Large skeletal trees loom over the path, their dry brown leaves swirling and skittering in drifting patterns across the barren lawn.  The walkway's paving stones are broken or missing in random spots, and occasionally a large flat stone protrudes upright, as if it had been heaved up out of the ground.  A large two-story building squats at the end of the yard, the flared eaves of its tiled roof hanging over a wide front porch."],"exits":[{"to":565,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":599,"exit":"go","move":"go front porch"},{"to":37,"exit":"go","move":"go iron gate"}]},
  {"id":567,"x":-120,"y":260,"z":0,"title":"Dunshade Manor, Side Yard","descriptions":["Twisted brambles and thick spiney vines have enveloped the tall iron fence, creating a wall of prickly barbs that are topped by the fence's pointed spearheads.  The manor house looms over the side yard, pressing it up against the thorny wall.  Completely cut off from the light of day, even the withered brown grass has abandoned this part of the lawn."],"exits":[{"to":568,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":565,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":568,"x":-120,"y":200,"z":0,"title":"Dunshade Manor, Flower Garden","descriptions":["A colorful mosaic fountain stands in the center of a garden of trellised rhododendrons.  The flowers grow wild and abundant, but their once-brilliant colors have a sickly pale hue, and their leaves are mottled with brown spots.  Water still splashes into the basin of the fountain, adding a welcome melody to the gloomy atmosphere."],"exits":[{"to":569,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":567,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":569,"x":-40,"y":200,"z":0,"title":"Dunshade Manor, Back Lawn","descriptions":["A wide expanse of tall grasses and weeds grows here, apparently untended for years.  To the south the two-story manor house towers above you, abandoned and desolate, it's windows empty like the blank stare of a corpse.  The melodic sound of running water comes from the west, strangely soothing in this forsaken place.  You catch a glimpse of something white hidden in the grass."],"exits":[{"to":570,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":571,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":568,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":570,"x":0,"y":200,"z":0,"title":"Dunshade Manor, Back Lawn","descriptions":["A large pillared mausoleum stands in a desolate section of the lawn.  The grass here is dry and brown and adorned with dead leaves and broken twigs.  An old floral wreath of long-dead chrysanthemums rests on a stand next to the open mausoleum."],"exits":[{"to":569,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":572,"exit":"go","move":"go mausoleum"}]},
  {"id":571,"x":-40,"y":220,"z":0,"title":"Dunshade Manor, Terrace","descriptions":["Limestone slabs fit neatly together to form a smooth white floor for this terrace.  Myrtle and germander topiaries grow in large white ceramic planters that border the area -- perhaps once neatly trimmed and decorative, they now grow wild and unruly.  Wrought-iron chairs lay toppled around a matching table."],"exits":[{"to":569,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":601,"exit":"go","move":"go glass doors"}]},
  {"id":572,"x":20,"y":200,"z":0,"title":"Dunshade Manor, Family Crypt","descriptions":["A heavy feeling of dark despair hangs over this mausoleum like a shroud.  The thick layer of dust on the floor and the cobwebs filling the upper corners of the crypt indicate that very few mourners visit the Dunshades' resting place.  Three sealed vaults bear the names Byron, Tatia and Laurel on their faces."],"exits":[{"to":570,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":573,"exit":"go","move":"go brass grate"}]},
  {"id":573,"x":40,"y":180,"z":0,"title":"Dunshade Manor, Catacombs","descriptions":["A cool breeze refreshes the air, and dust casts a gentle radiance throughout the tunnel as it is lifted and floats about in the dim light.  An opening above in the shadows is just large enough for a small animal to peer through."],"exits":[{"to":577,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":574,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":578,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":574,"x":80,"y":220,"z":0,"title":"Dunshade Manor, Catacombs","descriptions":["Darkness drapes itself around the room, parting only for the dimly lit torches.  The roughly excavated, uneven floor makes forward movement difficult.  Scraping sounds come from the black corners and the air hangs heavily around you."],"exits":[{"to":575,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":573,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":575,"x":100,"y":220,"z":0,"title":"Dunshade Manor, Catacombs","descriptions":["Moisture oozes from the rough tunnel walls, forming stagnant pools on the ground.  The rancid smell of decaying rodents fills the air and rotting pelts lay partially submerged on the uneven ground."],"exits":[{"to":576,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":574,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":576,"x":100,"y":160,"z":0,"title":"Dunshade Manor, Catacombs","descriptions":["As the tunnel narrows, chittering rodents scurry about in the darkness, their eyes taking on an eerie glow as they dart back and forth."],"exits":[{"to":575,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":577,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":577,"x":80,"y":140,"z":0,"title":"Dunshade Manor, Catacombs","descriptions":["A family arcosolium has been dug out of the east wall, lined in marble and sealed with an ornately carved slab of alabaster.  Small animal bones have been mortared in a herringbone pattern on the walls of the cavern, set with glowing opals and sparkling diamonds casting flashes of light dancing throughout the room."],"exits":[{"to":581,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":576,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":573,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":578,"x":20,"y":160,"z":0,"title":"Dunshade Manor, Catacombs","descriptions":["The light from the torches casts an erie reflection on the slick dark tunnel walls.  Footprints hug the walls working their way around the murky puddles in the uneven tunnel floor.  A dark woolen mitten lies partially hidden by a well-worn leather boot pushed up against the wall."],"exits":[{"to":573,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":579,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":579,"x":0,"y":160,"z":0,"title":"Dunshade Manor, Catacombs","descriptions":["Widening as it curves north, the tunnel fills with stale air.  Light dims but the glistening walls still reflect the tiny torch flame as it wavers.  A family of rats scurry across the floor and disappears."],"exits":[{"to":580,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":578,"exit":"east","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":580,"x":0,"y":140,"z":0,"title":"Dunshade Manor, Catacombs","descriptions":["The tunnel comes to an abrupt end against a large granite boulder that blocks further passage.  A pile of twigs, straw and dried grass form a damp nest in the deepening shadows."],"exits":[{"to":579,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":581,"x":80,"y":120,"z":0,"title":"Dunshade Manor, Catacombs","descriptions":["Huge tree roots protrude through the earthen roof of the narrow tunnel and light filters down through a layer of leaves covering the openings where the roots have pulled away from the hard-packed dirt.  A rabbit's eyes glow red momentarily as he peers around before scampering up the roots and out into the open air."],"exits":[{"to":582,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":577,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":582,"x":80,"y":100,"z":0,"title":"Dunshade Manor, Catacombs","descriptions":["The damp ground slopes gently downward under the once opulent manor house, now falling to ruins.  Darkness is broken by scattered torches, burning brightly in corroded sconces hanging along the uneven wall."],"exits":[{"to":581,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":583,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":583,"x":60,"y":100,"z":0,"title":"Dunshade Manor, Catacombs","descriptions":["Hidden in the secret tunnels beneath the manor house, loculi have been cut in neat rows on each side of the gallery.  Several marble slabs have been stacked against one wall and an oil lamp sits on a wooden crate next to a small pillow and bedraggled blanket."],"exits":[{"to":582,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":584,"exit":"go","move":"go shadows"}]},
  {"id":584,"x":40,"y":100,"z":0,"title":"Dunshade Manor, Underground Passage","descriptions":["The walls glisten with moisture in the murky light and a rugged plank boardwalk has been constructed to cover the soggy ground that terminates abruptly against an unyielding slab of granite."],"exits":[{"to":585,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":583,"exit":"go","move":"go opening"}]},
  {"id":585,"x":20,"y":120,"z":0,"title":"Dunshade Manor, Narrow Underground Passage","descriptions":["The tunnel continues through a pile of rubble, intermingled with small decayed animal bones and aged mining inplements, dusty and dilapidated.  A broken lantern has been tossed aside carelessly and clear moisture drips off the walls.  A blood-stained slender dagger, frozen in place by time, has been cast aside next to a stagnant pool in the center of the room."],"exits":[{"to":584,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":586,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":586,"x":0,"y":120,"z":0,"title":"Dunshade Manor, Narrow Underground Passage","descriptions":["A smattering of ores imbedded in the walls cause small flashes of light to dance throughout the room.  A small mound of blackened stones are arranged to form a ring on a flat area near a pile of heavy snowbeast pelts forming a shelter from the cruel cold."],"exits":[{"to":585,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":587,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":587,"x":-20,"y":120,"z":0,"title":"Dunshade Manor, Underground Passage","descriptions":["Deep grooves run along the ground as if something weighty had been dragged through the chilly passage.  Debris from the excavation is piled up against the walls, along with several picks and shovels, darkened with age, and a scattering of small mammal bones."],"exits":[{"to":590,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":586,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":588,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":588,"x":-40,"y":120,"z":0,"title":"Dunshade Manor, Underground Passage","descriptions":["Dark and dreary, a secreted underground passage has been dug out of the damp ground below the manor, its purpose hidden.  The cragged walls narrow at the low ceiling and are barely visible in the dim light from the torches set in crude sconces."],"exits":[{"to":587,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":589,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":589,"x":-60,"y":120,"z":0,"title":"Dunshade Manor, Root Cellar","descriptions":["At the bottom of some rickety, steep stairs, shelves line three walls of the cellar, empty now except for some long forgotten jars of unidentifiable food.  Sacks of ground wheat flour are stacked near a dark shadow, under the stairs, soiled now and covered by a thick layer of grey dust."],"exits":[{"to":588,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":592,"exit":"climb","move":"climb stairs"}]},
  {"id":590,"x":-20,"y":100,"z":0,"title":"Dunshade Manor, Underground Passage","descriptions":["Surplus planks have been stacked up in one corner as the passage slopes in a gentle incline toward an ornately carved door.  Some type of small rodent has nested in a solitary overcoat tossed carelessly near a draft of warm air coming in from the north."],"exits":[{"to":587,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":591,"exit":"go","move":"go doo"}]},
  {"id":591,"x":-20,"y":80,"z":0,"title":"Dunshade Manor, Underground Passage","descriptions":["This house, it is said, was inhabited by a crazy man, but only whispers spread the tale.  A deep chill fills the room, unsettling and icy.  The air is strangely fresh and the room seems cared for by an unseen source.  A magnificent Elven carpet covers the hardwood floor, its colors only slightly dulled by age, and the walls of soft green silk hold torch sconces illuminating the opulent room.  An overstuffed burgundy leather chair faces a large portrait of the Dunshade family in a gilt frame."],"exits":[{"to":590,"exit":"go","move":"go door"}]},
  {"id":592,"x":-80,"y":120,"z":0,"title":"Dunshade Manor, Dark Landing","descriptions":["A small, rickety plank landing overlooks a dark root cellar with a dirt floor.  The steep stairs, treacherous in the dim lighting sway slightly from side to side as they descend into the small room.  Twisted and broken, the handrail lies on the cellar floor making movement on the stairs even more hazardous."],"exits":[{"to":593,"exit":"go","move":"go trapdoor"}]},
  {"id":593,"x":-80,"y":260,"z":0,"title":"Dunshade Manor, Kitchen","descriptions":["The spacious kitchen looks as if a whirlwind has struck it!  The festively handpainted black and white checkered floor is strewn with shattered bits of milk pitchers, wine jugs and mustard pots laying amongst bread baskets and dish towels.  A heavy marble-topped table lays on its side, and a lone unbroken vase rests against it holding a bunch of dried up sunflowers.  The only thing still in place is a wallboard holding a collection of bone-handled knives."],"exits":[{"to":594,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":594,"x":-80,"y":280,"z":0,"title":"Dunshade Manor, Dining Room","descriptions":["Stylized floral motifs in contrasting burgundies and deep blues enhance each other on the heavy draped windows and wallpaper.  A shallow alcove filling the far wall displays a painted mural of a large castle.  Black walnut chairs are placed haphazardly around the enormous carved table, as if their occupants had only just abandoned them in a rush.  This impression is emphasized by the place settings on the table that still contain dried-up, half-eaten servings of a meal."],"exits":[{"to":593,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":595,"exit":"east","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":595,"x":-60,"y":280,"z":0,"title":"Dunshade Manor, Passage","descriptions":["The walls along the wide passageway are covered with a textured silken fabric of the palest creamy beige.  Fluted glass wall sconces are placed at regular intervals along the hall."],"exits":[{"to":596,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":594,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":596,"x":-40,"y":280,"z":0,"title":"Dunshade Manor, Vestibule","descriptions":["A powerful musty odor permeates the interior of the manor, and the cool air is more unpleasantly dank than refreshing.  The long vestibule has a grey quarry-tiled floor that is littered with debris and dust.  Glazed urns sit in recessed niches in the walls, most of them shattered into small shards."],"exits":[{"to":600,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":597,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":595,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":599,"exit":"go","move":"go double doors"}]},
  {"id":597,"x":-20,"y":280,"z":0,"title":"Dunshade Manor, Passage","descriptions":["The walls along the wide passageway are covered with a textured silken fabric of a muted pale green.  Fluted glass wall sconces are placed at regular intervals along the hall."],"exits":[{"to":598,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":596,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":598,"x":0,"y":280,"z":0,"title":"Dunshade Manor, Study","descriptions":["This room has a strong masculine feel to it.  Rich burgundies and deep forest greens blend together in the plaid upholstery that covers a large roll-arm sofa and wing chair.  The chair is angled to face a painted portrait, as if the owner spent many hours contemplating it.  A massive mahogany ledger hutch fills one wall of the study."],"exits":[{"to":597,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":599,"x":-40,"y":300,"z":0,"title":"Dunshade Manor, Porch","descriptions":["This long porch fronts the manor house, and at one time, it must have been a pleasant place to sit and enjoy a summer's evening.  A broken porch swing creaks and groans loudly whenever a breeze sways it.  Imposingly tall double doors lead into the house."],"exits":[{"to":566,"exit":"go","move":"go front lawn"},{"to":596,"exit":"go","move":"go double doors"}]},
  {"id":600,"x":-40,"y":260,"z":0,"title":"Dunshade Manor, Corridor","descriptions":["The pale grey quarry tiles that cover the floor have been broken into pieces, as if hacked by a violently swung axe.  A single handprint marks the otherwise bare walls."],"exits":[{"to":601,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":596,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":602,"exit":"climb","move":"climb marble staircase"}]},
  {"id":601,"x":-40,"y":240,"z":0,"title":"Dunshade Manor, Reception Room","descriptions":["This room was evidently once the site of entertainment on a grand scale.  The high vaulted ceiling supports several bell-shaped crystal chandeliers that are still intact.  A thick layer of dust covers the broad expanse of acanth wood floor, dulling its natural sheen.  Matching ornate sofas line the wall, many of them overturned or split open.  A delicately carved frieze borders the room, just below the ceiling."],"exits":[{"to":600,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":571,"exit":"go","move":"go glass doors"}]},
  {"id":602,"x":60,"y":260,"z":0,"title":"Dunshade Manor, Balcony","descriptions":["A dense layer of grime obscures the gloss of the marble balustrade and floor of the balcony.  Slightly overhead and to the north of you several chandeliers, their crystals forming elegant bell shapes, are suspended over the spacious reception room.  A long hallway leads south toward the family bedrooms."],"exits":[{"to":603,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":600,"exit":"climb","move":"climb marble staircase"}]},
  {"id":603,"x":60,"y":280,"z":0,"title":"Dunshade Manor, Hallway","descriptions":["A fancifully crafted hall runner of deep green yarn covers the floor here, bordered with twisting vines and branches that are inhabited by exotic birds and mythical animals.  Some of the glass wall sconces have been shattered, and cream-colored shards lay embedded in the rug."],"exits":[{"to":602,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":608,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":604,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":604,"x":60,"y":300,"z":0,"title":"Dunshade Manor, Hallway","descriptions":["Gracefully twining vines and branches border the deep green hall runner that covers the hardwood floor.  Further to the north, you can see the rug's design become more elaborate.  Sconces of cloudy, cream-hued glass are spaced at regular intervals along the pale green silk-covered walls.  On one section of the wall, the silk has been ripped to shreds, seemingly by frenzied fingernails."],"exits":[{"to":603,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":605,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":606,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":605,"x":60,"y":320,"z":0,"title":"Dunshade Manor, Hall's End","descriptions":["Bare hardwood planks cover the floor at the hallway's end, the polished sheen dulled by a thick layer of dust and wood chips.  Deep gouges mar the surface of the oak planks.  A set of steep stairs leads up to the manor house's attic."],"exits":[{"to":604,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":610,"exit":"climb","move":"climb steep stairs"}]},
  {"id":606,"x":40,"y":300,"z":0,"title":"Dunshade Manor, Master Bedroom","descriptions":["An exquisitely carved bedstead dominates the cherrywood-paneled room, its thick down mattress covered with an appliqued wedding quilt.  Two pairs of slippers sit at the foot of the bed -- one worn and masculine, the other delicate and pink.  A couple of cozy armchairs sit on either side of a stately lamp, angled toward each other, a pleasant place for a quiet late-night conversation.  Shattered pieces of glassware are strewn across the top of a lemonwood dresser."],"exits":[{"to":607,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":604,"exit":"east","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":607,"x":40,"y":280,"z":0,"title":"Dunshade Manor, Dressing Room","descriptions":["A subtle floral pattern on beige and cream-colored silk covers the walls of this dressing area.  Piles of crumpled clothing lay discarded around the floor and across a faded rose-colored chaise lounge.  A silk paneled changing screen hides the far end of the room from sight."],"exits":[{"to":606,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":609,"exit":"go","move":"go changing screen"}]},
  {"id":608,"x":80,"y":280,"z":0,"title":"Dunshade Manor, Laurel's Bedroom","descriptions":["Colorfully-painted tulips grow up the walls of this enchanting room.  A miniature sleigh bed is covered with an embroidered coverlet that repeats the floral motif of the walls.  A table set next to the window displays a glassware menagerie, the jewel-like colors of the animals are somber and dulled from the dim light filtering through the grime-coated window."],"exits":[{"to":603,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":609,"x":20,"y":280,"z":0,"title":"Dunshade Manor, Changing Room","descriptions":["The silk-covered walls are covered with numerous reddish-brown splatters that are clotted with flecks of greyish tissue.  In the far corner, the splotches are smeared together, as if something pressed against them and dragged them down to the floor, where the wood planks are discolored with a dark pool of a stain."],"exits":[{"to":607,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":610,"x":140,"y":320,"z":0,"title":"Dunshade Manor, Attic","descriptions":["A staircase emerges into a narrow, roughly-constructed attic, with bare hardwood floors and worm-eaten timbers to hold the oddly angled roof in place.  An unsettling silence hangs in the air, accompanied by a deep chill that cuts to the bone and turns breath to curlicues of frost.  Pale shafts of light from below cast the attic in deep, shifting shadows, creating the illusion that the tilting walls and jagged beams stretch almost endlessly north, vanishing into darkness."],"exits":[{"to":611,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":605,"exit":"climb","move":"climb staircase"}]},
  {"id":611,"x":140,"y":300,"z":0,"title":"Dunshade Manor, South Attic","descriptions":["The icy air is stifled with choking clouds of dust, as the attic twists and bends like the work of a mad architect.  Shadows dance across every surface and fill every corner, their strange wavering making the walls seem to slowly close in, like the maw of a great beast.  To the north, the bleak light from the staircase dwindles to nothingness.  There is a way around the standing timber-columns to the east, where there seems to be a sort of storage loft."],"exits":[{"to":613,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":612,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":610,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":612,"x":160,"y":300,"z":0,"title":"Dunshade Manor, Loft Ladder","descriptions":["Beneath the soaring ceiling, invisible in the darkness, a rickety old ladder against the wall leads to a loft above.  The rungs of the metal ladder are coated with a thick blue-black frost, the attic growing colder by the moment despite the lack of a draft, a breeze or anything to break the eerie stillness."],"exits":[{"to":611,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":619,"exit":"climb","move":"climb metal ladder"}]},
  {"id":613,"x":140,"y":280,"z":0,"title":"Dunshade Manor, Middle of Attic","descriptions":["This is the midpoint of the attic, but with the north and south ends lost in shadow and the ceiling timbers reeling like a dance of vertigo, it is impossible to tell whether distance and space hold any meaning in this cold realm.  Unfinished wooden partitions segregate a space to the west, where a boarded-up window once overlooked the lawns far below."],"exits":[{"to":615,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":611,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":614,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":614,"x":120,"y":280,"z":0,"title":"Dunshade Manor, West Window","descriptions":["Illuminated by a pale shaft of light, a single row of heavy footprints track through the thick dust on the floorboards. They run from the southern stairs to a grimy window on the western wall, where they abruptly stop.  The floor inside the prints is spotless, near polished, as if the dust that covers everything else is afraid to mar the impression."],"exits":[{"to":613,"exit":"east","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":615,"x":140,"y":260,"z":0,"title":"Dunshade Manor, Low Arch","descriptions":["The ceiling rafters dip perilously low here as the roof veers straight down then back up again at a jagged angle.  The attic grows ever colder as one approaches the north end, and the silence of the room has become a near-tangible thing."],"exits":[{"to":616,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":613,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":616,"x":140,"y":240,"z":0,"title":"Dunshade Manor, North Attic","descriptions":["Dust particles hang motionlessly in the frigid air at the north end of this long attic, where makeshift partitions were put up to create open storage spaces against the east and west walls.  What lurks there now is concealed by impenetrable shadow, appearing to writhe as if a blanket of snakes slither just beneath the blanket of darkness."],"exits":[{"to":618,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":615,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":617,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":617,"x":120,"y":240,"z":0,"title":"Dunshade Manor, West Storage","descriptions":["A few broken chairs and a rusted-shut trunk are piled in the corner of this lonely alcove, coated by a layer of frozen dust.  Only the shadows move here, wavering mockingly at the edge of vision."],"exits":[{"to":616,"exit":"east","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":618,"x":160,"y":240,"z":0,"title":"Dunshade Manor, East Storage","descriptions":["Even in the thick of it, there is no way to break through the darkness pooled in this corner, with its cold shadows entwining like a whirlpool of pain and despair.  Dust coats the floor like a frozen river, a testament to the powers of time and decay.  The only exit is back to the west, just a little closer to the light."],"exits":[{"to":616,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":619,"x":180,"y":300,"z":0,"title":"Dunshade Manor, Storage Loft","descriptions":["Moldy crates and discarded linens are piled along the narrow planks of this tiny loft, the rotted wood creaking underfoot and threatening to give way at any moment.  While an ice-coated ladder leads down to the relative safety of the attic floor, a precarious stretch of timber is unblocked enough to allow access to the north end of the loft -- if the footing holds."],"exits":[{"to":620,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":612,"exit":"climb","move":"climb metal ladder"}]},
  {"id":620,"x":180,"y":280,"z":0,"title":"Dunshade Manor, Edge of Loft","descriptions":["Though it can't be more than ten feet above the attic floor, the unprotected edge of the loft seems to lean over a dizzying abyss.  A broken porcelain doll lies abandoned atop a jumble of rusted trunks, a sad reminder of the child who once played here."],"exits":[{"to":619,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":621,"x":10,"y":810,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Smugglers' Passage","descriptions":["The air grows lighter, scented with the freshness of woodlands and the outdoors.  Brick, dark earth, and stone give way to clay and timbers as the passage angles to meet a trapdoor secured between what appears to be some large blocks of dark-veined marble."],"exits":[{"to":622,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":632,"exit":"go","move":"go trapdoor"}]},
  {"id":622,"x":10,"y":830,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Smugglers' Passage","descriptions":["Rotting beams of wood brace this section of the tunnel where its brick walls have cracked and eroded from the constant pressure of the surrounding earth.  An occasional faint scent of pine is carried on swirls of air that play along the passageway."],"exits":[{"to":621,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":623,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":623,"x":-10,"y":850,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Smugglers' Passage","descriptions":["Fine cobblestones line this section of the passage, a touch of unexpected elegance within the tunnel's rough confines.  Perhaps borrowed from some wealthy merchant, the polished stones gleam softly in the subdued light and lead deeper into the gloom."],"exits":[{"to":622,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":624,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":624,"x":-10,"y":870,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Smugglers' Passage","descriptions":["Splintered crates litter the floor, the wreckage of some hurried attempt to move what was probably illicit merchandise.  A pile of bricks has been neatly stacked along one wall in preparation for use in future tunnel repairs."],"exits":[{"to":623,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":625,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":625,"x":-10,"y":890,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Smugglers' Passage","descriptions":["Groundwater has encroached here to form stagnant pools along the walls, making the air chill and heavy.  Patches of mortar gleam pale against brick and stone, silent evidence that someone is determined to maintain the passageway."],"exits":[{"to":624,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":626,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":626,"x":-30,"y":910,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Smugglers' Passage","descriptions":["The tight passageway levels off deep beneath the streets of Riverhaven.  Patches of algae, sustained by the dank air, cloak the stone floor and make each step risky.  Even the faintest sounds are amplified by the close confines of the tunnel, reverberating hauntingly into its depths and creating eerie echoes that are quickly absorbed by earthen walls."],"exits":[{"to":625,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":627,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":627,"x":-50,"y":930,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Smugglers' Passage","descriptions":["Cool and damp, the air holds a faint pungent odor emanating from somewhere beyond, though it may be rising from the clumps of strange pale fungus that sprout from the tunnel walls.  A small rivulet of water has worn a shallow channel in the floor, green with a slick coat of algae."],"exits":[{"to":626,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":628,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":628,"x":-70,"y":950,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Smugglers' Passage","descriptions":["Winding and twisting beneath the foundations of Riverhaven's finer establishments, the tunnel is neatly bricked and mortared, and a tall ladder has been carefully bolted into the wall.  Water seeping from the surface above has begun to erode the stonework, as evidenced by the mineralized deposits that are collecting on the ceiling."],"exits":[{"to":627,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":629,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":0,"exit":"climb","move":"climb ladder"}]},
  {"id":629,"x":-70,"y":970,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Smugglers' Passage","descriptions":["Footsteps, voices, and the clatter of workcarts filter through the insulating earth and brick of the tunnel as reminders of the world above.  Someone is careful to maintain this place -- clean straw has been thrown on the floor to absorb moisture and muffle the sound of passage."],"exits":[{"to":628,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":630,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}]},
  {"id":630,"x":-50,"y":990,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Smugglers' Passage","descriptions":["A thick layer of refuse aids in dampening most noises of passage here, and probably muffles the sound of more violent activity, as well.  It appears that some of the less than chivalrous inhabitants of Riverhaven have used this hidden place for settling their disputes -- the bones of some hapless soul have been left untouched, perhaps as a reminder that even the most wary are never wary enough."],"exits":[{"to":631,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":629,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":631,"x":-30,"y":1010,"z":0,"title":"Riverhaven, Smugglers' Passage","descriptions":["Winding beneath the businesses of Riverhaven, this dank tunnel must be home to all manner of vermin, as evidenced by scattered droppings and shredded piles of rags.  Walls shored up with brick are covered by a thick layer of moss and algae, a result of the constant seepage of briny water."],"exits":[{"to":630,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":0,"exit":"go","move":"go storage crates"}]},
  {"id":632,"x":10,"y":790,"z":0,"title":"Wildlands, Meandering Path","descriptions":["Two piles of ruined stones set to either side of the path look ancient beyond measure.  Between them, oversized brickwork shows through the dust and dirt of ages as the original form this trail now takes.  A dense stand of woods looms nearby, its presence dominating the landscape.  Bird-song drifts from within those green confines, lessening their air of solemnity."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":0,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}],"linksTo":"Map32_Riverhaven_North_Gate.xml"}
 ],
